x_comment(x_SubordinateRoleDenotingFunction,"A great many #$OrganizationalPositions have associated with\nthem one or more 'subordinate' positions, often prefaced with terms\nlike 'deputy', 'assistant', or 'vice'.  The common characteristic of\nall of these 'subordinate' roles, is that the individual who plays the\n'subordinate' role in an organization is a direct subordinate of the\nperson who plays the 'superior' role.\n#$SubordinateRoleDenotingFunction and its instances have been set up\nto facilitate reification of these subordinate roles on the fly with\nthe aim of speeding cyclification.  Each instance of this collection\nis an #$IndividualDenotingFunction which takes an\n#$OrganizationalPosition as its argument and returns an instance of\n#$OrganizationalPosition that is subordinate to the first.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6b4c).
