x_comment(x_SuperhumanAct,"Actions which, when performed by humans, exhibit a form of 'divine efficacy', or seem to be those of a superhuman entity of extraordinary physical or mental prowess. The actions of a #$Superman, or the miracles of those in the collection #$Saint, or the actions of other instances of #$DivineBeing which are clearly beyond the ability of human beings, constitute a #$SuperhumanAct. So, #$Flying when performed by a human unaided by a flying machine can be considered a superhuman act.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6b61).
