x_comment(x_IndustrialMusic,"A specialization of #$RockMusic, #$IndustrialMusic started as a British\n\n   underground movement in the late 1970s and early 1980s.  It combined a Punk attitude\n\n   with a sort of Avant Garde aesthetic.  The music was largely electronically created,\n\n   repetitive, often trance-like, and sometimes dissonent.  Toward the late 1980s,\n\n   #$IndustrialMusic became on the whole more rythmic and danceable, and consequently,\n\n   more popular.  Influential practitioners of this style include #$ThrobbingGristle-MusicGroup, #$CabaretVoltaire-MusicGroup, #$EinsturzendeNeubauten-MusicGroup, and #$NineInchNails-MusicGroup.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6ba0).
