x_comment(x_PossibleIdentificationCondition,"This is the collection of all collections which can be seen as representing\n\ncriteria one might use to identify some instance of #$TemporalThing. One can\n\nthink of the non-extensional, (implicit) definitional aspects of these collections\n\nas representing these criteria. Since #$Collections are non-extensional, they are\n\nthe sorts of things which can aptly fill #$opaqueArgument places. For example,\n\nan agent might be looking for something she conceptualizes as a bottle of aspirin\n\nbut not as a bottle of #$AcetylsalicylicAcid. The collections defined by these\n\ntwo criteria are #$coExtensional but distinct. The former but not the latter would\n\nrepresent the #$PossibleIdentificationCondition employed by the agent.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6bc6).
