x_comment(x_costOfAction,"(#$costOfAction ACT AGENT PROP SUBJ-ATTR) holds iff the AGENT's\n\nevaluation of the desirability of PROP, the outcome of ACT, corresponds to\n\nSUBJ-ATTR. In other words, #$costOfAction expresses the agent's judgment\n\nabout whether the action is worth the effort of performing it. Such a judgment is\n\nevaluative, because it depends upon the agent's assignment of preferences to the\n\nexpected outcome of the action. Notice that, given the way\n\n#$outcomeOfAction is defined, PROP involves a specification of all\n\nvalue-relevant features of the result of ACT.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6c38).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526a6c38,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
