x_comment(x_NewsFn,"#$NewsFn takes as argument any thing and returns the collection of all mentions of that thing in the news.  For example, (#$NewsFn #$Dog) returns all news involving dogs, and (#$NewsFn #$JohnKennedy) returns all news about John F. Kennedy.  Note that determination of what properly belongs in such a set is time-relative -- what is currently news probably will not be news two years from now.  This function is therefore of limited use outside of applications in which it triggers some time-stamped action.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6c42).
