x_comment('x_Region-Underspecified',"The collection of regions/areas, tangible or otherwise, which are\ntypically conceptualized by human beings for purposes of common-sense\nreasoning as spatial regions. This collection thus includes tangible\n#$GeographicalRegions such as #$Ireland-TheIsland, as well as metaphoric\nregions such as #$FieldOfStudy. Instances of #$Region-Underspecified\ndiffer from non-regional #$Location-Underspecified in that they\npossess some underspecified correlate of the notion of 'area' and\n'spatial extent'. A #$Location-Underspecified may be a point in some\nabstract, metaphorical or physical space, whereas instances of \n#$Region-Underspecified can be conceptualized as possessing area in\nsuch a space.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6c47).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526a6c47,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
