x_comment('x_LookingForSomething-Definite',"The collection of instances of #$LookingForAThingOrTypeOfThing wherein some #$IntelligentAgent is looking for a particular thing.  The agent might have consciously in mind one or more descriptions of the thing s/he is seeking or, if not, could at least be prompted to produce such descriptions.  Some of these descriptions will express properties the seeker would take to be criterial of success in the sense that s/he could not conceive of a case in which both (i) s/he successfully finds the object and (ii) the object s/he finds lacks any of those properties. The conjunction of these criterial properties will correspond to the instance of #$PossibleIdentificationCondition that is associated with the search (see #$searchCriterion-Definite).  What makes an instance of #$LookingForAThingOrTypeOfThing an instance of #$LookingForSomething-Definite is that the agent believes that exactly one object has this conjunction of criterial properties, namely the particular object s/he seeks.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6c66).
