x_comment(x_ComputerAIS,"A specialization of #$AbstractInformationStructure.  Each instance of #$ComputerAIS is the abstract information structure of an abstract work whose instantiation in computer memory is intended to have meaning. Important specializations include #$ComputerFile-AIS, #$ComputerCode, and #$ComputerProgram-CWIS.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6cc8).
