x_comment(x_equiv,"A #$LogicalConnective that represents bi-directional implication in #$CycL.  It takes two arguments, each of which must be an instance of #$ELSentence-Assertible. (#$equiv FORMULA-1 FORMULA-2) means that FORMULA-1 is true precisely when FORMULA-2 is true; in other words, FORMULA-1 is true if and only if FORMULA-2 is true.  (An EL #$equiv formula is translated during canonicalization into an equivalent, less compact, conjunction of #$implies formulas.) See also the predicate #$sentenceEquiv.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6ccc).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526a6ccc,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
