x_comment(x_PoliticalOrganizationsFn,"#$PoliticalOrganizationsFn takes as argument any #$GeopoliticalEntity and returns the collection of all instances of #$PoliticalOrganization existing at least partially within the territory of that GeopoliticalEntity.  For instance, (#$PoliticalOrganizationsFn #$CzechRepublic) returns the collection of all PoliticalOrganizations existing within the Czech Republic, including political parties like the ODS and CSSD, political advocacy groups, and any other organizations of a principally political nature existing in that country.  Also included would be organizations like #$AmnestyInternational which are international in scope but have Czech branches.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6ccd).
