x_comment(x_productionCapacity,"The predicate #$productionCapacity states a producer's \n\ngreatest possible rate of production\n\nfor a given product. The second argument to #$productionCapacity\n\nmust be a #$ProductType that is a specialization of #$PartiallyTangibleProduct.  The third argument must be a #$Rate.\n\nThe producer, the first argument, may be an industry (as in\n\n'The production capacity of the Algerian oil industry is 529 million barrels of petroleum\n\nper year'), a given factory (as in 'This plant can produce up to 12,000 tires per day'),\n\nor a region ('The maple-syrup production capacity for the state of Maine is \n\n1,000 gallons per month').") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6cd3).
