x_comment(x_typeForString,"This predicate relates a type of character-string\n\n  token to the abstract character-string that all instances \n\n  of the type represent.  (#$typeForString TYPE STRING) \n\n  means that TYPE is the collection of all character-string\n\n  tokens that #$tokensString STRING.  For example, the \n\n  #$CharacterStringType consisting of all tokens of the string \n\n  'hello' is the #$typeForString for (you guessed it) 'hello'.\n\n  See also #$typeForCharacter.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6cfb).
