x_comment(x_Pope,"The collection of all #$Popes; each is the spiritual and temporal head of the #$RomanCatholicChurch and of the #$HolySee, political ruler of the #$VaticanCity, bishop [#$Bishop-Clerical] of Rome, Italy, Prince over all christian Princes, and vice-regent of #$JesusChrist on earth.  Each #$Pope, in modern times, is elected by the College of Cardinals in the #$SistineChapel, and rules until death.  (There are other popes, such as the #$CopticPopes, that are not included in this collection.)  Certain historical popes are now held to have been antipopes.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6d11).
