x_comment(x_findAnalogs,"(#$findAnalogs ?Num ?Src-Mt ?Src ?Tgt-Mt ?Tgt) causes ?Tgt to become successively bound to the ?Num best analogs (according to structure-mapping metrics) for the source concept ?Src as defined source domain microtheory ?Src-Mt in the target domain ?Tgt-Mt.  That is, find the ?Tgt-Mt equivalent of ?Src as it is defined in ?Src-Mt. Example: (#$findAnalogs 4 #$DesertShieldMt  #$Iraq #$Y1Phase2-AllStagesMt ?What) should cause ?What to be bound to Iran and 3 other values. See also #$findAnalog, #$structureMaps and #$structureDiffs.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6d16).
