x_comment(x_TCWATMRVignetteMicrotheory,"Each element of #$TCWATMRVignetteMicrotheory represents at\n\nmost one of the vignettes contained in\n\n#$TeachingChildrenWithAutismToMindRead-TheBook.  Each one of the\n\napproximately 100 vignettes in the book corresponds to a simple\n\nscenario described with one or two english sentences as well as a hand\n\ndrawn cartoon-like picture.  Exercises about feelings or thoughts of\n\nthe characters in the scenario follow each vignette.  The vignettes\n\nplus the exercises are intended to teach children with autism about\n\nother people's desire, emotions, beliefs, etc.  The hope is that these\n\nscenarios will serve as a developmentally appropriate test bed from\n\nwhich to construct and validate a theory of goals and emotion which is\n\ntractable for #$Cyc.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6d41).
