x_comment('x_enablesAgentTo-Generic',"#$enablesAgentTo-Generic is a generalization of all enables-* predicates, with the exception of #$enables-ImpartsSkills. Motivation: occasionally one needs to label a broad class of events as generically `enabling', i.e., as events that enable an agent to do something in one or the other sense of enabling. This predicate should be used sparingly: When describing the enabling relation between a specific event or type of event, an agent and a specific action or type of action, one should use the specific enables-* predicate appropriate to that circumstance.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6d87).
