x_comment(x_actionPreconditions,"(#$actionPreconditions ACTION SITUATION) states that some instance of the ACTION may not be executed in a situation, and get\nthe expected effect (#$actionEffects) unless an instance of the SITUATION holds. The SITUATION is something that is subject to further\nplanning, i.e. we may take other actions prior to executing this one in order to (#$AchieveFn SITUATION) (if the\nsituation is not itself an GenericPurposefulAction) at the time that we will undertake ACTION.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6db3).
