x_comment(x_combatForceAvailableToAgentForEvent,"(combatForceAvailableToAgentForEvent AGENT EVENT N) means that N is the estimated value of the combat force of the units available to agent for carrying out EVENT. The combat force value is generally relative to some military unit which is given the value of 1. Thus, a value of .8, for instance, would mean that the unit, or units, assigned to carry out EVENT have a combat force value (see #$combatForceValueOfUnit) of .8 relative to the unit designated as the standard.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6dc3).
