x_comment(x_hasPhysicalAccess,"(#$hasPhysicalAccess PERSON OBJ) means that person PERSON has access to the individual OBJ, such that PERSON can touch or manually manipulate OBJECT. Like #$hasAccess, this predicate is true whenever a person is capable of accessing the individual involved, regardless of whether it is permitted for him or her to do so. It can return true even if (#$not (#$isa PERSON (#$AccessorFn OBJ))). Unlike #$hasAccess, #$hasPhysicalAccess is not true when PERSON is not in close spatial proximity to OBJECT. For instance, hackers have physical access to the computers on their desks, and use them to get access to other computers to which they do not have physical access.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6dc8).
