x_comment(x_changesQuantityByFraction,"This predicate specifies the fraction by which a given quantity changes in a given time period.  (#$changesQuantityByFraction TIME THING SLOT FRACTION) means that during TIME, THING's #$QuantitySlot SLOT changes by FRACTION.  TIME is a #$TemporalThing, and Fraction is a #$ScalarInterval (which may be positive or negative).  For instance, (#$changesQuantityByFraction (#$YearFn 1980) #$SaudiArabia #$oilExport (#$Percent 10)) means that in 1980, Saudi Arabia's oil export increased by 10 percent.  See also: #$changesQuantityByAmount, #$changesQuantityInDirection.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6dd4).
