x_comment(x_keFacilitationRules,"This predicate relates a cyc term to the rules asserted on it to help guide knowledge entry.  (#$keFacilitationRules TERM RULE) means that when creating instances, subcollections or asserting relations involving TERM (the RULE will indicate which of these are relevant), one should consider RULE.  This differs from #$salientAssertions in that the assertions do not define the term but simply guide knowledge entry related to the term.  Also see knowledge entry facilitation gafs such as those involving specializations of #$keRelevantPreds, #$keRelevantInverse, #$keGenlsRelevantPreds and #$keGenlsRelevantInverse.  These rules were designed for use in tools for rapid knowledge entry.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6de4).
