x_comment(x_paDisambiguatingQuestion,"A statement that the Product Advisor needs to ask the user to disambiguate\n\nprevious input.  (paDisambiguatingQuestion TEMPLATE STRING SET) means that the\n\nformula TEMPLATE is true if one of the terms in SET is substituted for\n\nthe free variable in TEMPLATE.  In addition, a user has typed in the string\n\nSTRING, which is ambiguous over SET, and the only way to disambiguate \n\nis to ask the user directly.  TEMPLATE must have exactly one free variable; each\n\nelement of SET must be an instance of CycLExpression.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6e2e).
