x_comment(x_DBKeyFunctionFn,"#$DBKeyFunctionFn is a function-denoting function.  (#$DBKeyFunctionFn . fields) denotes a function which is an instance of #$DBKeyFunction; it's #$arity is equal to the number of #$LogicalFields given as arguments to #$DBKeyFunctionFn.  The fields given as arguments should together form a key for their #$LogicalTableSchema.  The function denoted by (#$DBKeyFunctionFn . fields) is applied to values for the fields used to form it, in the order the fields were used in the expression, to return an instance of #$DBKeyObj, which uniquely identifies a row of a table.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6e3f).
