x_comment(x_TVShowTypeByFormat,"#$TVShowTypeByFormat is a collection of collections. Each element of #$TVShowTypeByFormat is a collection of instances of #$TVShow-CW that have the same format. For example, #$TVGameShow and #$VarietyShow are elements of #$TVShowTypeByFormat. The format of a #$TVShow-CW is a way of describing the distinctive manner in which #$Narrative, and the visual and audio aspects of a #$TVShow-CW are combined. For example, #$NewsShows combine shorts bits of #$Narrative with bits of audio and video clips. #$VarietyShows mix a number of #$EntertainmentPerformances by #$Artist-Performers. This collection was created to make use of a faceting of #$TVShow-CW to generate English questions to aid classification. See #$NoteAboutHowFacetAssertionsAreUsed.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6e47).
