x_comment('x_acquaintedWith-Perceptual',"The expression `(#$acquaintedWith-Perceptual AGENT THING)' means\nthat AGENT has come into causal/perceptual contact with THING so that in\nsimilar and favorable circumstances AGENT could re-identify THING. The\nqualifications on circumstances are crucial here. Being acquainted in the\npresent sense does not entail that one could determine that a very\nsimilar-looking item in the same place as the original could be determined\nnot to be the original item, that one could re-identify by touch in a\ndark room an item one had become acquainted with primarily visually, or that\none could re-identify the item were it to be presented in a different guise.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6e61).
