x_comment(x_PersonTypeByFacetedActivityType,"#$PersonTypeByFacetedActivityType is a collection of collections. Each element is an instance of #$PersonTypeByActivity that itself has been faceted in at least one way. This collection, which facets #$Person,can be used to generate English questions to aid classification in a clarification dialogue. To make the interface user-friendly, the range of answers to these questions should be small. Since this collection currently (01/00) has fewer than 20 elements, it will be more useful than the faceting of #$Person by #$PersonTypeByActivity, which has over 800 instances. See #$NoteAboutHowFacetAssertionsAreUsed.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6ee9).
