x_comment(x_suppliedWithFromThrough,"(#$suppliedWithFromThrough PT1 COL PT2 PT3) means that the instance of #$PartiallyTangible PT1 is supplied with instances of the #$Collection COL from the instance of #$PartiallyTangible PT2 through the instance of #$PartiallyTangible PT3 (on their way from PT2 to PT1).  Like the predicate #$suppliedWith (q.v.), #$suppliedWithFromThrough is very general.  In various assertions PT1 might, for instance, be a #$Cell, a #$Person, a #$Business, or a #$GeographicalRegion; and likewise for PT2.  And PT3 might, for example, be a #$Hose, a #$Railway, a #$GeographicalRegion, or a #$BloodVessel.  The range of possible supplies is similarly broad.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6f12).
