x_comment(x_SpecifiedMagazineSeriesType,"A collection of collections and a subset of MediaSeriesProductType. Every instance of MagazineSeriesType is a collection of InformationBearingThings - namely magazines - subsets of which are distributed via the mass media at regular intervals. In other words, every instance of MagazineSeriesType is a collection which is itself a collection of magazines of a certain type. For example, Esquire Magazine - that is, the collection of magazines called 'Esquire', of which a subset would be, say, Esquire Magazine, May 1998 edition - is an instance of #$SpecifiedMagazineSeriesType. An instance of Esquire Magazine, May 1998 edition would be an individual copy of that particular edition. See also MediaSeriesNthFn, MediaSeriesByDateFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6f19).
