x_comment(x_rolesForEventType,"A #$MetaPredicate and a typed-specialization (see #$typedGenlPreds) of #$requiredArg1Pred (q.v.). #$rolesForEventType's two argument-places are constrained to types of events and binary role predicates, respectively.  (#$rolesForEventType EVENTTYPE ROLE) means that for any instance EVENT of EVENTTYPE, there is some participant PLAYER that plays ROLE in EVENT.  That is, (ROLE EVENT PLAYER) holds.  For example, (#$rolesForEventType #$Perceiving #$perceivedThings) means that every perceiving involves something that is perceived.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6f6f).
