x_comment(x_NationalInfrastructureReqFn,"(#$NationalInfrastructureReqFn COUNTRY) returns the collection of all products such that COUNTRY will require those products in order for its infrastructure to remain stable.  Such requisites include national highway systems and other main arteries of transportation, bridges, airports, telephone networks.  Particular countries might also feature special inclusions, eg, internet access or a canal system.  In general, a good test of whether a particular class counts as a national infrastructure requisite or not is whether it would be a plausible target of enemy action--sabotage or military attack--in wartime.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a6fbc).
