x_comment(x_emissionAmountDuring,"(#$emissionAmountDuring PT COL THING AMOUNT) means that the #$ScalarInterval AMOUNT is a measure of the amount of instances of the #$Collection COL emitted by the instance of #$PartiallyTangible PT during the temporal extent of the #$TemporalThing THING.  PT might, for example, be a #$Country or a #$Business or a #$FactoryBuilding.  THING will often be a calendar time period; but it may also be, for instance, a particular #$Event.  If AMOUNT is a #$Rate, AMOUNT indicates the average rate of emission of instances of COL by PT during the temporal extent of THING.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7044).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526a7044,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16526a7044,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part05.krf').
