x_comment(x_dutiesOfAgentInJob,"(#$dutiesOfAgentInJob AGT WORKERTYPE EVENT) means that agent AGT is \n\nobligated to perform at least some actions of type EVENT by virtue of \n\nbeing a worker of type WORKERTYPE.  The obligation may derive directly from an \n\nexplicit provision in an instance of  #$WorkAgreement for WORKERTYPE to which AGT is bound\n\nor it may stem from more general norms and institutions governing the behavior\n\nof agents of type WORKERTYPE.  The fact that AGT is an instance of WORKERTYPE\n\nmust be at least one source, however, of the duty in question, in order\n\nfor (#$dutiesOfAgentInJob AGT WORKERTYPE EVENT) to be true or taken to be true\n\nby agents within the relevant normative system.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7050).
