x_comment(x_rankAuthorizes,"(#$rankAuthorizes RANK ORGTYPE-BY-EGB ACT-TYPE ROLE) means\n\nthat a person with #$rank-Military RANK in ORGTYPE-BY-EGB is\n\n#$authorityCapableOf of playing ROLE in events of type ACT-TYPE. Also\n\nif the second argument is represented by a NAT of the form\n\n(#$OrgTypeByGeoAndBOSFn GEO-AG BOS) and it is true that\n\n(#$militaryRank-CountryAndBranchOfService PERSON RANK GEO-AG BOS),\n\nthen PERSON is #$authorityCapableOf playing ROLE in events of type\n\nACT-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7059).
