x_comment(x_ArtificialMaterial,"A collection of substances; a subcollection of #$Artifact.  An instance of #$ArtificialMaterial is a portion of artificial stuff that was intentionally made by some agent(s), such as #$Plastic or #$SweetNLow. Since #$ArtificialMaterials are intentionally produced, this class does not normally include materials which are merely #$byProducts or #$wasteProducts of an intentional process.  However, what is a by-product at one time or in one context may be a useful material that would count as an instance of #$ArtificialMaterial in another.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7068).
