x_comment(x_ValentinesCard,"The collection of #$GreetingCards that are sold for/ and or sent on/before #$ValentinesDay each year. Such cards are often send anonymously, to express love/affection/lust for another person. People in relationships are often expected to send cards to their partners. The cards celebrate #$ValentinesDay, a religious holiday that commemorates (#$SaintFn #$Valentine-TheMartyr), though the life (and martyrdom) of this #$Saint have little to do with the idea of #$ValentinesCard . It is probable that the secular holiday arose because the feast day of (#$SaintFn #$Valentine-TheMartyr) occurs close to a pagan #$Love festival.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a70ad).
