x_comment(x_nthDayTypeOfMonth,"#$nthDayTypeOfMonth is used to say that a #$CalendarDay occurs annually on a specified nth #$DayOfWeekType during a certain month.  For example, if the #$CalendarDay always falls on the third Friday in June, one would use (#$nthDayTypeOfMonth #$CalendarDay Friday 3).  The month June needs to be specified in a separate assertion.  Notice that if the day is not a #$CalendarDay, but an #$Event or #$Holiday, the predicate #$eventTypeFallsOnNthDayTypeInMonth needs to be used instead.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a70cb).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526a70cb,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
