x_comment(x_GramStainTest,"A collection of events in which a bacterial culture is\n\nstained to distinguish #$GramPositiveBacterium from\n\n#$GramNegativeBacterium.  In this test a heat-fixed smear is stained\n\nfor 1 minute with crystal violet and rinsed briefly under water.  Next\n\nthe smear is treated for 1 minute with Lugol's iodine (a solution of\n\niodine and potassium iodine in water) and rinsed again.\n\nDecolorization is attempted with a solvent, for example ethonal (95%),\n\nacetone, or iodine-acetone and immediately rinsed.  #$GramPositive\n\ncells will be violet.  The smear is then counterstained for 30 seconds\n\nwith dilute carbolfuchsin to stain #$GramNegative cells red.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a70e4).
