x_comment(x_correspondingSequences,"(#$correspondingSequences LIST1 LIST2) means that LIST1\n\nis a list of of deoxyribonucleotides and LIST2 is a corresponding\n\nsequence of ribonucleotides.  The coding\n\nsequences of ribonucleic acid molecules (see #$RNAMolecule) differ\n\nfrom the coding sequences of deoxyribonucleic acid molecules (see\n\n#$DNAMolecule) in that the nucleic acid thymine in DNA is replaced by\n\nthe ribonucleic acid uracil in RNA.  Corresponding sequences in DNA\n\nand RNA molecules are thus coding sequences that are identical, save\n\nthat where 'T' appears in the nucleic sequence, 'U' appears in the\n\nribonucleic sequence.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7138).
