x_comment(x_PopRockMusic,"A kind of popular music drawing upon the same musical elements and instruments as #$RockMusic, but in a much more digestable and in many ways less ambitious, less rebellious, less agressive and more commercially oriented and short lived form. #$PopRockMusic focuses on singing rather than instrumentals, the guitars are less distorted, the instrumental parts and the songs in general tend to be shorter than their rock counterparts, the tunes are catchier, and the lyrics are likely to be politically correct. Typical practioners of #$PopRockMusic include #$ABBA-MusicGroup, Ace of Base, Milli Vanilli, and New Kids on the Block.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7176).
