x_comment(x_MillenniaDuration,"A #$UnitOfTime function that takes one or two real numbers as arguments and returns, as its value, a comparable #$Time-Quantity attribute measured in millennia. More precisely, an expression of the form (#$MillenniaDuration NUM) denotes the (\"point-value\") #$Time-Quantity of being exactly NUM millennia in duration, and an expression of the form (#$MillenniaDuration MIN MAX) denotes the (properly interval-like) #$Time-Quantity of being at least MIN millennia and at most MAX millennia in duration.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7177).
