x_comment(x_underspecifiedLocation,"(#$underspecifiedLocation ACT LOC) states that an event ACT\noccurs relative to the #$Location-Underspecified LOC. This location may\nbe a destination (e.g., 'go to Newark' and 'go to hell') or a current\nlocation (either 'on', 'in' or 'at'). #$underspecifiedLocation is used as \nan inferential hub for more specific (though still underspecified)\npredicates such as #$to-UnderspecifiedLocation, #$at-UnderspecifiedLandmark,\n#$on-UnderspecifiedSurface and #$in-UnderspecifiedContainer, to allow rules\nto refer to 'locatives' in a general way.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a717a).
