x_comment(x_UnderspecifiedStuffType,"A collection of collections. Each element of #$UnderspecifiedStuffType is a stuff-like collection  (see #$StuffType), instances of which may bridge any of the domains of literality and metaphoricity, space and time, or physical and intangible. Each type of underspecified stuff is intensionally neutral with regard to such issues; the type exists to allow underspecification to occur at the relational level, thus releasing Natural Language (NL) semantics from the need to specify precise semantic structures when such a responsibility is essentially post-NL (i.e., one of real-world reasoning).   For a more complete explanation of underspecification, please see  the #$comment on #$UnderspecifiedCollectionType.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7182).
