x_comment(x_textConformsToGrammar,"The predicate (#$textConformsToGrammar STRING GRAMMAR SYSTEM) relates a specific text STRING to a specific #$FormalGrammar-CW GRAMMAR and claims that STRING conforms to all the constraints of GRAMMAR as defined in the #$SyntaxSpecificationSystem SYSTEM.  The text STRING is therefore 'grammatical' according to the specifications in GRAMMAR, if SYSTEM is followed.   SYSTEM often will have a specific parsing program associated with it to test whether STRING really does conform to GRAMMAR.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7184).
