x_comment(x_totalReserves,"(#$totalReserves COUNTRY PRODUCT-TYPE AMOUNT) expresses the total reserves of a organization such as a #$GeopoliticalEntity for PRODUCT-TYPE. A useful example is (#$totalReserves COUNTRY #$Petroleum-CrudeOil VOLUME). The amount of oil held in reserve has an impact on the economy of the region.  This predicate refers to the amount of PRODUCT-TYPE that is proven to exist at some time. It is often the case that estimates exceed the proven reserves, and often new sources are found so the reserves increase.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a71d5).
