x_comment(x_streetIntersectionOf,"(#$streetIntersectionOf XING\n\nSTREET AVENUE) means that XING is an intersection of STREET and AVENUE.\n\nThis predicate is not functional in its first argument because (although uncommon) it is possible for two streets to intersect with each other in more than one place.  Nor is it functional in its second or third arguments.\n\nFor example, if three streets all intersect at XING, then XING is the intersection of any two of them.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a71f1).
