x_comment(x_MultirevolutionRotation,"The #$Collection of all unidirectional #$MultirevolutionRotation movement processes, although one may stop and continue.  Clock hand motion is #$MultirevolutionRotation even if it is a continual series of small turns and pauses.  The angular position monotonically increases or decreases (modulo 360 degrees).  The final stopping position of the process need have no relationship with the starting position.  A sufficiently long time slice is also a #$MultirevolutionRotation.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a71f8).
