x_comment(x_CriticismFn,"The term `(#$CriticismFn THING)' denotes the collection of #$InformationBearingThings\n\nin which THING is criticized. THING may be an action which is criticized on\n\nethical grounds, a written work criticized on the basis of its content or style, or a field of study criticized for its assumptions or methodology. What is common to all of these is an element of finding fault. This constrasts with #$CriticismLiteraryFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7200).
