x_comment(x_compoundString,"The predicate #$compoundString expresses the relationship between a multi-word string, a part of speech, and its denotation.  (#$compoundString WORD LIST PART TERM) means that the translation of the multi-word phrase containing both WORD and the word-strings in LIST, when the part of speech is PART, is TERM.  TERM must be an element of either #$Collection or #$Individual.  If TERM is a collection, the semantic meaning of TERM is (#$isa :noun TERM).  If TERM is an individual object, the semantic meaning of TERM is (#$equals :noun TERM).  See also #$multiWordString, #$multiWordSemTrans, and #$compoundVerbSemTrans.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7277).
