x_comment(x_MediaSeriesProductType,"A collection of collections; a subset of #$ExistingObjectType.  Every\ninstance of #$MediaSeriesProductType is a collection of\n#$InformationBearingThings, subsets of which are distributed via the\nmass media at regular intervals.  Examples: #$TheNewYorkTimes-TheNewspaper is a\n#$MediaSeriesProductType, a collection of #$NewspaperSeries of which each\nedition is a subset -- a collection of the newspapers printed and\ncirculated on a particular day; each instance of #$TheNewYorkTimes-TheNewspaper is\na #$NewspaperCopy, a #$HardcopyInformationBearingObject. #$StarTrek-Classic is a #$MediaSeriesProductType, a #$TVSeriesProduct of which each episode is a subset -- a collection of TV shows broadcast at a particular time; each instance of\n#$StarTrek-Classic is a #$TVShow-SingleCW.  See also #$MediaSeriesNthFn, #$MediaSeriesByDateFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7285).
