x_comment('x_in-UnderspecifiedContainer',"(#$in-UnderspecifiedContainer ACT CONT) states that an abstract\ncontainment relation holds between ACT and CONT, where CONT is\nthe abstract container employed by the action ACT.\n#$in-UnderspecifiedContainer is an underspecified semantic representation\nthat may be elaborated to represent either a spatial example of\ncontainment (as captured by #$in-ContGeneric and its specific forms) or\na temporal use of containment ('in the summer' etc.) or metaphorical\ncontainment ('in emacs', etc.)") :- x_cid(a65b16526a72a8).
