x_comment(x_reformulatorRule,"(#$reformulatorRule EXPR-1 EXPR-2), asserted in the\n\nmicrotheory MT, means that EXPR-1 may be reformulated into EXPR-2 (or\n\nvice versa, based on meta-properties of this rule and what mode the\n\nreformulator is in) in MT\n\nor a specMt thereof.  Free variables in EXPR-1 and EXPR-2 are shared,\n\nand may bind with CycL expressions which match the template. Truth\n\nand semantics are not necessarily preserved (see #$TruthPreservingReformulation).\n\nUse the more specific predicates #$reformulatorEquiv and #$reformulatorEquals\n\nwhen applicable.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a72c9).
