x_comment(x_atStreetIntersection,"This predicate can be used to relate an object to\n\na street intersection in or next to which it is located. \n\n(#$atStreetIntersection OBJ XING) means that OBJ is located \n\nout in the open either directly on XING or on one of the \n\nstreet corners (i.e. lots of land) adjacent to XING.  When \n\nit is necessary to indicate the particular street corner \n\nadjacent to XING (e.g. the northwest one) where OBJ is \n\nlocated, either use #$streetCornerOf or simply specify \n\nOBJ's #$GeographicalDirection from XING.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a72ca).
