x_comment('x_thereExistAtLeast-RelHolds',"(#$thereExistAtLeast-RelHolds NUM VAR REL FORM) means that\n\n(#$thereExistAtLeast NUM VAR FORM) and that for the NUM things of which FORM\n\nholds we can assume that for any given pair of them, ONE, OTHER, the\n\nrelation  REL holds, i.e. (REL ONE OTHER).  For instance, suppose we wanted\n\nto translate the sentence \"Joe has 3 friends, at least, who get along with\n\neach other.\"  (#$thereExistAtLeast-RelHolds 3 ?PALS #$likesAsFriend (#$likesAsFriend\n\nJoe ?PALS))") :- x_cid(a65b16526a72e9).
