x_comment('x_above-Touching',"A binary #$SpatialPredicate that is a\nspecialization of both #$above-Directly and #$touches (qq.v.).\n(#$above-Touching ABOVE BELOW) means that ABOVE is located over \nBELOW and they are touching.  Examples of things related by\n#$above-Touching include a person and a chair s/he is sitting on, \na boat and the on water it floats on, and a hat and the head \nwearing it.  Note that it need _not_ be the case that every point \nof ABOVE is higher than every point of BELOW.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7335).
