x_comment(x_SporeStainingProcess,"A collection of events in which a bacterial culture is\n\ntested for endospore formation.  A culture is grown for several days\n\nor a week on solid medium and then a heat-fixed smear of the growth is\n\ntreated with a spore-stain, for example ethonal.  Vegetative cells are\n\ndecolorized but endospores will retain the dye.  An indirect endospore\n\ntest is also possible, see #$EndosporeTest-Indirect.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7350).
