x_comment(x_PacifyingAnAgent,"A collection of actions; a subset of #$InfluencingAnAgent. In each instance of #$PacifyingAnAgent, one agent deliberately takes actions that will make a hostile agent less hostile to it, or refrains from taking actions that, if taken, will make an agent hostile to it.  This collection doesn't constrain the kinds of actions, or refrainings, that may be taken, except as to the motive and intention with which the agent performs them.  The objects of pacification are intelligent, or at least sentient, agents--including groups of intelligent or sentient agents.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7351).
