x_comment(x_MilitaryWeaponTypeByFunction,"A collection of collections.  Each member TYPE of #$MilitaryWeaponTypeByFunction is either a specification of #$MilitaryWeapon or a specification of #$WeaponSystem satisfying the following conditions.  (i) TYPE is distinguished from other members of #$MilitaryWeaponTypeByFunction by a main function that members of TYPE have.  Thus, e.g., #$FighterPlane is a member of #$MilitaryWeaponTypeByFunction while #$F-18-Fighter is not.  (ii) The so-called 'main function' should not be too broad or too narrow, but significant enough for comparison between different military organizations.  Thus neither #$Weapon nor #$Handgun is a member of #$MilitaryWeaponTypeByFunction.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a73ae).
