x_comment('x_to-UnderspecifiedLocation',"(#$to-UnderspecifiedLocation TRAJ TOLOC) states that an\n\nabstract locational relation holds between TRAJ and TOLOC, where\n\nTOLOC is an abstract destination.\n\n#$to-UnderspecifiedLocation is an underspecified semantic representation\n\nthat may be elaborated to represent either a spatial example of destination (as captured by #$to-Generic and its specific forms)\n\nor a temporal use of destinations ('from june to august' etc.) or\n\nmetaphorical destination ('road to happiness', etc.)") :- x_cid(a65b16526a749a).
