x_comment(x_feelingTypeExperienced,"#$feelingTypeExperienced is a binary role predicate relating emotional experiences (see #$ExperiencingEmotion) to the type of feeling experienced (i.e. a spec of #$FeelingAttribute).  Often just one kind of emotion is experienced during any emotional experience.  Nonetheless multiple values on #$feelingTypeExperienced are possible in experiences of mixed emotion.  Note that predicates such as #$feelsEmotion, #$feelsTowardsEvent and others should be used in preference to this predicate.  This is because #$feelingTypeExperienced requires a term to be skolemized referring to the instance of experiencing that particular emotion whereas the other predicates do not.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a74b3).
