x_comment(x_TheEmptyList,"An instance of #$ListWithoutRepetition. #$TheEmptyList is a list that has no members (see #$listMembers).  Note that any list that has no members is identical with #$TheEmptyList; thus #$TheEmptyList is the only list whose length is 0.  Note also that #$TheEmptyList is a sublist (see #$subLists) of every list.  Note finally that #$TheEmptyList is not the same as #$TheEmptySet (q.v.).") :- x_cid(a65b16526a74f8).
