x_comment(x_EstablishingRelations,"A collection of events.\n\nEach element of #$EstablishingRelations is an event in which two \n\ninstances of #$IndependentCountry formally or informally establish some\n\nkind of diplomatic relationship. (Note that diplomatic recognition can \n\nalso be extended to certain types of #$PoliticalOrganization, see below).\n\nThis collection includes both formal announcements of recognition\n\nand acts via which two countries \n\nestablish such relationships de facto (e.g., by beginning to engage in \n\nofficially-sanctioned trade).  In certain cases, diplomatic recognition \n\ncan be extended to #$PoliticalOrganizations which claim to speak on behalf\n\nof a people desiring autonomy, e.g., the #$PalestineLiberationOrganization.  See also #$EndingRelations, and the attributes #$FullDiplomaticRecognition and #$TradeRelations.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a753a).
