x_comment(x_molecularSubComponents,"(#$molecularSubComponents CHEMICAL_OBJECT MOLECULAR_COMPONENT) means that MOLECULAR_COMPONENT is a connected part of CHEMICAL_OBJECT (either an instance of #$Molecule or a larger part of a molecule).  #$molecularSubComponents is a #$typedGenlPreds of #$physicalParts, used for relating a molecule (or portion of a molecule) with molecular subcomponents that are deemed to be of interest.  Subcomponents may be polyatomic or they may be atoms, and are to be distinguished on the grounds that they are part of the molecule in question in virtue of ionic or covalent bonds.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7574).
