x_comment(x_roleInGoal,"(#$roleInGoal OBJ CYCFORMULA ROLE) means that the goal represented by CYCFORMULA contains an event (or implies existence of an event) in which OBJ plays the role defined by ROLE. For example, if there exists a goal (it doesn't matter who possesses the goal) that #$MicrosoftInc go bankrupt, then one could assert (#$roleInGoal #$MicrosoftInc (#$financialState #$MicrosoftInc #$LegallyBankrupt) #$maleficiary).  This predicate could be used to find all of the goals that involve a particular #$Individual, to characterize that involvement and to reason about possessors of the goal.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7581).
