x_comment(x_Exploration,"This is the collection of activities in which some region is explored. This is\n\nnot restricted to regions of Earth. It is also not restricted to the surface of\n\nthe earth: one can explore below the earth's surface for resources, and one can\n\n explore the depths of the ocean or the surface of Mars. Not every instance of exploration\n\ninvolves a human moving to the location being explored, but every instance\n\ndoes involve some sensing device (human sensory apparatus or artificial device)\n\ngathering information about the region explored.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a759d).
