x_comment(x_WaterSurfacePath,"The collection of pre-designated or customary #$Path-Spatials that lie along water surfaces.  A moving object following (or blocking) this path is supported by the water, but is neither fully immersed in the water nor completely in the air.  This collection includes sea-lanes, channels, pre-designated ship routes, safe-passage mine-free paths, etc.  They may or may not be marked with #$Buoys.  Certain bodies of water like #$Canals are generally #$WaterSurfacePaths or have #$WaterSurfacePaths on them.  For the pure #$Trajectory of the motion of any object on a water surface, use #$WaterSurfaceTrajectory.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a75a6).
