x_comment(x_StreetSystemOfAreaFn,"(#$StreetSystemOfAreaFn AREA) denotes the \n\nunique maximal street system (if any) SYSTEM that is spread \n\nthroughout much of (and possibly beyond) AREA.  SYSTEM's \n\nbeing \"maximally spread\" throughout AREA means that it \n\nmust not be a proper #$subPathSystems of any other \n\nstreet system wholly in AREA and covering a larger \n\nportion of AREA.  (If there were such a larger system, \n\npresumably, _it_ would be what this function mapped AREA \n\nto.)  See also #$streetSystemOfArea and #$transPathSystemTypeOfRegion.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7603).
