x_comment(x_MilitaryOperationsDynamicSituationMicrotheory,"Each instance of #$MilitaryOperationsDynamicSituationMicrotheory contains situation information that is relevant to a particular class of #$MilitaryOperations -  operations involving some particular unit or units against some particular enemy unit or units, in some specific geographical region, given the current situation with respect to the units in question.  Unlike related instances of #$MilitaryOperationsStaticSituationMicrotheory, each #$MilitaryOperationsDynamicSituationMicrotheory contains information which is likely to change over the life of the relevant operations, such as location of units (both friendly and hostile), troop strength, and weather, if relevant. Each #$MilitaryOperationsDynamicSituationMicrotheory inherits static situation information from some instance(s) of #$MilitaryOperationsStaticSituationMicrotheory.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7630).
