x_comment('x_CharacterStringToken-Interpreted',"The specialization of #$CharacterStringToken whose \n  instances, in addition to whatever other information \n  they might happen to contain, contain a certain piece of\n  information primarily (see #$primarilyContainsInfo).  This is \n  the semantic notion got at by saying that (a particular use of) \n  a given English term or sentence has an ''overt meaning'', \n  despite the fact that other meanings might be taken from or \n  read into it.  Unlike instances of #$Message, however, \n  interpreted character-string tokens (might be but) need not \n  be produced with an explicit intention on the part of some \n  agent that it have the primary meaning that it does.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7633).
