x_comment('x_TVShow-SingleCW',"The collection of all individual TV shows considered as #$ConceptualWorks.  An instance of #$TVShow-SingleCW is intended to be presented to the public in a single broadcast.  One can be either a one-time tv special or an episode [see #$episodes] of a #$TVSeriesProduct.  Every #$TVShow-SingleCW is a #$ConceptualWork, usually with some sort of #$News or #$Narrative content, whose instantiations have a duration of at least 20 minutes. Instances of #$TVShow-SingleCW are listed on schedules, whereas instances of #$TVShow-IBT, #$Commercial-CW, and public-service announcements are not.   Each instance of #$TVSeriesProduct has a (large) number of instances of #$TVShow-SingleCW as #$subWorks.  Note that, e.g., 'Seinfeld' is not a #$TVShow-SingleCW but a #$TVSeriesProduct since it refers to a series of instances of  #$TVShow-SingleCW.  Both #$TVShow-SingleCW and #$TVSeriesProduct are specializations of the generic #$TVShow-CW.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7665).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526a7665,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
