x_comment('x_Hustler-ConArtist',"The sub-genus of #$Criminal person. A #$Hustler-ConArtist is a confidence-trickster who fools people into parting with money or valuables using a variety of hoaxes or scams. These hoaxes usually require the #$Hustler-ConArtist (i.e, #$perpetrator) to first gain the trust of the hoax's #$victim.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7666).
