x_comment('x_expresses-Underspecified',"(#$expresses-Underspecified EXP THING) is used to say -- abstractly or metaphorically -- that EXP is an \"expression\" of THING.  For example,  (#$expresses-Underspecified MyDogWaggingItsTail001 Joy) can be used to say that this particular instance of tail wagging is an expression of joy.  (#$relationAllInstance #$expresses-Underspecified #$HeavyMetalMusic TeenageAngst) could be used to say that heavy metal music is an expression of teenage angst.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a769c).
