x_comment('x_Spirochaetales-Order',"A collection of #$ProkaryoticCells in the #$MoneraKingdom.\nIt includes the #$BiologicalFamily #$Spirochaetaceae-Family and\n#$Treponemataceae-Family.  These #$ProkaryoticCells are helical cells\nand #$Bacterium-MotileByFlagellum. They have a unique flagellum\nstruture. The flagellum originates at each end of the organism and\nextend down the length of the cell and overlap.  These periplasmic\nflagella are between the peptidoglycan layer and outer membrane.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a769f).
