x_comment(x_StockIndexGroup,"A collection of #$Groups, each element of which is a group of #$LegalCorporations having #$Stocks that are #$PubliclyTradedSecurity(s).  A #$StockIndexGroup can have as #$groupMembers any #$LegalCorporation.  The index measure of the market price of the #$Stocks for the group is used as a measure of the market value for a particular pattern of investing.  Well-known #$StockIndexGroups are the #$StandardAndPoors500 and the #$DowJonesIndustrials.  To state the value of a #$StockIndexGroup, or 'stock index', use #$stockIndexValue.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a76d6).
