x_comment(x_MilitaryOperationsStaticSituationMicrotheory,"Each instance of #$MilitaryOperationsStaticSituationMicrotheory contains static background information that is relevant to a particular class of #$MilitaryOperations - operations involving some particular unit or units against some particular enemy unit or units, in some specific geographical region, etc. The information in each #$MilitaryOperationsStaticSituationMicrotheory is information that will remain the same no matter what the specifics of the course of action are. Such information typically will include geographical facts, e.g., location of mountains, rivers, etc., political facts, if they are relevant, assets available for the course of action, etc. Each #$MilitaryOperationsStaticSituationMicrotheory inherits information from ModernMilitaryTacticsMt.  For situation information which changes more frequently, see #$MilitaryOperationsDynamicSituationMicrotheory") :- x_cid(a65b16526a76da).
