x_comment(x_expenseFor,"The ternary predicate #$expenseFor relates an agent to an event in which the agent incurs some expense, and to the amount of the expense incurred in that event. (#$expenseFor AGENT EVENT AMOUNT) means that AGENT's expense for EVENT is AMOUNT. Note that AMOUNT can be AGENT's expense for EVENT even if AGENT has not yet paid that expense. That is, AMOUNT can be an unpaid debt that AGENT incurs in EVENT.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a76e8).
