x_comment(x_PullingAnObject,"Using a force to tend to move something (#$pullee) towards the #$puller.  If the #$pullee moves, it is a case of the more specific, #$PullingAnObjectAlong (which has significant specializations #$PullingAnObjectCloser and PullingAnObjectAlongWith).  If the #$puller moves and the #$pullee does not, it is a case of #$PullingOneselfTowards.  If neither the #$puller nor #$pullee moves, it is a case of #$PullingWithoutTranslation.  If the force causes the #$pullee to stretch, it is a case of #$Pulling-Stretching.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7704).
