x_comment(x_grievanceInDispute,"(#$grievanceInDispute DISPUTE AGENT ISSUE) means that ISSUE is a grievance or complaint which is prompting AGENT to be involved in DISPUTE. 'Grievances' as understood here can be   involved in both formal and informal conflicts (lawsuits, physical confrontations, etc.).  ISSUE can be a state of affairs that AGENT wishes to change -- e.g.,\n\nan agent's complaint in a lawsuit or contract dispute -- or a state of affairs with respect to which AGENT is seeking revenge, restitution, punishment, etc. In the case of the U.S. criminal justice system, a charge against a defendant can be considered a 'grievance' of the prosecuting agent.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7707).
