x_comment(x_WebSearchResultPage,"#$WebSearchResultPage is a subset of  #$WebPage-AIS. Each #$WebSearchResultPage consists primarily of a list of links into other web pages which was dynamically created and returned as the result of some web search. The links may or may not be related by some subject area, due to the lack of accuracy of many search engines (which is, in turn, partly due to the ambiguity of typical string-based search requests).  Many instances of #$WebSearchResultPage are created by professional search sites such as hotbot.com.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a770a).
