x_comment(x_MiddleVoiceFrame,"This frame is used for verbs which can appear in the middle voice. Middles are syntactically intransitive constructions in which the subject position in filled by the object affected by the action. The semantic agent of a middle is unspecified. For example, in the middle construction 'This material rips easily', the subject is the object affected by the ripping and the agent of the action is unspecified. This construction is syntactically parallel to other (non-middle) intransitives such as 'The man walks quickly' but the semantic role of the subject is different.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a771d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526a771d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
