x_comment('x_ignore-Temporary-ForRKFTool',"This predicate serves as a wrapper for rules that would normally be used as ke suggestions, see #$keFacilitationRules, but whose form results in an undesirable user prompt at present.  (ignoreAtPresentForRKFTool FORM) does not mean that FORM is incorrect or fails to state a legitimate knowledge entry expectation, however, the natural language that it results in is very awkward and therefore not worthy of demo inclusion.  This should serve as a flag for further NL work or perhaps the creation of simpler vocabulary to represent the salient content.  This predicate, once it is incorporated into tool function, should be used to hide assertions causing problems for impending demos.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7730).
