x_comment(x_Socializing,"This collection involves events of social interaction in a social setting. Instances usually have #$Communicating subevents, but communicating needn't be the primary subactivity. Instead, two people hanging out together drinking at a bar or dancing at a nightclub could be an instance of socializing, with or without conversation. The context of these events is a social context, therefore business meetings, commercial exchanges, interactions with the dental receptionist, etc. are not examples of #$Socializing, unless there is some non-official (i.e. social) purpose for the agents spending time together.--Causley, March 22, 1999") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7732).
