x_comment(x_considersAsHome,"(#$considersAsHome PERSON PLACE) means that PERSON considers PLACE his or her home, regardless of whether or not PERSON happens to reside in PLACE (see #$residesInRegion) currently.  Note that a given person might simultaneously consider more than one place home in this sense.  For one thing, someone who considers a small region (e.g. a  particular #$City) home might also consider a larger surrounding  region (e.g. the #$State-Geopolitical in which the city is located)  home as well.  For another thing, some people consider two completely  separate places home: their hometown and their current place of residence, for example.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7750).
