x_comment(x_increasesImmediately,"(#$increasesImmediately\n\nPERIOD THING SLOT) means that the value for the predicate SLOT applied\n\nto THING (in the first argument position) is greater immediately after\n\n(#$STIF q.v.) PERIOD than it was immediately before (#$STIB q.v.)\n\nPERIOD.  PERIOD may be any instance of #$TemporalThing, i.e., anything\n\nthat has a time period associated with it, whether an event, an\n\nentity, a life stage, etc. No causal connection is implied between the\n\n#$TemporalThing PERIOD and the increase.  See\n\n#$NoteAboutQuantityChangePredicates for a map of related predicates.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7774).
