x_comment(x_Cocaine,"#$Cocaine is a naturally occurring substance present in the leaves of the #$CocaPlant. Pharmacologically, #$Cocaine has two prominent actions: it is a potent #$LocalAnesthetic, and it is a powerful #$Stimulant. Psychotropically, #$Cocaine inhibits the re-uptake of dopamine in the brain, causing alertness and heightened energy, a sense of euphoria, decreased anxiety and social inhibitions, and heightened sexuality. Side-effects include addiction, anxiety, depression, irritability, extreme fatigue, and possibly paranoia. #$Cocaine has been used in South America for more than 3,000 years and in the United States since the 19th century in a variety of forms: coca leaves, coca paste, #$Cocaine-Powder, and cocaine base (e.g., freebase and #$Cocaine-Crack).") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7782).
