x_comment(x_ExclusiveEconomicZoneFn,"(#$ExclusiveEconomicZoneFn ?ENT) picks out the region of the sea designated as the exclusive economic zone of ?ENT, in accordance with U.N provisions. An entity's exclusive economic zone must be adjacent to its territorial sea, and the territorial sea and exclusive economic zone of a country may not together be more than 200 nautical miles wide. In this zone, the country controlling it also controls the (living and non-living) natural resources in that region, for purposes of research, exploration, exploitation, and so on.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7796).
