x_comment(x_MultiWordPhrasePredicate,"A collection of #$NLSemanticPredicates.  Each instance of\n#$MultiWordPhrasePredicate specifies a multi-word phrase and its\nCycL translation.  The phrase consists of a sequence of strings,\nbeginning or ending with a head word (an instance of #$EnglishWord)\nwhose form can vary.  For instance, the assertion (#$compoundString\n#$Chamber-TheWord (\"of\" \"commerce\") #$CountNoun\n#$ChamberOfCommerce) means that the strings \"chamber of commerce\"\nand \"chambers of commerce\" both denote the CycL term\n#$ChamberOfCommerce.  Specializations of #$MultiWordPhrasePredicate\nare: #$MultiWordForConstantPred, whose instances map\nphrases to CycL constants, #$MultiWordForFormulaPred,\nwhose instances map phrases to #$NLTemplateExpressions and #$MultiWordForStringPred, whose instances map phrases to strings.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a77a2).
