x_comment('x_meansOfInfoTransfer-ComputerProgram',"This predicate is a more specific version of #$programUsed-Generic intended to indicate\n\nwhen instances of #$ComputerProgram-CW play the role of #$programUsed-Generic\n\nin instances of #$InformationTransferEvent and are designed to\n\naid in information transfer.  (#$meansOfInfoTransfer-ComputerProgram ITE COM_PROG) means that the instance COM_PROG of #$ComputerProgram-CW plays an instrumental role in the #$InformationTransferEvent ITE and that COM_PROG was created in part to be able to play such roles, e.g. (#$intendedBehaviorCapable COM_PROG #$InformationTransferEvent #$programUsed-Generic) holds.  For example, if an instance EMAIL_PROG of #$EMailServerProgram is used in some instance SEND of #$EMailSending, then we may assert (#$meansOfInfoTransfer-ComputerProgram SEND EMAIL_PROG).") :- x_cid(a65b16526a77b6).
