x_comment(x_OfficialReport,"An instance of #$OfficialReport serves to communicate an analysis of selected data in a published form.  The report is often issued or generated by an institution that claims authority in the subject with which it is dealing.  For example, the US Labor Department may collect employment statistics, write an analysis, and issue it as an annual report.  Jouralistic reporting or personal reporting are not an instance of #$OfficialReport, although it may treat #$OfficialReports as evidence or news.  There is a conceptual relationship with #$OfficialDocument and #$OfficialRecord.  For example, an immigration document is the official form issued to legal immigrants; an immigration record is the record of who receives the immigration document, at what location, and at what time; an immigration report is issued by the appropriate governing body that analyzes immigration 'and other' records and may propose changes in policy.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a77fd).
