x_comment(x_availableToAgentTypeForEvent,"(#$availableToAgentTypeForEvent AGENT-TYPE OBJECT EVENT) means that OBJECT is typically available for agents of type AGENT-TYPE to use in EVENT.  For example, (#$availableToAgentTypeForEvent #$HumanCyclist #$Cyc #$CycProject) means that Cyc is available to human cyclists for use in the Cyc project. If an instance of AGENT-TYPE is capable of using OBJECT in EVENT, nothing prevents that agent from choosing to use OBJECT in EVENT. Compare this predicate to #$availableForEvent and #$availableToAgentTypeForEventType.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7851).
