x_comment(x_DiplomaticAction,"The collection of all diplomatic actions.  Instances of #$DiplomaticAction are typically performed by one (or more) country(s), towards some other country(s).  Examples: establishing diplomatic relations, negotiating a peace treaty, or withdrawing the country's ambassador. Specializations of this collection include #$DiplomaticProtest, #$DiplomaticRequest, and #$DiplomaticWarning.  Note that diplomatic actions may be performed by one country towards another during a war between the two, but in general, diplomatic actions themselves are not violent.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7858).
