x_comment('x_enables-RemovesUnspecifiedFactors',"This predicate is a generalization of the more specific\npredicates of the form 'enables-Removes????Factors'. It may be used to\nassert that an event enables an agent to do something when it's clear that\nthe relevant sense of 'enabling' is that of 'removing generally negative\nfactors' but it's not equally clear whether the negative factors removed\nwere incapacitating, disabling or merely contrary. Please check the\ndocumentation for this and related constants thoroughly before settling on\nthis predicate: assertions involving it are not likely to be helpful in\ninference.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7871).
