x_comment(x_dateOfDisbandment,"This predicate relates a multi-individual agent (see\n\n#$MultiIndividualAgent) to the date that it stopped functioning\n\ntogether as a single agent at least with respect to its previous\n\nprimary function.  After this date, it should no longer be the case\n\nthat the multi-indiviudal agent performs its primary function unless\n\nthe multi-individual agent is somehow intentionally resurrected and reunited.\n\nHowever, it may be the case that the multi-individual agent is\n\nrejuvenated, hence this isn't necessarily an ending date (although it\n\nwill be by default rule). Note that it may still be possible to talk\n\nabout the ''disbanded'' agent as an actor in an event even after it\n\nhas disbanded.  For instance, the Rolling Stones might conceivably\n\ndisband and continue to work together on fundraising for their\n\nfavourite drug rehabilitation project or as litigants in a litigation.\n\nHowever, it would not be the case that a disbanded music group would\n\nperform music as that group.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a78b9).
