x_comment(x_RestOfListFn,"An instance of #$EvaluatableFunction.  When applied to an instance LIST of #$List, #$RestOfListFn returns another list having as members all but the first item in LIST, in the same order.  To put it more precisely, for each instance LIST of #$List with LIST not equal to #$TheEmptyList, (#$RestOfListFn LIST) is the list obtained from LIST by taking away the first member of LIST.  If the first member of LIST is ITEM and LIST = (#$JoinListsFn (#$TheList ITEM) THE-LIST-OF-THE-REST), then (#$RestOfListFn LIST) = THE-LIST-OF-THE-REST.  Note that (#$RestOfListFn LIST) is undefined if LIST is #$TheEmptyList and that (#$RestOfListFn LIST) is #$TheEmptyList if the length of LIST is 1.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a78e1).
