x_comment(x_lastRoleInEventType,"(#$lastRoleInEventType INDIV TYPE ACTOR-SLOT EVENT TIME) means that,\nas of TIME, EVENT is the last instance of TYPE in which INDIV has\noccupied ACTOR-SLOT.  For instance, if (#$lastRoleInEventType\n#$AbrahamLincoln #$EntertainmentPerformance #$spectators Event008\n(#$YearFn 1988)), Event008 would be the final event in which Abraham\nLincoln watched an entertainment performance.  (Presumably, Event008\ntook place in the Ford Theater shortly before the\n#$AssassinationOfPresidentLincoln.)  See also\n#$firstRoleInEventType.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7913).
