x_comment(x_DictionaryFromToFn,"DictionaryFromToFn is a #$CollectionDenotingFunction. (#$DictionaryFromToFn LANGUAGE1 LANGUAGE2) represents the spec of #$Dictionary whose elements are dictionaries that translate words from LANGUAGE1 into LANGUAGE2.  For example, (#$DictionaryFromToFn #$SpanishLanguage #$EnglishLanguage) denotes the collection of dictionaries that translate Spanish words into English.  Note that the order of the arguments is important because a dictionary that translates Spanish into English need not also translate English into Spanish.  Use the #CollectionDenotingFunction #$DictionaryFn to represent the collection of dictionaries that are written in the same language about which they provide information, e.g., English language dictionaries.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7914).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526a7914,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
