x_comment('x_objectActedOn-Gradual',"The predicate #$objectActedOn-Gradual is used to relate an event to an entity acted on in a gradual (or incremental) way in that event. (#$objectActedOn-Gradual EVENT GRADUAL-OBJECT) means that in each sub-event SUB-EVENT of EVENT, there is some part PART of GRADUAL-OBJECT such that (#$objectActedOn SUB-EVENT PART), and for each part PART of GRADUAL-OBJECT, there exists some SUB-EVENT of EVENT, such that (#$objectActedOn SUB-EVENT PART).") :- x_cid(a65b16526a795c).
