x_comment(x_SatelliteEarthStation,"The collection of #$CommunicationDevices \nlocated on the Earth's surface designed to transmit and receive \n#$SatelliteTransmissions to and from a #$Satellite-Device orbiting         \nthe Earth. While all instances of #$SatelliteEarthStation have\n#$SatelliteReceivers, and thus can receive #$SatelliteTransmissions, \nsome, but not all, have #$SatelliteTransmitters, which allow them to \nsend signals to satellites.  It is important to note that quite a\nnumber of things count as Earth Stations.  These include the satellite\ndishes that people have attached to their houses, and anything else on\nthe surface of the Earth that can send and/or receive signals with \na satellite.  For this reason, although the name might suggest otherwise,\n#$SatelliteEarthStation is not a spec of #$FixedStructure. ") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7974).
