x_comment(x_Masquerading,"This is the collection of events in which a person pretends to be someone or something other than himself, in some context other than that of a dramatic performance. The purpose of the pretense may be entertainment, however, as in the case of #$Masquerading on #$Halloween, or for #$MardiGras (see #$MasqueradingAtASocialGathering). On the other hand, instances of #$Masquerading also include deliberately deceitful acts such as those that a con-artist might engage in in order to defraud someone (see #$Masquerading-Deceiving). #$Masquerading is distinct from #$DramaticActing, which is the collection of events in which a person portrays someone or something other than himself in the context of a dramatic performance (i.e., in a theatre, in front of an audience...).") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7984).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526a7984,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
