x_comment(x_DeonticReasoningMicrotheory,"This is a sub-collectiono of #$ModalReasoningMicrotheory.\nInstances of #$DeonticReasoningMicrotheory are microtheories\naccessible to deontic `to-be' operators, in which deontic reasoning via\nrules concerning those operators can be carried out.  These\nmicrotheories can also be used in deontic reasoning via microtheories,\napplying rules (outside) about these microtheories.  General relations\namong these microtheories, in addition to #$genlMt, include\n#$mtDeonAccessible and #$mtDeonIdeal.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7989).
