x_comment('x_CharacterToken-ElectroMagnetic',"The collection of all electromagnetically-encoded \n  tokens of individual abstract characters.  More precisely, \n  #$CharacterToken-ElectroMagnetic is a specialization of \n  #$CharacterToken each of whose instances is a specific \n  electromagnetically-realized (and usually, digitally-interpreted) \n  representation of particular instance of #$Character-Abstract \n  in some language, writing system, or encoding scheme.  \n  Electromagnetically-realized character tokens are objects that \n  are literally stored (e.g. in a computer's memory or on a floppy \n  disk) and transmitted (e.g. via wires or as radio signals) with \n  the use of electronic devices.  See also \n  #$CharacterStringToken-ElectroMagnetic.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7998).
