x_comment(x_Attache,"A collection of persons; a subset of #$Diplomat.  Each element of #$Attache is a person who is officially appointed as a representative of a country's government in dealing with another government or an international organization.  For example, the collection #$Attache includes the U.S. attaches in #$Japan, #$Russia, #$China-PeoplesRepublic, and other countries.  Attaches usually work with higher officials appointed by their country.  Usually attaches are attached to particular diplomatic staff or mission, for example #$MilitaryAttache or #$NavalAttache.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a79ab).
