x_comment(x_descriptionSentences,"(#$descriptionSentences TERM FORMULA) states that FORMULA is a CycL formula involving TERM which is known to be true, and which desribes TERM. #$descriptionSentences is intended to apply to all formulas which partly comprise a description of TERM, while applying to no formulas which merely pertain to TERM. A query of the form (#$descriptionSentences TERM ?X) may be thought of as querying 'WhoWhat is TERM?'") :- x_cid(a65b16526a79c0).
