x_comment(x_BreakingEven,"The collection of #$Events in which an investing #$Person or #$Organization reaches the #$breakEvenPoint, the level whereby it neither profits nor loses.  A #$CommercialOrganization is #$BreakingEven when it reaches the sales volume level at which total revenue equals total costs.  A securities investor who purchases a #$CallOption or a #$PutOption reaches his #$breakEvenPoint (and is therefore #$BreakingEven) when the price at which he has the option to buy or to sell some stock equals the price of the stock (adjusted to account for the amount of premium he has or will pay).") :- x_cid(a65b16526a79c1).
