x_comment(x_meansOfInfoTransfer,"This predicate is a more specific version of #$actors intended to single out those instances of #$SomethingExisting that play some role in instances of #$InformationTransferEvent and that are designed to aid in information transfer.  It is also a generalized version of  #$meansOfInfoTransfer-Artifact and #$meansOfInfoTransfer-ComputerProgram. (#$meansOfInfoTransfer ITE THING) means that the instance THING of #$SomethingExisting plays an instrumental role in the  #$InformationTransferEvent ITE and that THING was created in part to be able to play such roles, e.g. (#$intendedBehaviorCapable THING #$InformationTransferEvent #$instrument-Generic) holds.  For example, if some instance TEL of  #$Telephone is used in a successful telephone call CALL, then we could represent this with (#$meansOfInfoTransfer CALL TEL).") :- x_cid(a65b16526a79f2).
