x_comment(x_AlternativeMedicalModalityFOSFn,"(#$AlternativeMedicalModalityFOSFn MODALITY) is the subfield of #$AlternativeMedicine concerned with the instance of #$AlternativeMedicineEventTypeByModality MODALITY. For example, (#$AlternativeMedicalModalityFOSFn #$Acupuncture) denotes acupuncture as a subfield of #$AlternativeMedicine. Although many of these therapies are not studied in traditional #$AcademicDepartments, there are usually schools and training centers that offer instruction and provide a kind of certification to those who complete the training successfully. This function makes it unnecessary to create a hierarchy of alternative medicine subfields paralleling the hierarchy of alternative medical modalities and practitioners that already exists.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7a20).
