x_comment(x_increasesFluent,"This predicate relates a quantity-slot to a set or collection with respect to whose elements the slot tends to associate relatively large quantities.  More precisely, (#$increasesFluent SETORCOL SLOT) means that, all else being equal, for any ELEMENT and any NON-ELEMENT such that only the former is an element of SETORCOL, if (SLOT ELEMENT AMOUNT1) and (SLOT NON-ELEMENT AMOUNT2), then AMOUNT1 will be larger than AMOUNT2.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7a27).
