x_comment(x_Hacker,"A specialization of #$ComputerUser. Each instance of #$Hacker is a person who who willfully attempts to access, use, or affect an instance of #$ComputationalSystem without authorization.   Hackers may also be authorized users of a system that attempt to  use or affect the system in a manner that is not consistent with its normal operation or intended use (see #$Hacker-Insider). Hackers attack computational systems using computers -- someone who crashes their computer by beating it with a bat or pouring water on it would not be a hacker.  Hackers use the resources -- input devices, drives, programs, operations, etc. -- of a computer to hack it, or they use one computer's resources to hack another.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7a3c).
