x_comment('x_transferRelay-Generic',"This predicate can be used to indicate whatever acts as a relay in instances of #$GeneralizedTransfer and plays as well a primarily passive though crucial role.(for a predicate to indicate instances of #$Thing playing an active role see #$transferRouter-Generic).            (#$transferRelay-Generic TRANS THING) means that THING acts as a relay            in the #$GeneralizedTransfer TRANS but primarily in a passive capacity.            For example, suppose a trip TRANS via  airplane taking a person PER from New York to Austin makes a stop in #$CityOfOmahaNE,   where PER changes flights.  If 'CityOfOmahaNEAirport' is the instance of  #$Airport-Physical located in the #$CityOfOmahaNE, then we can say that 'CityOfOmahaNEAirport' is a relay point or node in the #$GeneralizedTransfer TRANS of PER and represent this by (#$transferRelay-Generic TRANS 'CityOfOmahaNEAirport').") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7aab).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526a7aab,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
