x_comment(x_prefersToMinimize,"(#$prefersToMinimize AGENT THING SLOT)\n\nmeans that AGENT prefers (see also #$prefers) smaller values of SLOT\n\n(its second argument) when applied to THING (as the first argument of\n\nSLOT). In a sense it means that AGENT will prefer situations whereby\n\nSLOT of THING becomes smaller, or stays the same, over situations\n\nwhereby SLOT of THING becomes greater.  It need not imply that the\n\nagent will directly pursue such minimization (in order to imply direct\n\npursuit, see #$goals)") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7b27).
