x_comment(x_objectOfSimulation,"The expression `(#$objectOfSimulation SIM THING)' means that the simulation event\n\nSIM is a simulation or a modelling of THING. THING can be a static object, a\n\ndynamic object, or an event. This\n\nsort of simulation should not be confused with the simulation of a\n\ncertain type of *experience*, for example, the experience of flying in\n\nflight simulation video games. In the latter, there is often a certain degree\n\nof simulation in the present sense as well, although this is just a means to\n\nthe intended effect. For more about the present notion of simulation see\n\nthe comment on #$Simulation-Activity.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7b9a).
