x_comment(x_hingedTo,"(#$hingedTo OBJ1 OBJ2) means that there is some hinge connecting OBJ1 and OBJ2, allowing limited rotational motion (but no other sort of relative motion) between OBJ1 and OBJ2.  The connecting hinge may be part of OBJ1, part of OBJ2, or separate from both OBJ1 and OBJ2. Note that (#$hingedTo OBJ1 OBJ2) implies that some edge of OBJ1 adjoins some edge of OBJ2.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7bc0).
