x_comment(x_PoliticalSupport,"#$PoliticalSupport is a collection of attributes representing the generic levels of political support that one group of agents gives to another.  Attributes in this collection represent the general committment of one agent to provide political assistance to another agent, as evidenced by pledges and/or present or previous behavior.  For example, (#$givesSupportToAgent #$UnitedStatesOfAmerica #$Israel (#$HighAmountFn #$PoliticalSupport)). Note that such relationships are liable to change and therefore assertions about them should have temporal qualification (see #$holdsIn).  Political support is intangible but significant, in that it may sway the opinion of third parties, and it often implies or includes economic or military support.  (See also #$MilitarySupport, #$EconomicSupport.)  To represent actual events in which support is given, see #$ShowingSupportForSomeone, #$HelpingAnAgent.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7bd1).
