x_comment('x_objectFound-Definite',"The expression `#$objectFound-Definite(SEARCH SEEKER OBJECT)'\nmeans that the search has succeeded. It says that SEEKER, the\n#$performedBy in the SEARCH, has come across the OBJECT which was sought\nand that SEEKER #$notices that OBJECT satisfies the #$searchCriterion-Definite\nassociated with the search. The arg3 position is an #$opaqueArgument because it is intended\nto represent the way SEEKER conceptualizes OBJECT in the act of noticing\nthat it satisfies the search criterion.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7c19).
