x_comment(x_InherentlyVulgarWord,"The collection of all words that are considered vulgar, no matter in what sense they are used. These are words that most people avoid saying in front of their mothers or religious leaders, in a job interview, or on a first date, and some people avoid using altogether. These words have inherent shock value in most social settings, and heavy use of them can cause a television show or movie to be rated inappropriate for young viewers. Words like #$Ass-TheWord and #$Bitch-TheWord are not #$InherentlyVulgarWords, because they have word senses that are not vulgar.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7c63).
