x_comment(x_InformationDesignationType,"A collection of collections.  Each instance of #$InformationDesignationType is a\ncollection of attributes.  These attributes are those designations or classifications of \ninformation that are part of some recognized classification scheme.  For instance, the collection \n#$GovernmentInformationDesignation is an instance of #$InformationDesignationType.  \nInstances of #$GovernmentInformationDesignation are attributes of information that are part of\nUS government's scheme of classification, eg, #$TopSecretInformation.  Other examples include \n#$CorporateInformationDesignation, #$GovernmentAffiliatedInformationDesignation, and others.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7c7b).
