x_comment(x_ImmediateWeatherProcess,"A specialization of #$WeatherEvent. Each instance of  #$WeatherEvent is a meteorological event of a duration shorter than a seasonal process.  A particular hurricane event, for example, might be characteristic of a seasonal process for a region; but the hurricane event itself is an instance of #$ImmediateWeatherProcess.  Another example of an instance of #$ImmediateWeatherProcess is a single #$LightningEvent.  (Cf. #$AnnualClimateCycle.)") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7c81).
