x_comment(x_TVShowHost,"Each #$TVShowHost is a person who is a continuing presence on television shows which have varying content and varying personnel on the show.  Typically, game shows, talk shows, music video shows, and any program that shows several short (shorter than the entire program) pieces of content will have a host.  The role of the host could be to introduce the various segments of the show, to interview guests, or to act as moderator.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7c89).
