x_comment(x_mediaProductTypeDuration,"This predicate specifies the time interval during which types of #$MediaProducts are available.  (#$mediaProductTypeDuration PRODUCT-TYPE TIME) means that a person who is in the right place during TIME (cf. #$mediaProductTypeLocation) can access instances of PRODUCT-TYPE, which is a #$SpecifiedInformationBearingThingType and a collection of #$MediaProducts.  For example, the #$mediaProductTypeDuration of a daily newspaper would be one day from its publication.  The #$mediaProductTypeDuration of a radio program would be the #$duration of the broadcast.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7c8e).
