x_comment(x_RelationalStructure,"A specialization of #$MathematicalObject.  Each instance of #$RelationalStructure\nis a mathematical structure that is a composite individual consisting of (i) a base set (see #$baseSet) and (ii) one or more relations or operations on that \nset (and, optionally, one or more selected other sets, relations, functions, or individuals).  Specializations of #$RelationalStructure include \n#$MathematicalOrdering and #$Multigraph (qq.v.).  Mathematicians sometimes \nspecify a given relational structure as a #$Tuple (q.v.) of sets, relations, \nfunctions, and/or individuals.  Note that a relational structure is not the \nsame as its base set, since a pure #$SetOrCollection necessarily lacks the \nassociated \"structure\".  See also #$structureRelations and #$structureFunctions.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7c95).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526a7c95,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
