xc_mapping_rows(a65b16526a7c95,[]).
x_comment('x_AutomaticFirearm-BlowbackOperated',"The collection of #$AutomaticFirearms that use the blowback system  for automatic loading and firing.  Before firing, the breechblock is not  actually locked to the barrel.  On firing, the strength of the spring, the  inertia of the breechblock and sometimes a simple retarding device delay the  extraction of the empty case until the barrel pressure is down to a safe  level.  Nevertheless it is gas pressure which operates the operating cycle, not recoil.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7c96).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526a7c96,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
