x_comment(x_intendedSoleFunction,"A specialization of \n\nboth #$soleFunction and #$intendedPrimaryFunction (qq.v.) \n\nthat is used to indicate the sole use a given artifact \n\n(see #$Artifact-Generic) was designed to serve.  \n\n(#$intendedSoleFunction ARTIFACT SITTYPE ROLE) means that (i) the\n\nsole function of ARTIFACT is to play ROLE in situations of \n\nthe type SITTYPE and (ii) ARTIFACT was intended by its designer \n\nsolely to play ROLE in SITTYPEs.  For example, the causing fluid\n\nto move (see #$providerOfMotiveForce) in #$ConveyingMaterials \n\nevents is arguably the intended sole function of a #$Pump-Mechanical.\n\nIf a given artifact has, or might have, more than one intended \n\nprimary function, consider the more general predicate \n\n#$intendedPrimaryFunction.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7c9b).
