x_comment('x_DonorFn-AgentType',"#$DonorFn-AgentType takes as argument any spec AGENTTYPE of #$Agent-Generic and returns the collection of all #$LegalAgents who donate money, goods, or services to any instance of AGENTTYPE. These donations are typically #$CharitableDonations intended to benefit the instance of AGENTTYPE who receives them. For example, (#$DonorFn-AgentType #$Museum-Organization) denotes the collection of all #$LegalAgents who donate money, goods, or services to any museum. If the money, goods, or services are donated as part of a marketing strategy designed to benefit the donating agent, then the donating agent will be an instance of (#$SponsorFn-AgentType AGENT) not (#$DonorFn-AgentType AGENT).") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7ccb).
