x_comment(x_PlayingFn,"(#$PlayingFn GAME) returns the collection of instances of #$PlayingAGame of type GAME performed by players or competitors.  For example, (#$PlayingFn #$Monopoly-TheGame) returns the collection of actions, including instances of #$ThrowingADie or moving a piece, performed by one or more players while playing #$Monopoly-TheGame.  Note that the game does not ever have to be completed for these actions to be part of the playing of the game.  The predicate also applies to non-game sports (see #$Sport).  To refer to a complete game being played use the more specific function, #$GameFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a7cd5).
