x_comment(x_knownSentence,"A #$KBDependentRelation (q.v.) and  specialization of #$trueSentence (q.v.) that is used to state  that a given sentence is \"known\" to be true to the Cyc system. More precisely, (#$knownSentence SENT) means that SENT is provable  by the Cyc inference engine from sentences currently in the Knowledge  Base.  #$knownSentence is a non-assertible predicate (see  #$notAssertible).  Note that this predicate is not to be confused  with #$assertedSentence, which is used to state that a given  sentence is explicitly asserted in the KB.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a8032).
