x_comment(x_Nerve,"The collection of all nerves.  Each instance of #$Nerve is a bundle of many nerve fibers (#$Axons) covered with a wrapping of #$ConnectiveTissue.  Sensory nerves (see #$SensoryNerve) carry nerve impulses to the central nervous system; motor nerves (see #$MotorNerve) carry impulses to the muscles.  Most nerves are mixed, containing axons of both motor and sensory neurons.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a804e).
