x_comment('x_typesSimilarWRTTypeViaBinRel-Inverse',"This is a 'type-level' version of\n#$similarWRTTypeViaBinRel-Inverse.  That is,\n(#$typesSimilarWRTTypeViaBinRel-Inverse COL1 COL2 COMCOL BINPRED)\nimplies that where INST1 is an instance of COL1 and INST2 is an\ninstance of COL2 such that (different INST1 INST2) and COM1 is an\ninstance of COMCOL such that (BINPRED COM1 INST1), either (BINPRED\nCOM1 INST2) or there exists an instance of COMCOL, COM2, such that\n(#$similarTo COM1 COM2) and (BINPRED COM2 INST2).  Equivalently, where\nINST1 and INST2 are respective instances of COL1 and COL2,\n(#$typesSimilarWRTTypeViaBinRel-Inverse COL1 COL2 COMCOL BINPRED)\nimplies (#$similarWRTTypeViaBinRel-Inverse INST1 INST2 COMCOL\nBINPRED).") :- x_cid(a65b16526a8213).
