x_comment(x_HumanRightsOrganization,"A collection of organizations; a subset of #$HumanitarianOrganization.  Instances of #$HumanRightsOrganization have as their main ends the dissemination of information about, and the protection of, human rights.  Human rights organizations are concerned with legal rights or what they consider should be legal rights of persons to freedom of speech and association, and to due process and equal treatment under law.  Such organizations may have international or local scope.  Examples include #$AmnestyInternational and the #$SouthernPovertyLawCenter.  Non-examples include #$Oxfam or #$DoctorsWithoutBorders that food or medical care are human `rights'. Cf. #$HumanitarianOrganization, broadly considered.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a8355).
