x_comment(x_ProgramFault,"#$ProgramFault denotes the most general fault of computer software that leads to vulnerabilities in computers running that software.  Only extremely rarely would one assert simply that a program has this attribute, because such an assertion would amount to saying merely that a program has some unspecified flaw that could cause computers to be vulnerable to some unspecified threat.  In general it is better to assert that a program has a much more specific fault.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a8398).
