x_comment(x_soleFunction,"A specialization of #$primaryFunction\n\n(q.v.) that is used to specify the sole primary or most important \n\nfunction that a given object serves.  \n\n(#$soleFunction OBJ SITTYPE ROLE) means that the single primary \n\nfunction of OBJ is to play ROLE in situations of the type SITTYPE.  \n\nOBJ might be a natural object that has a sole primary function \n\n(e.g. pumping blood is arguably the sole primary function of a heart),\n\nor OBJ might be an artifact that was intentionally designed to have \n\nthe sole primary function that it does (e.g. the sole primary\n\nfunction of a flyswatter is to swat flying insects).  For\n\ncases of the latter sort, consider the more specialized predicate\n\n#$intendedSoleFunction.  For things that have, or might have,\n\nmore than one primary function, consider the more general predicate\n\n#$primaryFunction.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a8399).
