x_comment(x_FatigueCondition,"The #$PhysiologicalCondition in which an #$Organism-Whole is suffering from pathologic fatigue.  This is to be characterized by a continuous, sustended #$LevelOfExhaustion caused by some other\n#$AilmentCondition.  Do not confuse with either the collection of #$Events\nduring which somebody is tired following an effort or at the other extreme\nthe #$ChronicFatigueSyndrome.  #$FatigueCondition is intended to describe\nthe #$LevelOfExhaustion of an #$Organism-Whole suffering from a\nunderlying, longlasting #$AilmentCondition such as certain #$Infections.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a8760).
