x_comment('x_available-Generic',"(#$available-Generic AGENT OBJECT) means that OBJECT\n\nis available (possibly in a metaphorical sense) for AGENT. Example:\n\n(#$available-Generic #$Fred Sally'sCopyOfGormenhast) or\n\n(#$available-Generic #$Sally #$Fred).  The former means that\n\nthe book denoted by Sally'sCopyOfGormenhast is available to Fred\n\n(presumably for reading) and the latter means that #$Fred is available\n\nto #$Sally (presumably for sex). The \"presumably\"s above indicate\n\npresuppositions.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a8769).
