x_comment('x_longTermInformationStore-FunctionalRole',"(#$longTermInformationStore-FunctionalRole SYSTEM STORE)\nmeans that if it holds in any time frame TEMP such that\n(#$temporallySubsumes SYSTEM TEMP) that (#$containsInformation STORE\nINFO), it holds from the beginning of TEMP through the end of the\nlifetime of SYSTEM that (#$containsInformation STORE INFO).  It is\nalso assumed that it is not true that (#$containsInformation STORE\nINFO) for any INFO and for any time frame TEMP that is not temporally\nsubsumed by SYSTEM, and that there is some time frame subsumed by the lifetime of SYSTEM during which STORE does contain some piece of information.  In the vernacular: if\n(#$longTermInformationStore-FunctionalRole SYSTEM STORE) then STORE\ncontains whatever information is stored in it during the lifetime of\nSYSTEM for the lifetime of SYSTEM, and only stores information during\nthe lifetime of SYSTEM.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a881a).
