x_comment(x_RhPositive,"#$Blood either has or does not have the Rh factor.  Adding foreign blood which is #$RhPositive to the #$CirculatorySystem of a body whose blood which is #$RhNegative will cause the recipient's body to develop anitbodies against the Rh factor.  If the recipient of #$RhPositive blood is a woman who later has an #$RhNegative fetus, then her immune system will attack the fetus's blood.  Rh factor is controlled by a recessive gene.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a8828).
