x_comment('x_Bomb-RoadVehicleDelivered',"A specialization of #$Bomb.  Each instance of #$Bomb-RoadVehicleDelivered is a device typically employed by a terrorist organization.  Each instance is an explosive device that is brought into proximity to its target by covert means involving a road vehicle (see #$RoadVehicle).  The vehicle may be parked in the vicinity of the target and evacuated by its driver prior to detonation, or it may be driven into the target by a suicide bomber or bombers who are killed when the device explodes.  Do not confuse this collection with #$CarBomb-BoobyTrap, which refers to bombs wired into the ignition systems of vehicles unbeknownst to their occupants.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a8927).
