x_comment(x_Refinishing,"A collection of events.  In each #$Refinishing event, some type of coating or finish is removed from the surface of an object in order to replace it with a new coating (of possibly a different type).  Thus, a #$Refinishing will have some sub-events in which the old finish is removed and some later sub-events in which the new finish is added.  The #$objectOfStateChange in a #$Refinishing may be a car, a doorframe, one of your fingernails, etc., but in general must be in a #$Solid-StateOfMatter.  Note that an event such as stripping the wood away from a doorframe, though prepatory to refinishing that doorframe, is not in and of itself an element of #$Refinishing; it is just one of the #$subEvents of a #$Refinishing event.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a8a3c).
