x_comment(x_predicateIntersection,"(#$predicateIntersection PRED GENLPRED1 GENLPRED2) means that (PRED ARG1 ...) holds iff (#$and (GENLPRED1 ARG1 ...) (GENLPRED2 ARG1 ...)).  That is, if both GENLPRED1 and GENLPRED2 hold for a given sequence of arguments, then PRED holds for those arguments; and vice versa.  If either GENLPRED1 or GENLPRED2 has fixed arity, then PRED has (the same) fixed arity; but if both have variable arity, so does PRED.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a8acc).
