x_comment('x_Spore-DormantBacterium',"The collection of bacterial spores. An\n\ninstance of #$Spore-DormantBacterium is the product of sporulation - when\n\nin a hostile environment, some bacteria, see #$SporeFormingBacterium,\n\nbecome dormant in order to survive. #$Spore-DormantBacteriums are well\n\nresistant to heat, chemicals and radiation. In certain conditions, they may\n\nlast for years. Spores can germinate into a single new vegetative cell, see\n\n#$BacterialSporeGermination, when environment is favorable. Do not confuse\n\nbacterial spores with spores of certain plants or fungi, for these later\n\nsee #$Spore-PlantLifeStage.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a8da3).
