x_comment(x_PlantPart,"A specialization of #$PlantBLO and #$OrganismPart.  Each instance of this collection is a physical part of some #$Plant.  An important specialization of this collection is #$BotanicalOrgan; but #$PlantPart also includes many smaller plant parts which display a similar level of organization -- they have vascular tissue, ground tissue, and an epidermis -- but are not included in the traditional understanding of a #$BotanicalOrgan (i.e. leaves, stems, roots and flowers). See also #$PlantPartType.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a8db2).
