x_comment(x_Fetus,"A specialization of #$AnimalBodyPart and #$SolidTangibleThing, and an instance of #$UniqueAnatomicalPartType. Each instance of this collection is a #$BiologicalLivingObject resident in a pregnant #$Mammal which, after the separation of the #$AmnioticSac, will develop into a mammalian baby.  By contrast, the term #$Embryo means all tissue that has decended from the fertilized #$Ovum, including the fetal part of the #$Placenta (#$Placenta-FetalPortion), the #$AmnioticSac, and the #$UmbilicalCord, as well as the #$Fetus. (Thus note that a #$Fetus is an #$AnimalBodyPart not because it is a body-part of its mother, but because it is a body-part of its #$Embryo.)") :- x_cid(a65b16526a8df7).
