x_comment(x_mother,"An instance of #$FamilyRelationSlot and a specialization of #$coreRelatives.  (#$mother CHILD MOTHER) means that MOTHER is a female  animal (there might be more than one) that fills the role of mother for CHILD. In the case of humans, MOTHER might be CHILD's biological mother, adoptive  mother, stepmother, or foster mother.  But note that being a person's  #$biologicalMother (q.v.) is neither necessary nor sufficient for being  his/her mother in the present sense.  In the case of nonhuman animals (see #$NonPersonAnimal), however, #$mother holds between two given creatures  if and only if #$biologicalMother does.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a8dfa).
