x_comment('x_numRange-GenQuant',"This is a macro-predicate which can be used to represent the\n\nmeaning of English sentences such as `two or three cats live in\n\nmy house' in NL parsing. (#$numRange-GenQuant COL1 COL2 N M) means\n\nthat there are between N and M elements of COL1 which are also\n\nelements of COL2. N and M must be different integers, and M is\n\ngreater than N. This constant doesn't replace num-GenQuant or\n\nany other more specific GeneralizedQuantifier. Its primary use\n\nis as an intermediate target for parsing: not for general\n\nKE/OE.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a8ed0).
