x_comment(x_Organ,"A specialization of #$AnimalBodyPart.  Each instance of #$Organ is a part of an animal that has a specialized physiological function  and is more or less localized within the animal.  Examples include hearts, kidneys, and tongues.  Specializations include #$InternalOrgan and #$ExternalOrgan.  Note that, in most contexts, a distributed system like a #$NervousSystem or a (#$SkinOnFn #$WholeBody) is not an #$Organ.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a8ef2).
