x_comment('x_subOrgs-Financial',"(#$subOrgs-Financial SUPER SUB) means that\n\nSUB is below SUPER in an organizational hierarchy of financial\n\ndependencies.  Specifically, SUB is ordinarily financially dependent\n\nupon SUPER.  For example, the FBI ultimately depends upon the US\n\nGovernment to provide for its expenses; a military battalion depends\n\non its superior military division for funding.  SUB need not be an\n\nimmediate financial dependent of SUPER, -- it could also be several\n\nsteps down in the money distribution chain.  Even if SUB is not\n\notherwise controlled by SUPER, it is still in a #$subOrgs-Financial\n\nrelation if it regularly gets the bulk of its income from the budget\n\nof SUPER.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a90e5).
