x_comment(x_infoNeededForDeterminationOf,"`(#$infoNeededForDeterminationOf INFO SENTENCE)' means that Cyc\ndoes not currently know the truth value of INFO or of SENTENCE but does\nknow that knowing the truth value of INFO (or, if INFO is an open formula,\nknowing what bindings there are for INFO) is part of what would establish\nthe truth and hence the assertibility of\nSENTENCE. (infoNeededForDeterminationOf INFO SENTENCE) should imply that\n(deservesFurtherInquiry SENTENCE). (See the comment on that constant). Note\nthat INFO might contain a free variable, since it might represent a\nquantity whose value should be known. \nThe main intended purpose for an assertion using\ninfoNeededForAssertionOf is to guide Cyc's behavior in interactive\ncontexts.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a915a).
