x_comment(x_PrimaryDomainController,"An #$NTDomain is a #$AccountSystem consisting of a group of #$NTWorkstations, one #$PrimaryDomainController (PDC), and one or more #$BackupDomainControllers (BDCs).  The PDC houses the #$PasswordFile containing all usernames and passwords for #$UserAccounts on the domain.  #$BackupDomainControllers handle the actual authentication when someone logs on to the domain, and for that purpose they also keep copies of the #$PasswordFile (see #$SAMFile).  However, since all changes to account information on the domain need to be made to the password file on the PDC, the BDCs need to communicate with the PDC periodically to update their copies of the #$PasswordFile.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a91a7).
