x_comment(x_roleTypeDependsOnRoleType,"(#$roleTypeDependsOnRoleType COLTYPE1 ROLE1 COLTYPE2 ROLE2 EVENTTYPE) means that an instance of an instance, INS1, of COLTYPE1 plays ROLE1 and that an instance of an instance, INS2, of COLTYPE2 plays ROLE2 in instances of EVENTTYPE.  However, and more importantly, the instance of COLTYPE1 of which  INS1 is a member plays a role in determining of which instance of COLTYPE2 INS2 will be an instance.  For instance,  (#$roleTypeDependsOnRoleType PersonByReligiousDenomination #$socialParticipants       ChurchBuildingByDenominationType       #$eventOccursAt #$Worshipping) means that the religious denomination of a person explains or determines the kind of church building, faceted by denomination type, in which the person will worship.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a91ec).
