x_comment(x_EncryptedAIS,"The collection of all #$AbstractInformationStructures which are, in the salient context, #$Encrypted.  Any assertion of the form (#$isa AIS #$EncryptedAIS) will be highly context-dependent, and no #$AbstractInformationStructure should be thought of as intrinsically #$Encrypted or #$Plaintext.  The character string 'The eagle has landed' might, in the context of two spies communicating, encrypt some information, but in another context it is simply a report that some eagle has landed.  It is inherently neither.  Whether, in a given context, it is one or the other will depend upon a great many facts (none of which are facts about the state of one's brain, nor of the state of some vaguely-conceived mental substance).") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9224).
