x_comment('x_loadCapacity-TakeOff',"(#$loadCapacity-TakeOff CONVEYANCE MASS) \n\n says that MASS is the greatest mass that\n\n   CONVEYANCE can carry at #$AirplaneTakeOff before damage\n\n    results to CONVEYANCE.  For example,\n\n  (#$loadCapacity-TakeOff FighterPlane-A10-0003\n\n  (#$Kilogram 22950)) says that this particular\n\n   fighter plane can safely carry up to 22950 #$Kilograms at takeoff.  It is possible for CONVEYANCE to be heavier while in flight, which is when you would use #$loadCapacity-Conveyance.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9326).
