x_comment('x_Tool-PowerTool',"A collection of tools.  An instance of #$Tool-PowerTool is a tool which utilizes a non-kinetic power source, such as #$Electricity.  The power tool uses that power source --- converts it somehow into kinetic energy, causing mechanical motion (of part of the tool).  Often a #$Tool-PowerTool enables a person to things which would be very arduous (if not impossible) for that same human user to do with a purely manual tool.  Most power tools are designed to be operated by an adult human being; rarely for a particular person, rarely requiring multiple people at the same time to operate.  A #$Tool-PowerTool may be hand-held, or may be large and stationary.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9528).
