x_comment(x_MixingDevice,"A collection of physical devices.  An instance of #$MixingDevice is a device whose #$primaryFunction is to mix up substances --- usually substances of some particular sorts (salads, paint, etc.)  Typically, an instance of #$MixingDevice is used with some kind of container in which the stuff to be mixed is contained during the mixing.  In some types of #$MixingDevice, the mixer is a #$BuiltInDevice with the container (e.g., a cement truck, a blender) and in some cases it isn't (e.g., a hand-held electric mixer that is designed to be held above any large bowl.)") :- x_cid(a65b16526a953a).
