x_comment('x_Relationship-GenericFn',"\"(#$Relationship-GenericFn ?THING1 ?THING2)\" denotes the relationship between ?THING1 and ?THING2. It is impossible to neatly delimit a class of cases which are appropriate arguments for this function except to say that  it would be coextensive with the set of cases for which the common English expression `the relationship between ... and ...' is apt. Instances would include the relationship between smoking and health, the relationship between science and religion,  the relationship between Pat and Chris. Though relationships are typically grounded in garden-variety physical facts, they are themselves intangible.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a974c).
