x_comment(x_IndependentIonFn,"Where CHEMOBJTYPE is a spec of #$ChemicalObject that admits #$Molecules, #$Ions, and #$MolecularComponents as instances, (#$IndependentIonFn CHEMOBJTYPE) returns the collection of all instances of CHEMOBJTYPE that are independent #$Ions, i.e., radicals with net negative or positive charge, due to having either more or fewer electrons than there are protons in its atomic components. ") :- x_cid(a65b16526a97b0).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526a97b0,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
