x_comment(x_ailmentContagiousWithContactFromTo,"This relation is used to state a measure of the likelihood\nof an ailment's being transmitted from one type of organism to\nanother.  Specifically, (#$ailmentContagiousWithContactFromTo\nINFECTION-TYPE TRANSMITTER-TYPE TRANSMITTEE-TYPE LEVEL) means that in\na case where there is a #$PhysicalContactSituation between an instance\nof TRANSMITTER-TYPE and an instance of TRANSMITTEE-TYPE at a time\nwhile the instance of TRANSMITTER-TYPE has an infection of type\nINFECTION-TYPE, the #$likelihood that the instance of TRANSMITTEE-TYPE\nwill contract the infection is LEVEL.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a97e8).
