xc_mapping_rows(a65b16526a9805,[]).
x_comment('x_favors-SitType',"(#$favors-SitType AGENT SITTYPE) means that AGENT favors or approves of a situation of type SITTYPE.  That is, AGENT wants either (i) a pre-existing situation of type SITTYPE to continue or (ii) a situation of type SITTYPE to come about.  We assume that if an agent favors a particular kind of temporal situation, s/he favors any more general kind of temporal situation.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9806).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526a9806,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
