x_comment(x_SpaceInAHOC,"A specialization of both #$Cavity and #$HumanOccupationConstruct.  Each instance of #$SpaceInAHOC is a space found inside some instance of #$HumanOccupationConstruct (HOC).  Instances include all major spaces inside any #$HumanOccupationConstruct, including not only rooms (instances of #$RoomInAConstruction), but also halls, elevator shafts, attics, stairwells, and the spaces inside trains, cars, and airplanes that are designed for human occupation.  Other building parts which are not open spatial regions (e.g., walls, plumbing, etc.) are _not_ included in this collection; cf. #$PartOfBuilding.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9807).
