x_comment(x_initiator,"The predicate #$initiator relates a social occurrence to the agent who initiates the occurrence.  (#$initiator EVENT AGENT) means that the agent AGENT deliberately initiates the social occurrence EVENT.  For example, (#$initiator #$BombingOfHiroshima #$UnitedStatesOfAmerica).  If an event has multiple agents initiating it, each will be an initiator of the occurrence.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a980a).
