x_comment(x_originInDecompositions,"This predicate is used to express the relation between a #$PartiallyTangible and the #$PartiallyTangible it was once a part of.  (#$originInDecompositions ?PART ?WHOLE) means that the thing ?PART comes from ?WHOLE, in the sense that ?PART was once part of ?WHOLE, but is no longer.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9813).
