x_comment(x_packetsOfTypeFromReachTarget,"(#$packetsOfTypeFromReachTarget PACKET_TYPE FROM_COMP TO_COMP) means that #$Packet-Networks of the type PACKET_TYPE, sent from FROM_COMP, will (barring some sort of snafu) reach TO_COMP.  More precisely, it means that either (a) there is no #$Firewall-Network mediating remote connections between FROM_COMP and TO_COMP, or (b) there is a #$Firewall-Network between the two computers, but it does not filter packets of PACKET_TYPE from FROM_COMP to TO_COMP.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a98ae).
