x_comment(x_SpaceOccupiedByFn,"This function can be used to denote the exact spatial region occupied\n\nby some object.\n\n(#$SpaceOccupiedByFn OBJECT) denotes all and only the piece\n\nof the embedding space in which OBJECT is located that\n\nOBJECT occupies.  Moreover, this function denotes a piece\n\nof intangible space (see its #$resultIsa, #$SpaceRegion.)\n\nNote that this function does not require or make reference to any\n\ntemporal parameter; thus it can be used in contexts concerning\n\npurely spatial situations, abstract as well as empirical.\n\nAlso see the corresponding predicate, #$exactlyLocatedAt-Spatial.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a98c5).
