x_comment(x_CreatingANewConceptInUIA,"The collection of events in which a UIA user is able to\n\ncreate new terms and add them to the interaction context in which they\n\nare working. This process can occur singly, as when a user accesses\n\nthe #$CycConceptCreator from the left pane of the UIA interface. In\n\naddition to direct access, the #$CycConceptCreator is called whenever a\n\nuser uses an unfamiliar term and indicates they would like to describe\n\nit at that time. For example, if a user has typed in a sentence in the\n\ntext window containing a term unfamiliar to Cyc, the Sentence Reader\n\nwill highlight the term and let the user know it is not recognized. If\n\nthe user clicks [Describe Now], the Sentence Reader calls up the\n\nConcept Creator to create the term.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a98c8).
