x_comment(x_pathInPathArtifact,"This predicate can be used to relate two instances of #$PathArtifact such\nthat one is a part of the other. (#$pathInPathArtifact PATH PART-PATH) means\nthat PART-PATH is a part of PATH.  Note that the sense of \"part\" is that\nused in the predicates #$physicalParts and #$spatiallySubsumes. An example:\nthe portion of #$RouteOne-Vietnam that is on the\n#$RouteOneBridge-HueVietnam is a #$pathInPathArtifact of the bridge.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a993b).
