xc_mapping_rows(a65b16526a9941,[]).
x_comment(x_PurposefulMentalActivity,"The intersection of #$StrictlyMentalEvent and #$PurposefulAction, and also a specialization of #$IntentionalMentalEvent. Each instance of this collection is an event involving intentional mental activity on the part of at least one performer (see #$performedBy).  \nSolving a math problem (cf. #$DoingMath), planning an attack and performing a thought experiment (cf. #$ThoughtExperimenting) are all examples of #$PurposefulMentalActivity.  However, daydreaming or having undesired obsessive thoughts are not examples.  A borderline example might be arriving at the solution to a math problem in one's sleep after intentionally working on the problem during the previous day.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9942).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526a9942,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
