x_comment(x_NationalIDDocument,"An instance of #$OfficialDocumentType, and a specialization of #$IDDocument.  Each instance of #$NationalIDDocument is a document issued by the government of some country to one of its citizens or resident aliens.  In the countries in which such documents are issued, possession of such a document is usually required in order to establish work eligibility, or to obtain certain kinds of government benefits.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a994e).
