x_comment(x_graphRepresentsType,"This predicate specifies a relation between path systems and the kind of thing that the path system is intended to model.  It is possible that a path system be used or even intended to model more than one kind of thing, so the second argument is not #$SingleEntry. Similarly, types of things can be modelled by more than one path system so the first argument is not #$SingleEntry.  However, we should also be careful not to assume that paths represent genls of collection types that it represents.  For instance, if a graph represent a kind of communication event, it does not necessarily represent all more general kinds of communicating.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a99ab).
