x_comment(x_DifferenceWRTPredicate,"A collection of #$ComparisonWRTPredicates used to represent the respect in which two things are different. Predicates that represent that two things are different but do not represent the manner or respect in which they are different are excluded from #$DifferenceWRTPredicate. For example, #$different is not an instance of #$DifferenceWRTPredicate.  This collection can be used to constrain Asks designed to return assertions that represent known differences between two specified things. Cf. #$SimilarityWRTPredicate.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a99b3).
