x_comment(x_accessibleFromInSystem,"(#$accessibleFromInSystem X Y SYS) means that X is accessible from Y in the #$Semi-DirectedPathSystem SYS, which in turn means that either X = Y or there is a path PATH from Y to X in SYS, i.e., (#$pathFromToInSystem PATH Y X SYS) holds.  Note that if we fix a #$Semi-DirectedPathSystem SYS, the relation #$accessibleFromInSystem is reflexive and transitive (i.e., a quasi-order).  If we fix a #$BidirectedPathSystem SYS, this relation is an equivalence relation, the same as #$connectedInSystem.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a99b5).
