x_comment('x_infoPathway-Exact',"(#$infoPathway-Exact TRANS PATH) indicates that the instance of #$InformationBearingThing transferred in some instance of #$InformationTransferEvent follows, throughout the entire transfer, the whole of PATH, an instance of #$Path-Spatial.  (#$infoPathway-Complete TRANS PATH) means that PATH is the entire ``route'' of TRANS and is spatial.  By definition, any #$infoPathway-Exact of an instance ITE of #$InformationTransferEvent connects the ``starting'' and ``stopping'' points (the #$informationOrigin and #$informationDestination) of all of ITE (See #$pathConnects). See also #$infoPathway-Complete and #$infoPathway-Partial.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9a69).
