x_comment(x_ClothingItem,"A specialization of #$Clothing-Generic.  Each instance of #$ClothingItem is something that a person wears as a protective and/or decorative covering or ornament.  Items of clothing are usually made of flexible materials, such as cloth, leather, or yarn.  The collection #$ClothingItem contains primarily individual garments (e.g., instances of the collections #$Pants, #$Shirt, #$Coat, #$Shoe), together with pairs of shoes, socks, and gloves (since each wearer needs a pair).  Jewelry, suspenders, belts, etc., are in the specialization #$ClothingAccessory.\n\nNote: outfits (esp. specialized outfits) made up of several individual items worn together belong to the collection #$ClothingOutfit, which is _not_ a specialization of #$ClothingItem but _is_ a specialization of the broader collection, #$SomethingToWear.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9a7f).
