x_comment(x_clockwise,"(#$clockwise POINT-1 POINT-2 POINT-3) means that the\n\nstraight line traversal originating at POINT-1, passing through\n\nPOINT-2, and terminating at POINT-3 is in the clockwise direction.\n\nEquivalently, the straight line traversal originating at POINT-2,\n\npassing through POINT-1, and terminating at POINT-3 is in the\n\ncounterclockwise direction.  Consequently, this predicate is an\n\n#$ELRelation with #$expansion (#$counterClockwise POINT-2 POINT-1\n\nPOINT-3).") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9a8a).
