x_comment(x_transferredAIS,"#$transferredAIS is used to identify an instance of #$AbstractInformationStructure for which an instantiation plays the role of #$transferredThing in a given #$InformationTransferEvent.  For example, (#$transferredAIS BobSendsAnEmailToTedAt12:15PM EMailMessageToTedFromBob001) says that a certain instance of #$EMailMessage was \"sent\" by Bob to Ted at 12:15 PM.  To be precise, there is an instantiation (see #$instantiationOfAIS) of that instance of #$EMailMessage that was transferred.  If Ted forwards the message to Sally, it will be the same #$EMailMessage, but a new instantiation will be transferred.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9ab5).
