x_comment(x_EnclosingSomething,"This is the collection of all events in which something becomes enclosed.  This can happen either as the result of an object moving into an enclosure, such as a person entering a room, or the enclosure surrounding the object, such as a hand grasping a pencil. 'Enclosure' means that the enclosed object is at least surrounded in a plane by the enclosure.  The enclosing event is considered to last as long as the enclosed object is inside the enclosure.  An enclosing may come about either by movement, growth or shape change.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9ab6).
