x_comment('x_structureOfGene-GenInfo',"(#$structureOfGene-GenInfo GIS GENE-GENINFO) means that\nGENE-GIS encodes GENE-GENINFO. Note that this predicate is functional\nin its second argument place, as a given instance of\n#$GeneticInformationStructure will encodes a unique instance of\n#$Gene-GenInfo. Note also that the converse isn't true. An instance of\n#$Gene-GenInfo may be instantiated by a certain number of instances of\n#$GeneticInformationStructure; it may in particular be encoded by two\ndistinct instances of #$Gene-GIS, one being a mutated form of the other.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9ad0).
