x_comment(x_pathPassesThroughRegion,"This predicate relates spatial paths to spatial regions they pass through.  (#$pathPassesThroughRegion PATH REGION)   means that PATH runs all the way through REGION and beyond (in    both directions).  PATH must run through a ''significant portion''    of REGION, as judged with respect to the dimension of REGION that    corresponds most closely to the location and orientation of PATH   (see #$pathThroughRegion).  It is not enough, for example, for PATH    merely to pass through a remote corner of REGION.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9b3b).
