x_comment(x_FlowPath,"A #$CustomaryPathCycLConstant and a specialization of both #$Path-Customary and #$Path-Simple.  Each instance of #$FlowPath is a path whose extent is delineated by the movement of a fluid over an area; for example, the path of a lava flow or the #$AlaskanPipeline.  Instances of #$FlowPath may (but need not) be constrained by objects or forces that channel the flow of fluid; see also the subcollection #$FluidConduit.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9b48).
