x_comment(x_asIfTo,"(#$asIfTo EVENT THING) means that THING is the object of the #$TreatingAsIfEvent EVENT. For example, in the event #$FredAsksSallyToHelpMove, #$Fred is treating #$Sally as if the proposition (#$friends #$Fred #$Sally) were true, so we could say (#$asIfTo #$FredAsksSallyToHelpMove #$Sally).  See also #$asIfBy and #$asIfDuringByTo.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9b49).
