x_comment(x_resourceCapableOf,"(#$resourceCapableOf AGENT SIT-TYPE ROLE) means that AGENT has the necessary resources available to it to play ROLE in elements of SIT-TYPE.  Note that the notion of resource is different than skill (see #$skillCapableOf), technology (see #$technologicallyCapableOf), authority (see #$authorityCapableOf).  Resources are external to the agent, so that anatomy is not a resource (see #$anatomicallyCapableOf).  Money is one kind of resource and thus #$fiscallyCapableOf is implied by #$resourceCapableOf.  Having the resources to play ROLE in SIT-TYPE entails that the appropriate (necessary or sufficient) things are present or are present in sufficient amounts.--BillJ, edited by Curtis") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9bb0).
