x_comment(x_cultureCoreParticipants,"This predicate is a specialization of #$cultureParticipants that relates persons (and, potentially, other   animals) to the cultures that they participate in in a central way.  (#$cultureCoreParticipants CULTURE PARTICIPANT)    means that PARTICIPANT is one of the primary #$socialParticipants in    the complex instance of #$SocialOccurrence that is CULTURE.     Core participation in a given culture implies possession of the qualities that the culture is defined in terms of, and implies strong tendencies toward certain    characteristic beliefs and practices of that culture (see #$cultureBeliefs and    #$culturePractices).  For example, although it is not necessarily the case that all #$cultureParticipants in teenage culture are actually in their teens, this is the case for all of that culture's #$cultureCoreParticipants.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9bba).
