x_comment(x_pathEndsInRegion,"This predicate relates a spatial path to a spatial region inside of which the path ends.  (#$pathEndsInRegion PATH REGION) means that there is a #$subPaths of PATH that contains one of  PATH's #$endsOfPathSegment and is #$pathInsideRegion REGION  (as a limiting case, the path end might be #$onLine REGION's  border).  PATH might or might not be a #$subPaths of some  SUPERPATH that does not end inside REGION; so it does _not_  follow from the above formula that REGION contains a  #$pathTerminus (q.v.) of PATH.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9c33).
