x_comment(x_identityConditionsFor,"This predicate relates instances of #$Collection to the relations which constitute identity conditions for members of that collection. (#$identityConditionsFor PRED COL) means that if A and B are members of COL and (PRED A B), we may infer that A and B are the same instance of COL.   #$equals is the relationship against which all identity conditions are defined and is, trivially, an identity condition for any collection.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9cb8).
