x_comment(x_creationDateOfArtObject,"(#$creationDateOfArtObject ART-OBJECT DATE) means that the date of creation\n\nof ART-OBJECT, an instance of #$ArtObject, is DATE, an instance of\n\n#$TimeInterval. Datation is ofently an expert matter, and even based on scientific\n\nmethods open to inherent errors and approximations. Therefore, date of creation of\n\nobject is oftenly estimated only or conventional. Although, some could\n\nargue on the mere notion of creation of art objects, this predicate ignores\n\nsuch ratiocinations and attributes to objects typically belonging to museum's\n\nholdings a date, or a time interval, accepted by historians of art. This predicate will be\n\nmostly usefull to enable assignation of a time period to certain objects\n\nsuch as archeological pieces.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9dca).
