x_comment('x_covers-Dustlike',"'(#$covers-Dustlike STUFF OBJECT)' means that the #$Mob STUFF covers OBJECT in the way in which dust covers a tabletop, or a layer of snow covers the ground.  That is, the covering is a mob of separate,\n\nloose particles, which are not attached to the surface they cover, but\n\nare randomly strewn over it.  The layer of STUFF may be thin enough to\n\nsee OBJECT through, or it may conceal it; and the individual particles may be touching their neighbors, or they may be separated by space.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9ea9).
