x_comment('x_SerialNumber-String',"A specialization of #$UniqueID and #$IDString.  Each instance of #$SerialNumber-String is a number that is assigned by the manufacturer of a device to that device and which uniquely identifies that device among all the other devices of that type the manufacturer has made.  Manufacturers usually assign these strings serially, so among two devices of the same type from the same manufacturer the one having the largest serial number is typically the one most recently made.  The instances of this collection are typically called \"serial numbers\" although they often are comprised of characters other than numbers.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9eb1).
