x_comment(x_DisplayStatus,"The collection of all #$DisplayingSomething events in which some instance of #$PhysicalDevice displays an indication of the status of itself or another device (of which it may be a part or temporarily connected) as the result of physical or electrical processes.  Displays in which the observer directly views the status unmediatated by action of any device, which are set through human intervention, or which depend merely on \"clockwork\" are not included.  Positive examples include displays indicated by the position on a vertical scale of a weight connected by a rope over a pulley to a float in a water tank, as well as those indicated by instances or #$FuelGauge, TirePressureGauge, #$Voltmeter, and #$Thermometer.  Counter-examples include direct viewing of the level of the water against a vertical scale painted inside the tank as well as instances of #$DisplayingSomething by instances of #$Clock or billboards which state today's fire danger or the current value of a lottery.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9eca).
