x_comment(x_FloorInAConstruction,"#$FloorInAConstruction is a specialization of #$PartOfAnHSC and #$Wall-GenericBarrier.  Each instance of #$FloorInAConstruction is a physical floor in a building (typically made to walk upon), _not_ the level (the story composed of rooms or halls -- see #$LevelOfAConstruction).  The floor can include any floor in a building such as the floor of a room on the third floor as well as the floor of the entire first level of the building.  This includes just the horizontal surface -- not the subfloor.  It also does not include floor coverings like carpet or tile.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9f39).
