x_comment(x_addedTogether,"(#$addedTogether ADDING LIST) means that, in the instance of #$DoingAddition ADDING, the performer of ADDING added together the sequence of numbers in LIST.  If a particular event of #$DoingAddition is done properly, then the resulting number should be equal to that of (#$PlusFn N1, N2 ... Nn), where (N1, N2 ... Nn) is the sequence of numbers in LIST.  Note that duplicate digits are permissible in LIST: for instance, in the case of (#$addedTogether ADDING (#$TheList 5 2 5)), the performer of ADDING would add correctly if the result is 12, not 7.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9f3e).
