x_comment('x_subTranslations-SingleTrajectory',"(#$subTranslations-SingleTrajectory MOVE1 MOVE2) means that MOVE2 is a subevent of MOVE1, both being #$Translation-SingleTrajectory, and that MOVE2 has as parts all parts of MOVE1 that are temporally subsumed by MOVE2.  That is to say, if MOVE1 is like a big rope, MOVE2 should be like a segment of the rope (rather than a thin thread in the rope).  Since there is only one OBJ in MOVE1 such that (#$objectMoving MOVE1 OBJ) holds, we can clarify the meaning of (#$subTranslations-SingleTrajectory MOVE1 MOVE2) by saying that MOVE2 is such a Translation-SingleTrajectroy that the MOVE2 is the movement of OBJ during an interval within the temporal extention of MOVE1") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9f56).
