x_comment('x_Safeguard-Situation',"This is the collection of situations which constitute the safeguarding of\n\nsomething. Some of these are purposeful actions (#$ProtectingSomething); others are events\n\nwhich are not purposeful actions (a security program running); still others are\n\nmore-or-less static situations (a lock's being in a door). While not all instances\n\nof #$Safeguard-Situation are purposeful actions, all are a result of such. Note that the term `safeguard' may also\n\nbe used to denote artifacts such as locks and computer programs, even when they are not being used to safeguard. These things\n\nare instances of #$Safeguard-Artifact. (#$SteveSchulz 4/11/2000)") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9f97).
