x_comment(x_DialingATelephoneNumber,"The collection of events in which a phone number is completely or partially input to a phone system via an instance of #$Telephone. Events of this kind are more or less the definitive subevents in instances of #$MakingAPhoneCall, however normal instances of #$MakingAPhoneCall will also include additional subevents, e.g., picking up the phone receiver.  Note that we're including instances where the dialing is not completed, i.e., where the process is aborted for some reason.  Even inputting a single digit would count as an instance of #$DialingATelephoneNumber.  Such 'abortive' cases would not, however, figure as subevents in instances of #$MakingAPhoneCall.") :- x_cid(a65b16526a9fc5).
