x_comment(x_ExcavationSite,"The collection of excavation sites. Instances of #$ExcavationSite\nare geographical areas where some agent, typically human beings, conduct\nexcavation. In case of underground excavation, the corresponding excavation\nsite typically contains the main access to the excavation\n[#$Excavation-Hole], that would be where a ground infrastructure, if any,\nis located. Main types of excavation operations are that conducted for\nindustrial purpose such as for instance diamond mining and oil\ndrilling. Other types of excavations are scientific ones, geological or\narcheological for instance, the place where these operations are conducted\nare instances of specializations of #$ExcavationSite.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa00a).
