x_comment(x_OpenForFn,"For any given movement type TYPE, (#$OpenForFn TYPE) is the attribute of instances of #$Path-Customary that are open for movements of the type TYPE (from end to end).  For example, (#$holdsIn TIME (#$pathState PATH (#$OpenForFn (#$TransportViaFn #$Truck)))) means that during TIME, PATH is open for transportation through PATH (from end to end) via trucks.  Note that when (#$pathState PATH (#$OpenForFn (#$TransportViaFn #$Truck))) is true during TIME, it says nothing about whether, during TIME, PATH is blocked (see #$BlockedForFn) or open for any other kind movement of transportation on PATH.  Note also that (#$pathState PATH (#$OpenForFn TYPE)) is not implied by any movement of the type TYPE on PATH---it simply means that there are 'potential' movements of the type TYPE whose #$objectMoving can get one end from the other through the entire PATH.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa035).
