x_comment('x_Demanding-CommunicationAct',"A collection of communication acts.  In each instance of #$Demanding-CommunicationAct, an agent presents to some other agent(s) an expectation that the latter do something that the first agent describes in the demand.  Making a demand differs from giving an order in that an ordering agent has some authoritative claim on the agent to whom the order is issued.  While a demanding agent may have reasons to expect that the demand will be fulfilled, there is no compelling authoritative claim on the agent to whom the demand is made.  See also #$Ordering-CommunicationAct.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa070).
