x_comment('x_culturePrescribes-Hypothetical',"(#$culturePrescribes-Hypothetical CULTURE COND ACTTYPE ROLE) \n  means that within CULTURE, when COND is true, it is considered good \n  or proper or right for one to play ROLE in an instance of ACTTYPE,\n  and bad or improper or wrong not to do so.  For example, some cultures \n  expect one to help others in need when one is in a position to do so.  \n  This predicate applies equally to moral rules, rules of conduct or \n  etiquette, and customs.  See also #$culturePrescribes-Categorical,\n  #$cultureProscribes-Categorical, and\n  #$cultureProscribes-Hypothetical.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa09e).
