x_comment('x_signifiesTo-Icon',"This is a specialized representation (semiotic) predicate meaning representation due to resemblance, such as when a portrait represents the person depicted. (#$signifiesTo-Icon THING1 THING2 AGENT) means that, to AGENT, THING1 represents THING2 because THING1 resembles THING2.  This is called 'iconic' representation. Compare this with the predicates #$signifiesTo-Index and #$signifiesTo-Symbol.  It's possible for all three to apply to the same representation.  If the basis for the representation is unknown, use the more general predicate #$signifiesTo.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa0e3).
