x_comment(x_PersonWithLatentParaphilia,"The collection of #$PersonWithPsychologicalAilment who\nsuffer from paraphilic disorders, such as a\n#$PersonWithLatentPedophilia. These are #$Persons that are not\ncurrently engaging in activities that designate them as a\nparaphilic person, but have desires or fantasies to do so. For\nexample, a #$PersonWithLatentPedophilia may have sexual fantasies\nabout children, but has not acted on those fantasies. When the\n#$PersonWithLatentPedophilia does act on those desires, then they\nbecome an instance of the collection #$ChildMolester.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa136).
