x_comment(x_ComputerVulnerability,"A specialization of #$SystemVulnerableToAttackByComputerOperation and #$Computer.  Each instance of #$ComputerVulnerability is a computer (not a computer network or a computer program copy) that is vulnerable to attack by computeroperation.  In many cases, however, a computer is an instance of #$ComputerVulnerability because it has a faulty program running on it.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa150).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa150,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
