x_comment(x_objectsInMutualContact,"The predicate #$objectsInMutualContact indicates that two different objects physically touch in a particular #$PhysicalContactSituation.  (#$objectsInMutualContact SIT OBJ-1 OBJ-2) means that OBJ-1 and OBJ-2 are in contact in the #$PhysicalContactSituation SIT.  For example, a #$ClothingItem and its #$wearer are #$objectsInMutualContact during the wearing.  A father and son in a #$CarryingPiggyback event are #$objectsInMutualContact.  (#$objectsInMutualContact SIT OBJ-1 OBJ-2) entails (#$holdsIn SIT (#$touches OBJ-1 OBJ-2)); #$touches covers both direct touching and touching indirectly (i.e., through a thin layer, e.g., through clothing).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa15a).
