x_comment(x_PhilosophicalTheory,"The collection of philosophical theories, broadly intended: a systematic, rationally supported view of some aspect of the world. #$ScientificTheory is a specialization of this, so we don't intend #$PhilosophicalTheory to capture just the extent of the academic discipline called `philosophy' in contemporary Western culture. Minimal criteria that\n\napply to this notion: an instance of\n\n#$PhilosophicalTheory has to be internally or logically coherent, although many such theories are in fact about the very standards by which coherence is judged. It is not required that a #$PhilosophicalTheory be empirically testable or supported, or that it be formalized or formalizable.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa171).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa171,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
