x_comment(x_CommonVehicleEpidemic,"A collection of #$Epidemics each of whose instances are such that the cases constituting the #$Epidemic result from exposure to the same source of the harmful agent. Although the time and place of the exposure need not be the same for all cases of illness that constitute the #$Epidemic, the cases  are caused by exposure to a common source. Harmful agents include drugs, chemical agents, biological toxins, and infectious agents. #$CommonVehicleEpidemics contrast with #$PropagatedEpidemics in which the cases of disease are spread from one case to another.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa175).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa175,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
