x_comment('x_keStrongSuggestion-New',"(#$keStrongSuggestion-New TERM CONSTRAINT FORMULA) states a strong suggestion that FORMULA should be known to be true about TERM, where FORMULA is an open formula containing one keyword, constraints on which are given in CONSTRAINT.  For example, (#$implies (#$isa ?X #$UnitedStatesPresident) (#$keStrongSuggestion-New ?X (#$isa #$TheUnknownTerm #$Person) (#$knowsAbout #$TheUnknownTerm ?X))) states a strong suggestion that for US Presidents, Cyc learn which things stand in the #$knowsAbout relation to them, where those things are constrainted to be instances of #$Person.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa176).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa176,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
