x_comment(x_CommonVehicleInfectiousDiseaseEpidemic,"A collection of #$InfectiousDiseaseEpidemics each of whose instances are such that the cases constituting the #$Epidemic result from exposure to the same source of the infectious agent. The time and place of the exposure need not be the same. If the time and place of the exposure are the same, it is a #$PointSourceInfectiousDiseaseEpidemic. #$InfectiousDiseaseEpidemics which involve vector-borne transmission or person-person spread are not #$CommonVehicleInfectiousDiseaseEpidemics. #$CommonVehicleInfectiousDiseaseEpidemics typically are food-borne or water-borne. They are also called 'common-source' epidemics.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa17d).
