x_comment('x_interArgResultIsa-Asserted',"#$interArgResultIsa-Asserted is a quaternary instance of #$MetaRelation.  It is used to state that a certain complex and partly #$isa -based relationship holds between a given argument to a given function and the corresponding value that is returned when the function is applied to the argument.                                                                                       (#$interArgResultIsa-Asserted FUNC N INDEPENDENT-ARG-COL                                                                                             DEPENDENT-ARG-COL) means that, when a term that is asserted to be                                                                                    an instance of INDEPENDENT-ARG-COL appears as the Nth argument to FUNC,                                                                              then (regardless of what the other arguments to FUNC might be) the value                                                                             (if any) of that function for those arguments is an instance of                                                                                      DEPENDENT-ARG-COL. That is: if INST is asserted to be an instance of                                                                                 INDEPENDENT-ARG-COL and (FUNC ARG(1) ... ARG(N-1) INST ...) = VALUE, then                                                                            VALUE is an instance of DEPENDENT-ARG-COL.  Note that, unlike                                                                                        #$interArgResultIsa assertions, #$interArgResultIsa-Asserted assertions                                                                              will not support assertions of the form (isa VALUE DEPENDENT-ARG-COL)                                                                                unless it is asserted in the Cyc KB that (isa INST INDEPENDENT-ARG-COL).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa1a0).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa1a0,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16526aa1a0,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part05.krf').
xc_source_line(a65b16526aa1a0,21730).
