x_comment('x_InfectingEvent-IndirectTransmission',"The collection of #$InfectingEvents in which there is an indirect transfer of an infectious agent or pathogen (see #$Microorganism) via some intermediary to a receptive portal (see #$infectingOccursAt) through which an #$Organism-Whole becomes infected. The intermediary can be inanimate or living, and if living may itself be infected or not. Contrast with #$InfectingEvent-DirectTransmission. The major subcollections are #$InfectingEvent-VehicleBorneTransmission, #$InfectingEvent-AirborneTransmission, and #$InfectingEvent-VectorBorneTransmission.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa204).
