x_comment('x_InfectingEvent-VehicleBorneTransmission',"The collection of #$InfectingEvent-IndirectTransmissions in which contaminated inanimate objects or substances serve as an intermediate means by which an infectious agent is transported to receptive portal (see #$infectingOccursAt) through which an #$Organism-Whole may become infected. The infectious agent may or may not have multiplied on or in the vehicle before being transmitted. Since the vehicle is inanimate, the vehicle cannot itself become infected. Potential vehicles of infection include toys, bedding, eating utensils and surgical instruments; substances such as food, water, milk; and biological products such as blood, plasma, tissue.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa208).
