x_comment(x_eMailPrecedence,"A predicate for relating an email message to the character string that appears in its \"Precedence:\" header. (#$eMailPrecedence MSG PRECEDENCE) means that the #$EMailMessage, MSG, has PRECEDENCE, an instance of #$CharacterString, as as the entry in its \"Precedence:\" header.   The \"Precedence:\" header can be used as a crude control of message priority. It tweaks the sort order in the queue and can be configured to change the message timeout values.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa23c).
