xc_mapping_rows(a65b16526aa242,[]).
x_comment(x_resultTypeGenlArg,"(#$resultTypeGenlArg FUNC N) means that FUNC always returns a collection type TYPE such that (#$typeGenls TYPE COL), where COL is the Nth argument of FUNC. That is, the value of FUNC for any appropriate sequence of arguments is a collection of collections, each instance of which is a subcollection of the Nth item in that sequence. Symbolically, (typeGenls (FUNC ARG1..ARGN..) ARGN).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa243).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa243,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
