x_comment(x_fieldEncoding,"This predicate defines how a logical field\nin a logical schema is interpreted and given a physical value in a\ncorresponding physical schema.  The sentence (#$fieldEncoding\nPHYSICAL-SCHEMA PF-INDEXICAL LOGICAL-SCHEMA ENCODING-EXPRESSION) is used\nto state an ENCODING-EXPRESSION, which is one of the term-level\ntranslation templates (encodings) from LOGICAL-SCHEMA into\nPHYSICAL-SCHEMA. More precisely, ENCODING-EXPRESSION expresses a\ntranslation in terms of some of the the logical fields of LOGICAL-SCHEMA\ninto a physically encoded term suitable for PF-INDEXICAL in\nPHYSICAL-SCHEMA.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa25a).
