x_comment(x_enterpriseRecruitedFor,"(#$enterpriseRecruitedFor RECRUITING ACTIVITY) means that\nACTIVITY is the #$Action that recruits are being recruited to join in\nin the #$RecruitingActivity RECRUITING.  The exact nature of the role\nthe recruit plays in ACTIVITY will depend in part on the type of\n#$RecruitingActivity that is going on, and in part on other\nexigencies: in general, however, (#$enterpriseRecruitedFor RECRUITING\nACTIVITY) implies that any #$agentRecruited will be a\n#$deliberateActors in ACTIVITY at some point in the future.  We also\nassume ACTIVITY will end some time after RECRUITING has ended, and\nthat if there is a #$recruitingOrganization in RECRUITING, this\norganization is the #$directingAgent of ACTIVITY.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa2b3).
