x_comment(x_synonymousListFields,"In some cases where it is necessary to articulate a preliminary mapping of a distributed database schema, it is necessary to map CycL constants to entities represented in so-called list objects which have been created for purposes of streamlining the database.  In these cases, multiple fields in the list object jointly comprise a single term that must be mapped to some term in the CycL vocabulary.  #$synonymousListFields enables us to do this.  Where LIST_STRINGS is a list comprised of #$CharacterStrings, (#$synonymousListFields LIST_STRINGS INFO_SOURCE CYC_TERM) means that CYC_TERM is the meaning of the term denoted by the list of character strings that appear on one row of a list object in the database schema INFO_SOURCE.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa2e6).
