x_comment(x_InterArgNotIsaPredicate,"The subcollection of both #$InterArgTypePredicate and #$ArgNotIsaPredicate (qq.v.) whose instances are used to put conditional #$isa based argument-type constraints on polyadic relations in regards to two of their argument-places.  Each instance of #$InterArgNotIsaPredicate specifies, with respect to a given #$Relation, that one of its arguments (the \"dependent\" one) must _not_ be an instance of (#$isa) a certain collection, contingent upon another of its argument's (the \"independent\" one's) being an instance of a certain (possibly different) collection.  An inter-argument-isa predicate PRED has argument-places for designating the relation and the two collections serving as argument-types; the (numerically-specified) identities of the relation's corresponding dependent and independent arguments is in most cases fixed (as in #$interArgNotIsa1-2), but is in some cases variable and specified via two additional argument-places of PRED's (as in #$interArgNotIsa). In cases of the former sort, where the relation's argument-places are fixed, PRED is a #$TernaryPredicate that takes as it first argument (or \"arg1\") a relation, as its arg2 the type specified for the relation's independent argument, and as its arg3 the type forbidden (contingently) for the dependent argument.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa34a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa34a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16526aa34a,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part05.krf').
xc_source_line(a65b16526aa34a,22332).
xc_kb_names(a65b16526aa34a,[]).
xc_mapping_rows(a65b16526aa34a,[]).
x_comment(x_PaymentByActionTypeFn,"Where ACT_TYPE is a specialization of #$PurposefulAction, (#$PaymentByActionTypeFn ACT_TYPE) denotes the collection of all instances of ACT_TYPE that are undertaken as a form of payment for goods or services rendered.  For all intents and purposes this can be thought of as shorthand for (#$CollectionIntersectionFn (#$TheSet #$Transaction ACT_TYPE).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa34b).
