x_comment(x_CityNamedFn,"The Cyc function #$CityNamedFn is an #$IndividualDenotingFunction.  (#$CityNamedFn STRING GEOPOL) applied to a (quoted) #$ProperNameString STRING which is the name of a city in region GEOPOL returns the #$City in that region with that name.  Examples: (#$CityNamedFn \"New York City\" #$NewYork-State); (#$CityNamedFn \"Columbus\" #$FranklinCountyOhio);  (#$CityNamedFn \"Taipei\" #$Taiwan-RepublicOfChina).  Note the assumption that there is only one so-named city as a #$geopoliticalSubdivision of the #$GeopoliticalEntity specified.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa3f5).
