x_comment(x_casualtyCount,"A ternary predicate that relates a given event to the number of deaths, injuries and other losses it caused within a specified population. (#$casualtyCount EVENT ORGTYPE N) means that N instances of ORGTYPE (some specialization of #$Organism-Whole) were injured, killed or lost as an immediate and direct result of EVENT. For injuries and killings considered separately, see #$injuryCount and #$deathToll respectively.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa3f8).
