x_comment(x_TextileArtifact,"#$TextileArtifact is a specialization of #$Artifact-NonAgentive, #$DurableGoods, #$SolidTangibleArtifact, and #$CommodityProduct.  Each instance of #$TextileArtifact is a product made by spinning, weaving, knitting, wrapping, pressing, or other processes used to form fibers into usable materials such as cloth or linen.  Notable specializations of #$TextileArtifact include #$Cloth, #$Cord-Textile, and #$Netting.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa3fd).
