x_comment(x_countyOfAddress,"(#$countyOfAddress LOC COUNTY) means that the  #$ContactLocation LOC is found in the territory of the #$County COUNTY. For example, as   #$CycorpHeadquarters is a #$ContactLocation for #$Cycorp, then  (#$countyOfAddress #$CycorpHeadquarters #$TravisCountyTexas) means that the  Cycorp Headquarters building is located in Travis County, Texas.  Note that  the arg-constraint on the first argument should be an instance of #$ContactLocation  which serves as a #$pointsOfContact for an agent and not the agent itself.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa400).
