x_comment(x_SolidFn,"An instance of #$CollectionDenotingFunction.  When applied to an instance STUFF-TYPE of #$TangibleStuffCompositionType, #$SolidFn returns as its value all of the instances of STUFF-TYPE that are also instances of #$SolidTangibleThing (q.v.).  For example, (#$SolidFn #$Water-Fresh) is the collection of all instances of #$Water-Fresh that are also instances of #$SolidTangibleThing; thus, it would include as instances an ice cube, the layer of ice at the top of a frozen-over river, and so on.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa403).
