x_comment(x_SoundStructure,"The collection of instances of #$ObjectTypeBySensibleFeature that are audible qualities of sounds.  For example, the feature a sound has when it the sequence of played notes D, A, and G occur in this order is a #$SoundStructure. There is no limit to how complex #$SoundStructures may be. For example, there is a single #$SoundStructure, SOUND, corresponding to the entirety of a given performance of a symphony, PERFORMANCE1. Any other performance which instantiates SOUND would sound exactly like PERFORMANCE1.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa437).
