x_comment(x_areasOfOrigin,"The predicate #$areasOfOrigin relates an ethnic group to a particular region in which its members originated.  (#$areasOfOrigin GROUP REGION) means that the #$PersonTypeByEthnicity GROUP originated in the #$GeographicalRegion REGION.  For example, to indicate that Circassians originated in Asia, we would say (#$areasOfOrigin #$EthnicGroupOfCircassians #$ContinentOfAsia).  Ethnic groups may have originated in several different areas; e.g., the #$EthnicGroupOfHutu is native to the territories of #$Rwanda, #$Burundi, #$Tanzania, and #$Uganda.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa43f).
