x_comment(x_quantityPartitionedBy,"(#$quantityPartitionedBy QUANT PART) states that the #$Quantity QUANT is partitioned by the quantity partition PART.  In other words, anything which has the quantity ATT must also have one of the quantities in PART.  Furthermore, since PART is a partition of QUANT, anything having one of the quantites in PART will have QUANT as well, and nothing will have two different quantities in PART.  See also #$quantityPartitionSet and #$QuantityPartitionType.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa47c).
