x_comment(x_LandBorderFn,"(#$LandBorderFn ?ENT) returns those parts of the  border between ?ENT and another region which are not coastal. This includes borders formed by rivers. So, for example, the potion of the (#$BorderBetweenFn #$France #$Germany) formed by the #$RhineRiver would count as part of the (#$LandBorderFn #$France) and the (#$LandBorderFn #$Germany). However, the Atlantic coastline of France would not count.  Note that because many countries have some coastline, the instance of #$Border returned by this function is not necessarily #$SpatiallyContinuousThings.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa480).
