x_comment('x_Artifact-Agentive',"The collection of all instances of #$Agent-Generic created by an agent or agents (i.e., by some instance(s) of #$Agent-Generic).  Since each instance of #$Artifact-Agentive is created by an agent, each instance is also an artifact (i.e., an instance of #$Artifact-Generic).  One important specialization of #$Artifact-Agentive is #$Organization (q.v.).  #$Artifact-Agentive is disjoint with #$Agent-NonArtifactual, the collection of all agents _not_ created by an agent.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa484).
