x_comment(x_TravelingByClassFn,"(#$TravelingByClassFn TRAVELBYTRANSPORTTYPE TRAVELCLASS)\nreturns the collection of all instances of TRAVELBYTRANSPORTTYPE where\nthe accomodations and service involved are considered to have the\n#$TransportationAccommodationType TRAVELCLASS.  E.g., (#$TravelingByClassFn\n(#$TravelingByMeansOfFn #$Train-TransportationDevice) #$FirstClass) returns the collection\nof all instances of (#$TravelingByMeansOfFn #$Train-TransportationDevice) where the travel\nand accomodations are #$FirstClass, or, more succinctly, the concept\nof 'first-class train travel'.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa486).
