x_comment('x_Up-Partially',"The direction #$Up-Partially is a unit vector interval which includes in its range all unit vectors that have a greater than zero upward component.  Different #$Up-Partially assertions in different #$FrameOfReference microtheories should not be considered equivalent by default.  An elevator ascending as well as an airplane on a very gradual ascent move in the #$Up-Partially direction.  See #$Up-Generally and #$Up-Directly for more directionally constrained versions of `up'.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa48e).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa48e,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
