x_comment('x_phenotypeOfIndividual-Enumeration',"(#$phenotypeOfIndividual-Enumeration ORG PHENO) means that ORG, an instance of\n#$Organism-Whole, has the feature denoted by PHENO, an instance of\n#$PhenotypeFeatureType. The phenotype of an individual is a purely descriptive\naccount of observable features of an organism. The phenotype is determined\nby the genotype, but knowledge of the former doesn't give knowledge of the\nlater. See #$genotypeOfIndividual-Enumeration.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa4a0).
