x_comment(x_ArgGenlQuantityBinaryPredicate,"Those instances of both #$ArgTypeBinaryPredicate and #$ArgGenlAttributePredicate used to specify the required quantity of an argument of #$Relation.  Each instance PRED of this collection is a binary predicate with the following properties: ARG1 is an instance of #$Relation, and ARG2 is an instance of #$Quantity.  (PRED ARG1 ARG2) means that some argument of ARG1 is constrained to be subsumed by (via #$quantitySubsumes) ARG2, where PRED determines the argument place in question.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa4a2).
