x_comment(x_IdentifyingAsTypeFn,"An instance of #$Function-Denotational that takes one argument, a collection, and returns the collection of all identifying  actions in which some object or group of objects is identified as belonging to that collection.  (#$IdentifyingAsTypeFn COL) denotes the subcollection of #$IdentifyingObjectAsType in which some object or group of objects is identified by some instance of #$IntelligentAgent as belonging to the collection COL. For example, (#$IdentifyingAsTypeFn #$Gecko) is the collection of all actions in which an instance of #$Reptile is identified as being a Gecko.  (#$IdentifyingAsTypeFn #$PineTree) denotes the collection of all actions in which either a single tree is identified as a Pine tree or all trees in a grove of trees are identified as being pine trees. See #$identifiedAsType as well as #$Identifying and #$identifiedThing for related constants.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa523).
