x_comment(x_Foreign,"The collection of all things foreign to an agent.  If the agent is a country, then other countries and people and things belonging to them are #$Foreign to the reference country.  If the agent is a person, than countries other than that in which one has ones citizenship, and people and things belonging to that country are foreign to the agent.  If the person is an expatriate who has adopted the culture of the country in which s/he is living, that country and things belonging to it are not considered foreign.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa52d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa52d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
