x_comment(x_typesResembleInQuantity,"This is a type level version of the predicate #$resemblesInQuantity.  (#$typesResembleInQuantity TYPE1 TYPE2 QUANT-TYPE) means that where INST1 and INST2 are any instances drawn, respectively, from TYPE1 and TYPE2, it will be the case that (#$resemblesInQuantity INST1 INST2 QUANT-TYPE).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa530).
