x_comment(x_indirectlyAcquaintedWith,"X is indirectly acquainted with Y if X knows (is acquainted with) someone who works for Y, someone who has dealt with Y, etc.  E.g., X meets and chats with someone who works for company Y and they talk about company Y --- then, X can be assumed to have be #$indirectlyAcquaintedWith with company Y.  X may also be more directly acquainted with Y.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa531).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa531,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
