x_comment(x_hasAuthorityOver,"(#$hasAuthorityOver PARENT KID) means that PARENT has authority over KID. This implies, among other things, that they are in a position to be #$GrantingPermission to KID. This can also be expressed as: (#$agentsRelationship PARENT KID #$hasAuthorityOver) ") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa536).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa536,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
