x_comment(x_frequentlyInContactWith,"(#$frequentlyInContactWith AGENT1 AGENT2) means that AGENT and AGENT2 run into each other at frequent, perhaps regular intervals in the indefinite present, possibly because they are coworkers, club co-members, or some other more or less regularized and frequent activity, or possibly due to spatial nearness (being next-door neighbors, etc.).  This is a #$SymmetricBinaryPredicate.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa538).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa538,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
