x_comment(x_onHorizon,"(#$onHorizon LOC HORIZON-OBJ) means that HORIZON-OBJ appears to be \"on the horizon\" from location LOC.  This is always context dependent.  If the two objects are fixed relative to the same planet, then #$onHorizon can relate them for a long time.  Otherwise the context can be fleeting.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa546).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa546,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
