x_comment('x_Exotic-Unusual',"An instance of #$ThingByNormalityInContext.  The collections of all things that are intriguingly unusual and rare in the indicated (often highly restrictive) context.  Exotic things are often foreign, but need not be.  Spices were exotic to Europeans of the 15th century, but not to those of the 21st.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa547).
