x_comment(x_OccasionalExposureAwareness,"The quantity of awareness which specifies that an agent X is aware of (knows something about) some individual object through having occasionally been in it's physical presence (been in contact with it, used it, etc.).  In the case of an agent X and a fax machine Y, for example, (#$exposedTo X Y OccasionalPhysicalPresenceAwareness) means that X has used Y several times and could probably be expected to know some things about how a fax machine is used by virtue of this exposure to one.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa550).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa550,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16526aa550,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part05.krf').
