x_comment(x_AcquaintancePredicate,"The collection of predicates that specify ways in which (and/or degrees to which) one person is acquainted with another agent [#$Agent-Generic].  Some instances of this collection are: #$famousPersonAcquaintance, #$trueFanAcquaintance, #$intimatelyAcquaintedWith, #$frequentlyInContactWith, etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa555).
