x_comment(x_SubcollectionOccursAtFn,"(#$SubcollectionOccursAtFn SCRIPTTYPE GEO-THING) is the collection of all instances of SCRIPTTYPE that occur [#$eventOccursAt] in the region of GEO-THING.  If GEO-THING is an instance of #$GeopoliticalEntity, then its territory (see #$territoryOf and #$TerritoryFn) is referred to.  Thus (#$SubcollectionOccursAtFn #$PoliticalProtesting  #$CityOfWashingtonDC) is the collection of political protests in the US capital and (#$SubcollectionOccursAtFn #$EscapeCaptivity #$Alcatraz-TheIsland) is the collection of escapes from Alcatraz island.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa559).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa559,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
