x_comment(x_EvaluativePropositionalAttitudePredicate,"A subcollection of #$EvaluativePredicate (q.v.) whose instances, are used to attribute evaluatory relations or assessments to propositions.  More precisely, an instance of #$EvaluativePropositionalAttitudePredicate can be used to relate an agent to a sentence (specifically, an #$ELSentence-Assertible) in such a way that the agent is actually making a particular sort of evaluative assessment of the state of affairs or proposition that the sentence expresses, and thereby assumes a particular attitude or cognitive stance toward that proposition (see #$evaluates-Propositional).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa566).
