x_comment(x_hasImmunityWithRespectToOrg,"(#$hasImmunityWithRespectToOrg ORG IMM ORG-TYPE) means that ORG, an instance of #$Organism-Whole, has the type of immunity IMM, an #$ImmunityPredicate, with respect to organisms of the type ORG-TYPE, i.e. (IMM ORG ORG-TYPE). If ORG is immune with respect to ORG-TYPE, Org is also said insusceptible to diseases caused by organisms of the type ORG-TYPE, see #$immuneWithRespectToPathogen. Contrast with #$hasImmunityWithRespectToDisease and #$immuneWithRespectToDisease.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa56d).
