x_comment(x_insIdenticalInQuantity,"(#$insIdenticalInQuantity COL QUANT-TYPE) means that all instances of COL have the same values of the quantity type QUANT-TYPE.  Here 'the same' means complete identity or very close resemblance -- what this means, and what the standard of closeness or identity is, depends on the context.  See #$identicalInQuantity, #$differentInQuantity, and #$resemblesInQuantity.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa57b).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa57b,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
