x_comment(x_simpleContactAcquaintances,"The predicate which specifies that persons X and Y have met each other at least once, and probably would be able to recall this, and even recognize each other, if they meet again.  If X has met Y, then Y has met X, thus this is a #$SymmetricBinaryPredicate.  This assumes that there was a meeting event in which X and Y interacted, that both were minimally conscious, etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa57c).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa57c,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
