x_comment(x_anatomicalPartCountRequired,"#$anatomicalPartCountRequired is an instance of #$ResourcePredicate. (#$anatomicalPartCountRequired ACT-TYPE PART-TYPE ROLE COUNT) means that the successful player of ROLE in an act of ACT-TYPE must have exactly COUNT many of #$anatomicalParts PART-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa590).
