x_comment(x_typeRequiresToPlayRole,"#$typeRequiresToPlayRole is an instance of #$ResourcePredicate. (#$typeRequiresToPlayRole OBJTYPE1 OBJTYPE2 EVENTTYPE ROLE) means that, in order to play ROLE in an event of EVENTTYPE, instances of OBJTYPE1 require some single instance of OBJTYPE2.  Note that this is neutral as to whether or not the instance of OBJTYPE1 desires to, needs to, or actually will play ROLE in an event of EVENTTYPE.  See also #$requiresToPlayRole.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa591).
