x_comment(x_requiresToPlayRole,"#$requiresToPlayRole is an instance of #$ResourcePredicate. (#$requiresToPlayRole OBJ OBJTYPE EVENTTYPE ROLE) means that, in order to play ROLE in an event of EVENTTYPE, OBJ requires an instance of OBJTYPE.  Note that this is neutral as to whether or not OBJ desires to, needs to, or actually will play ROLE in such an event.  See also #$typeRequiresToPlayRole.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa592).
