x_comment(x_physicalCopyOf,"(#$physicalCopyOf COPY ORIGINAL) means that COPY  is a physical copy of ORIGINAL.  If they are information bearing objects, then they contained and conveyed the same information at the time COPY was made.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa5a7).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa5a7,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
