x_comment(x_Shaft,"A specialization of #$SolidTangibleArtifact.  Each instance of #$Shaft is an artifact that is long, straight, cylindrical, and rigid. Instances of #$Shaft are usually made of wood, metal, or plastic.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa5ac).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa5ac,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
