x_comment(x_predominantLanguage,"(#$predominantLanguage COUNTRY LANGUAGE) means that most of the population that lives in the territory of COUNTRY speak LANGUAGE.  I.e., (#$languagesSpokenHere (#$TerritoryFn COUNTRY) LANGUAGE).  In #$DualistGeopoliticalMt (and its specMts), (#$genlPreds #$predominantLanguage #$languagesSpokenHere), since a country and its territory are conflated.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa5ad).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa5ad,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
