x_comment(x_transformedInto,"An instance of #$ObjectPredicate that relates two instances of #$SomethingExisting.  (#$transformedInto DESTROYED CREATED) means that CREATED is created immediately after DESTROYED is destroyed (so that (#$contiguousAfter CREATED DESTROYED) holds).  Moreover, the material that constituted DESTROYED consitutes much, if not all, of CREATED at the moment it is created.  See also the related collection #$PhysicalTransformationEvent.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa5af).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa5af,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
