x_comment(x_levelOfPhysicalExertion,"(#$levelOfPhysicalExertion AGNT ACT LEVEL) means that AGNT does ACT with a level of physical exertion LEVEL.  E.g., (#$levelOfPhysicalExertion DonovanBailey RunningMens100MRaceIn1996Olympics #$veryHighAmountOf).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa5cd).
