x_comment(x_promotesRisk,"(#$promotesRisk EVENT AGENT RESULT-SIT-TYPE ROLE) means that if (#$doneBy EVENT AGENT), then EVENT contributes to AGENT being at risk for playing the role ROLE in a situation of type RESULT-SIT-TYPE as a result.  This predicate is intended to be used to express long-term risks, like getting cancer from smoking. See also #$immediateRisk for risks that would occur during the event rather than at some later time.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa5ee).
