xc_mapping_rows(a65b16526aa61f,[]).
x_comment(x_divisionOfGraphicalStructure,"(#$divisionOfGraphicalStructure STRUCTURE DIVISION) means that the #$GraphicalStructure DIVISION is one of the #$subStructures of the #$GraphicalStructure STRUCTURE.  DIVISION is not any arbitrarily selected sub-structure of STRUCTURE, however, but a coherent, self-contained division of STRUCTURE according to some existing convention or standard of practice.  In most contexts, chapters, sections, and subsections are regarded as divisions.  In various text classification systems, other parts of a document structure may be considered divisions.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa620).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa620,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
