x_comment(x_highestDivisionOfGraphicalStructure,"(#$highestDivisionOfGraphicalStructure STRUCTURE DIVISION) means that the #$GraphicalStructure DIVISION is at the highest level of division within the #$GraphicalStructure STRUCTURE.  Each DIVISION is a division of a #$GraphicalStructure according to some convention or standard practice (see #$divisionOfGraphicalStructure).  For example, if (#$highestDivisionOfGraphicalStructure CWSTRUCTURE DIVISION) is true, then there is no division of CWSTRUCTURE of which DIVISION is one of its #$subStructures.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa621).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa621,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
