x_comment(x_textStringIsReferenceTypeInWork,"(#$textStringIsReferenceTypeInWork WORK TEXT REFTYPE) means that the #$TextString TEXT, which is a reference to something external to WORK (see #$referenceInWorkTo), has the function or purpose characterized by REFTYPE, a instance of #$TextStringTypeByReferenceType.  For example, a #$TextString in a #$BookCopy that attributes a particular photograph reproduced in the #$BookCopy to an individual photographer would be an instance of  #$AttributiveReference.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa623).
