x_comment('x_causes-SitSit',"(#$causes-SitSit CAUSE EFFECT)  says that the situation CAUSE caused the situation EFFECT.    See #$NoteAboutCausationPredicates for a map of related predicates.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa632).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa632,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
