x_comment(x_HighlighterPen,"The collection highlighters. These are a specific kind of #$Marker-WritingImplement with a wide tip and ink which is transparent and in very bright colors. The intended purpose of a highlighter is not writing but highlighting passages by running the pen over them. One can, of course, also write with it.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa639).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa639,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
