x_comment(x_BindingList,"A special type of #$List containing #$Lists as elements.  In a #$BindingList, the list elements are lists which are all exactly two elements long.  Each pair represents a binding, in which the first element can be substituted for the second element.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa63e).
