x_comment(x_InfectiousDiseaseEpidemic,"#$InfectiousDiseaseEpidemic is a specialization of #$Epidemic and (#$GroupFn #$Infection).  In each instance of #$InfectiousDiseaseEpidemic, an infection is spread through a large population (see #$InfectionTransmissionEvent).  Not all epidemics are infectious disease epidemics.  Any group of #$AilmentConditions in excess of the norm for some location might be considered an #$Epidemic. For example, there could be an epidemic of (#$CancerFn #$Throat) in the #$CityOfIzmirTurkey.  See also #$InfectionEpidemicFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa6cb).
