x_comment(x_IterationOfTypeFn,"(#$IterationOfTypeFn EVENT-TYPE) denotes the collection of all\nevents that consist of iterations of individual events of type\nEVENT-TYPE. Thus e.g. (#$IterationOfTypeFn #$Tapping-Hitting) would be the collection\nof all 'iterative tapping' events, in which an agent performs a tapping\naction many times. Many verbs naturally denote iterative event types\n(cf. also #$IterativeEventType).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa7b4).
