x_comment(x_ConceptualWork,"A specialization of #$DevisedPracticeOrWork (q.v.).   Each instance of #$ConceptualWork is a partially abstract work (in the sense that each instance has a beginning in time, but lacks a location in space) which either has an associated #$AbstractInformationStructure (q.v.) or has a version with an associated #$AbstractInformationStructure.  Conceptual works or versions of conceptual works can be instantiated in instances of #$InformationBearingThing (q.v.); every such instantiation of a conceptual work will also be an instantiation of an instance of #$AbstractInformationStructure.  Notable specializations of #$ConceptualWork include #$ComputerProgram-CW, #$VisualWork, and #$Book-CW.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa7fe).
