x_comment(x_tokensString,"This predicate is a specialization of #$instantiationOfAIS that relates an instance of #$CharacterStringToken to the instance of #$CharacterString it tokens.  (#$tokensString TOKEN STRING) means that TOKEN is a physical token or representation or realization of the abstract STRING.  By definition, any character-string token #$tokensString exactly one character-string; conversely, a given character-string might be tokened by various distinct character-string tokens.  Character-string tokens, like instances of #$CharacterToken, come in the form of inscriptions, sounds, or electromagnetic encodings; and they often, but not always, consist in spatial or temporal series of character tokens.  See also #$tokensCharacter.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa810).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa810,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
