x_comment(x_nearestNeighborInSet,"This predicate relates an element of a set to its\n\"nearest neighbor\" in the set.  That is, (#$nearestNeighborInSet P Q\nSET) means that (i) P and Q are elements of SET, and (ii) P is the\nclosest element to Q in SET, with respect to some \"distance\" function. Note that in general, it does not follow that Q is also the closest element to P in SET.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa820).
