x_comment(x_InternetSearching,"A specialization of #$ElectronicDataSearching.  Each instance of #$InternetSearching is an event in which a computer is used to search for information on the #$Internet.  The desired information may be sought by browsing, or by using search engines (see #$SearchEngine) or Information Retrieval systems, or by invoking other 'machine agents' to find the information.  The information sources are presumed to be distributed among computers on the #$Internet distant from the computer interface used by the searcher.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa823).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa823,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
