x_comment(x_betweenOnPath,"An instance of #$QuaternaryPredicate.  (#$betweenOnPath POINT1 POINT2 POINT3 PATH) means that POINT1, POINT2, and POINT3 are points on the path PATH (see the predicate #$onPath) and POINT1 is between POINT2 and POINT3.  Note that (#$betweenOnPath POINT1 POINT2 POINT3 PATH) implies nothing about the ordering of POINT2 and POINT3; it just implies that POINT1 is between them.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa830).
