x_comment(x_cavityConnectedAlongPathSide,"An instance of #$ConnectionPredicate, and a specialization of #$spatiallyRelated.  (#$cavityConnectedAlongPathSide CAVITY PATH) means that there is a portal somewhere along the wall of the #$Path-Simple PATH which leads to the #$CavityOrContainer CAVITY.  Consequently, PATH is connected to CAVITY at that portal (so that (#$connectedAtContact CAVITY PATH) holds when CAVITY is tangible).  For example, any room opening along the side of a hallway would be related to that hallway by #$cavityConnectedAlongPathSide.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa839).
