x_comment(x_AcademicSemester,"A specialization of #$AcademicTerm. Each instance of this collection is an occurrence consisting of the complex of scheduled activities taking place at an educational institution over a roughly 4-month long period.  This is not a collection of pure time intervals: note that, for example, the 2003 spring semesters at Boston University and at the University of Texas, Austin are represented by distinct, though of course temporally overlapping, instances.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa83f).
