x_comment(x_AcademicQuarter,"A specialization of AcademicTerm. Each instance of this collection is an occurrence consisting of the complex of scheduled activities taking place at an educational institution over a roughly 3-month long period: one quarter of their AcademicYear. This is not a collection of pure time intervals: note that, for example, the 2003 spring quarters at Stanford University and at UCLA would be represented by distinct, though of course temporally overlapping, instances. ") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa840).
