x_comment(x_SubPathBetweenFn,"An instance of both #$TernaryFunction and #$PartialFunction.  When applied to a #$Path-Simple PATH and different points POINT1 and POINT2 on PATH, (#$SubPathBetweenFn PATH POINT1 POINT2) returns a unique subpath SUB of PATH that is between POINT1 and POINT2.  Note that this function may be undefined for instances of #$Path-Simple that are _not_ part of a path system (see the collection #$PathSystem), since only in the context of a path system is it guaranteed that a subpath exists between each pair of points on the path.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa844).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa844,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
