x_comment(x_Morning,"A specialization of #$QualitativeTimeOfDay. An instance of this collection is a daily recurring event during which the sun apparently `rises' and `moves' to its `highest' position in the daily cycle, i.e. from a #$Sunrise to the ensuing noon. The definition is more complex in polar regions in which it is possible that the sun does not rise or set during a day. ") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa869).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa869,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
