x_comment(x_Poisoning,"A specialization of #$AilmentCondition (q.v.).  This is the collection of _conditions_ resulting from the intake of a substance by an organism (where the kind and quantity of the substance is toxic to the organism in question).  Note that none of the instances of this collection include the actual intake of the substance.  For a collection with instances that do include these, see #$Poisoning-Script.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa889).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa889,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
