x_comment(x_HumanTypeByHairColor,"A collection of collections.  Each instance is a collection of #$HomoSapiens grouped by the color of the hair on their head.   This is commonly used in personal descriptions.  In addition there are common  beliefs about the personality traits of people of particular hair colors.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa8a4).
