x_comment(x_queryAllRolesInSituationType,"A #$QueryDedicatedPredicate used for querying for all the roles that a given actortype plays w.r.t. a situation type or w.r.t. any sub-situation type of that situation type.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa8b4).
