x_comment(x_SituationTypePredicate,"A collection of #$Predicates each intance of which takes an subcollection of #$Situation as its second argument.  For details about the uses of such predicates, see the specializations  #$SituationTypeSlot and #$SituationTypeTernaryPredicate.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa8b5).
