x_comment(x_sitTypeHasSubSitTypeWithRolePlayerOfType,"(#$sitTypeHasSubSitTypeWithRolePlayerOfType SIT-TYPE SUBSIT-TYPE OBJ-TYPE ROLE) means that there is at least one subsituation of type SUBSIT-TYPE in any instance of SIT-TYPE that has an object of type OBJ-TYPE playing the role ROLE.  There may be other subsituations of type SUBSIT-TYPE in the instance of SIT-TYPE which do not have an object of type OBJ-TYPE playing that role.  See #$onlyTypePlaysRoleInSituationType for the meaning that every subsituation of type SUBSIT-TYPE in SIT-TYPE has an instance of OBJ-TYPE playing role ROLE, but not requiring any such subsituation to exist.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa8c1).
