x_comment('x_inheritTypeOfRolePlayers-SitTypeToSubSitType-Unique',"This predicate is meant to state a very strong condition that applies to a number of specializations of #$Situation: namely, that if a particular type of thing is referenced as playing some role in all instances of a situation type, and the same type is referenced as playing some other role or roles in particular sub-situation types of the situation type, then an instance of the type that plays the specified role in a particular instance of the situation type overall plays all of the other roles specified for that type in the situations that instantiate the particular sub-situation types.  More specifically, if it is known that (#$inheritTypeOfRolePlayers-SitTypeToSubSitType-Unique SITTYPE THINGTYPE), (#$onlyTypePlaysRoleInSituationType SITTYPE THINGTYPE ROLE), (#$properSubSituationTypes SITTYPE SUBSITTYPE), and (#$onlyTypePlaysRoleInSituationType SITTYPE THINGTYPE SUBSITTYPE OTHERROLE), then, for any SIT such that (#$isa SIT SITTYPE) and any instance of THINGTYPE, THING, such that (ROLE SIT THING), and any instance of SUBSITTYPE, SUBSIT, such that (#$properSubSituations SITTYPE SUBSITTYPE), (OTHERROLE SUBSITTYPE THING).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa8ca).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa8ca,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16526aa8ca,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part05.krf').
