x_comment(x_OrganizationTypeByProfitMotive,"A collection of two disjoint collections, #$CommercialOrganization and #$NonProfitOrganization.  Each instance of #$OrganizationTypeByProfitMotive is a set whose elements are distinguished by either the fact that their activities are motivated by the desire to make a profit for their owners or by the fact that no such profit motive exists (or that any profit motive is secondary to a primary non-profit motive).  For example, #$SierraClub is an instance of #$NonProfitOrganization.  Although #$SierraClub may engage in activities designed to generate a profit (e.g., selling #$SierraClub products), those activities are engaged in only for the purpose of furthering the primary goal of #$SierraClub (which does not involve making money for the organization's owners (it has none) or members).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa8cc).
