x_comment(x_genlsAtLeast,"Intended for use in the representation of underspecified plural noun phrases, as in the well-worn example `The sailors danced with the waitresses'. (#$genlsAtLeast NUM SUBCOLL COLL) means that SUBCOLL is a subcollection of COLL consisting of at least NUM elements. In the example above, `the sailors' can be rendered as (#$thereExists ?SUBCOLL (#$genlsAtLeast 2 ?SUBCOLL #$Sailor)), and the same form can be applied to `the waitresses'.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa8da).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa8da,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
