x_comment(x_coaSupportingTask,"(#$coaSupportingTask SUPPORTING SUPPORTED) means that SUPPORTED requires the completion of SUPPORTING.  SUPPORTING and SUPPORTED are not assigned to the same agent(s), or to different tiers of some organizational hierarchy.  Contrast this with #$coaSubTasks.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa903).
