x_comment(x_Screaming,"An instance of #$ControllableAutonomousActionType and a specialization of #$MakingAnOralSound.  Each instance of #$Screaming is an event in which an agent makes a loud, piercing oral sound, often as an expression of #$Fear or #$Anger.  The sound made in an instance of #$Screaming (i.e. the scream) may or may not be articulate.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa929).
