x_comment(x_ServingFoodOrDrink,"A specialization of both #$GivingSomething and #$ServiceEvent.  Each instance of #$ServingFoodOrDrink is an event in which an item of food or drink is served.  Each such event involves the server picking up the food or drink from a preparation or pickup area, carrying it (cf. the scene #$CarryingWhileLocomoting) and ends when the food or drink is deposited at a location where those being served may eat or drink it (cf. the scene #$PuttingSomethingSomewhere).  Such events are typically part of the job of any restaurant server who waits on tables (cf. #$WaitPerson), and they may also be performed by a host or servant at a dinner party or banquet, or by a family member at a home meal.  Note that events in which a \"serving\" of food is placed from a common dish onto a diner's plate are not instances of #$ServingFoodOrDrink.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa92a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa92a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
