x_comment(x_hypothesizes,"(#$hypothesizes AGENT PROP) means that AGENT suspends disbelief to consider the ramification of PROP being true.  AGENT need not believe [#$beliefs] that PROP is true, but may think it likely [#$thinksProbable], be totally unsure, or even believe PROP to be false [i.e. believe (#$not PROP)].") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa930).
