x_comment(x_IntelAttack,"A subset of (#$AttemptingFn #$StealingInformation),  #$IntelAttack is the collection of attacks perpetrated with  the ambition of retrieving mission-critical enemy data. In this sort of attack, perpetrators first determine what information to target, then determine the location of theinformation, and, finally, obtain the information from the enemy.  The information targeted can be protected by any #$levelOfSecurity. Because instances of #$IntelAttack are not all done in secret, #$IntelAttack is not a specialization of #$IntelligenceGathering (q.v.).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa936).
