x_comment(x_costarsIn,"(#$costarsIn ACTOR1 ACTOR2 MOVIE) means that actors ACTOR1 and ACTOR2 both appear as actors in the same film MOVIE.  For example (#$costarsIn #$LeonardoDicaprio #$KathyBates #$Titanic-TheMovie) means that both LeonardoDicaprio and  KathyBates appear in 'Titanic', the movie.  Note that, although the name  might suggest otherwise, the two actors need not have the same billing or  status in the movie. See also #$costars.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa939).
