x_comment(x_Series,"A specialization of #$Group (q.v.).  Each instance of #$Series is a complex temporal thing in which two or more other things are ordered in a linear fashion.  Examples include a line of people at a ticket booth (an instance of the specialization #$PhysicalSeries) and a series of pitches in a baseball game (an instance of the specialization #$EventSeries).  In each instance of #$Series, there is some relation by which its members are ordered (see the related predicate #$seriesOrderedBy); this relation often varies from series to series.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa944).
