x_comment('x_MovingAComputerFile-CopyingAndDeleting',"A specialization of #$FileOperation and #$GeneralizedTransfer. In each instance of #$MovingAComputerFile-CopyingAndDeleting, a computer reads a file, creates a new file with the same contents in a different physical location (see #$CopyingAComputerFile) and then deletes the original file (see #$DeletingAFile).  For events in which a computer file is only <i>metaphorically</I> moved, see #$MovingAComputerFile-Metaphorically.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa950).
