x_comment(x_Supervising,"A specialization of #$InfluencingAnAgent.  Each instance of #$Supervising is an event in which an agent (the supervisor) directs and oversees the performance of some #$PurposefulAction which is performed by some other agent/s (the supervisee/s).  In any instance of #$Supervising there is just one action being supervised; however, that action may have multiple performers.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa96d).
