x_comment(x_Experimenting,"A specialization of #$CheckingWhetherConditionObtains.  Each instance of #$Experimenting is an event in which one performs tests to determine whether an hypothesis is true.  The tests in question need not be empirical in nature (cf. #$ThoughtExperimenting).  For the common case in which the tests in question <i>are</i> empirical, see #$Experimenting-Empirical.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa970).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa970,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
