x_comment(x_playsRoleWithFrequency,"(#$playsRoleWithFrequency INSTANCE SITTYPE ROLE FREQ) means that INSTANCE plays ROLE in instances of SITTYPE with the frequency FREQ.  Note that FREQ can be a numeric value, or it can be a coarse-grained measure such as  #$Often or #$Rarely. For a version of this predicate which is type-level with respect to the first argument, see #$frequencyOfActionType.  To state more concisely that an object 'regularly' plays ROLE in instances of SIT-TYPE, see #$playsRoleInActionTypeRegularly.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa971).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa971,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
