x_comment(x_ThrowingAnObject,"An instance of #$TemporalObjectType and a specialization of #$ProjectilePropelling.  Each instance of #$ThrowingAnObject is a #$VoluntaryBodyMovement in which someone sends something flying through the air by quickly moving or straightening his #$Arm, and, in the process, releasing the object from his grasp.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa973).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa973,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
