x_comment(x_decreasesImmediately,"(#$decreasesImmediately PERIOD THING SLOT) means that the value for the predicate SLOT applied to THING (in the first argument position) is lower immediately after (#$STIF q.v.) PERIOD than it was immediately before (#$STIB q.v.) PERIOD.  PERIOD may be any instance of #$TemporalThing, i.e., anything that has a time period associated with it, whether an event, an entity, a life stage, etc. No causal connection is implied between the #$TemporalThing PERIOD and the decrease.  See #$NoteAboutQuantityChangePredicates for a map of related predicates.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa976).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa976,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16526aa976,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part05.krf').
