x_comment(x_Conservatism,"An instance of #$PoliticalBeliefSystem.  Agents with this ideology place an emphasis on the value of stability and tradition in politics, and are generally skeptical of proposals to radically reshape society via government policies.  In the United States, #$Conservatism is associated with laissez faire economics, opposition to abortion, and other particular policies, but none of these is essential to the ideology itself.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa97d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa97d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
