x_comment(x_Marxism,"An instance of #$PoliticalBeliefSystem.  Agents with this ideology hold, following #$KarlMarx, that in a capitalist economy the working class (i.e. the proletariat) is exploited by those who control the means of production (i.e. the bourgeoisie).  Adherents of #$Marxism are often (but not necessarily) adherents of #$Communism (q.v.).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa981).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa981,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16526aa981,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part05.krf').
