x_comment('x_Liberalism-SocialDemocratic',"An instance of #$PoliticalBeliefSystem.  Agents with this ideology advocate signficant government intervention in capitalist economies to ameliorate inequality of material resources among citizens.  #$Liberalism-SocialDemocratic should not be confused with #$Liberalism-Classical (q.v.).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa984).
