x_comment(x_obligationFulfilled,"(#$obligationFulfilled ACT OB) means that the #$Action ACT fulfills the #$Obligation OB. Note that this is stronger than an action merely being in conformity with some obligation, but is supposed to indicate that an action somehow positively fulfills an obligation. For instance, paying the minimum balance owed on my #$CreditCard would fulfill my financial obligation to the credit card company, but it would not fulfill my obligation to honor my father and mother, although it is not in conflict with that obligation.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa988).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa988,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
