x_comment(x_ComputerCrashing,"An instance of #$ComputerActivityType and a specialization of #$ChangingDeviceState and #$PerformanceDegradation-Computer.  Each instance of #$ComputerCrashing is an event in which a #$Computer, often unexpectedly, loses its ability to function properly.  #$ComputerCrashing does not include events in which a computer shuts down by following a program provided for the purpose of carefully shutting it down.  A user may, however, intentionally crash a computer system.  Often an instance of #$ComputerCrashing will have multiple instances of #$ComputerProcessCrashing as #$subEvents.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa99b).
