x_comment(x_Camera,"A specialization of #$ArtifactTypeByGenericCategory.  Each instance of #$Camera is a #$VisualInformationRecordingDevice that focuses a #$VisualImage through a #$Lens-Artificial and records it on some kind of storage medium, e.g. #$PhotographicFilm (see #$FilmCamera) or #$ComputerMemory (see #$DigitalCamera).  A #$Camera may record #$StillImages one at a time (see #$StillCamera) or in rapid succession to create a #$MovingImage (see #$VideoCamera).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa9ad).
