x_comment('x_ElectronicIntelligenceAttack-MissionCritical',"A subset of  #$IntelAttack and  #$ElectronicIntelligenceAttack-Information, #$ElectronicIntelligenceAttack-MissionCritical is the collection of  intel attacks perpetrated on instances of  #$ComputationalSystem with the  ambition of  retrieving instances of #$InformationDesignation-MissionCritical. Note that   #$ElectronicIntelligenceAttack-MissionCritical differs from     #$ElectronicIntelligenceAttack-General in the requirement that the information desired be mission critical.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa9b3).
