x_comment('x_Terrier-FunctionalGroup',"A collection of #$Dogs. Instances of #$Terrier-FunctionalGroup are dogs whose breed background includes some #$DogTypeByBreed-Pure developed for the hunting and killing of small-to-medium-sized animals. The name 'Terrier' is derived from the Latin 'terra,' or 'ground'. Most terrier types were originally developed in the #$UnitedKingdomOfGreatBritainAndNorthernIreland.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa9b5).
