x_comment(x_Hepatitis,"A collection of diseases. Any instance of #$Hepatitis is an inflammation of the liver. Main specializations are #$ViralHepatitis, a collection of viral diseases due to various kinds of viruses (see #$Hepatitis-VirusType), alcoholic hepatitis, resulting from alcoholism, instances of which are often precursors of cirrhosis of the liver, and toxic hepatitis, resulting from consumption of various substances or drugs.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa9b6).
