x_comment(x_TerroristAct,"A specialization of #$HostileSocialAction.  Each instance of #$TerroristAct is an action which is performed with a political objective, and which is intended to be coercive through inducing terror (typically through the threat of future attacks).  Historically, the perpetrators of terrorist acts have not considered military targets to be uniformly more legitimate than civilian targets.  An important specialization is #$TerroristAttack.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa9b7).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa9b7,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
