x_comment(x_Massacre,"A collection of complex, violent events.  In each instance of #$Massacre, many people (or animals) are killed.  The number of #$victims may range from tens to thousands (or more).  In English, `massacre' has the connotation that the victims are significantly overpowered by the #$perpetrators and that the slaughter occurs without resistance or without a fair fight.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa9b8).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa9b8,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
