x_comment(x_Cracking,"A collection of change events.  In each #$Cracking, something becomes cracked.  I.e., two or more areas of the thing are separated from one another (though perhaps not divided wholly into parts).  In order to undergo a #$Cracking, the #$objectOfStateChange must be a #$SolidTangibleThing.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa9c1).
