x_comment(x_PetCare,"A specialization of #$TakingCareOfSomething.  Each instance of this collection is an event in which some agent engages in actions intended to maintain or promote the good health of a pet, presumably one's own pet.  A notable specialization of this collection is #$WalkingAPet.  Positive examples of this collection include vet visits and instances of #$FeedingAnAnimal in which the animal is a pet.  Negative examples of this collection include instances of #$FeedingAnAnimal in which the animal fed is not a pet; consider a farmer feeding livestock or a person feeding ducks at a pond.  A borderline case might be those instances of events of taking care of another person's pet.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa9c6).
