x_comment('x_interArgCondIsa1-2',"(#$interArgCondIsa1-2 PRED INDEP-COL COND-COL DEP-COL) is shorthand for the class of rules that state the following: For every instance INDEP-INST of INDEP-COL, if there is some instance COND-INST of COND-COL such that (PRED INDEP-INST COND-INST) holds, COND-INST will be an element of DEP-COL. For example,(#$interArgCondIsa1-2 #$anatomicalParts #$Vertebrate #$Head-AnimalBodyPart #$Head-Vertebrate) -- if a #$Vertebrate has a head as an #$anatomicalParts, that head is a #$Head-Vertebrate.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa9db).
