x_comment(x_primaryResidence,"The predicate #$primaryResidence relates an instance of #$Person to an instance of #$HumanResidence. (#$primaryResidence PERSON RESIDENCE) means that RESIDENCE is the permanent primary of PERSON. This usually means that RESIDENCE is the home at which PERSON spends most of his/her time, as opposed to a vacation home.  While a person may have several residences, only one can be that person's primary residence. A single dwelling, however, can serve as a primary residence for many people, for instance all members of a family.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa9dc).
