x_comment('x_Portal-Underspecified',"The collection of locations, tangible or otherwise, which are typically conceptualized by human beings for purposes of common-sense reasoning as Portals. This collection thus includes tangible Portals such as #$Gate, #$WindowPortal and #$DoorInABuilding, as well as metaphoric portal. For instance, intermediate goal states are frequently conceptualized as abstract portals, as in 'He went through Bob to meet the vice president' and 'He went through hell to get his kids back'.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa9f2).
