x_comment(x_EroticDramaMovie,"A type of drama with an emphasis  on eroticism and where a sexual relationship plays an important  role in the plot. Often these frank films contain elements of  graphic nudity, sexual intercourse, and fetishism, yet these acts  rarely are portrayed gratuitously or for simple voyeuristic  pleasure. Often, the attention is drawn to issues of pleasure,  companionship, and emotional and physical necessity. Unlike  exploitation or #$PornographicMovies, erotic dramas offer more elaborate  dramatic structure, deeper psychological character motivations  and display a higher artistic level; some of them have become  acknowledged classics.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa9f4).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa9f4,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
