x_comment(x_MakingACriminalCharge,"A specialization of #$Accusing and #$LegalProceeding (qq.v.).  Each instance of #$MakingACriminalCharge is an action of making a #$CriminalCharge (q.v.).  In most western legal systems, this is done by a court, to a legal agent.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa9fb).
