x_comment(x_CopyingAComputerFile,"A specialization of #$AccessingAFile-ReadOnly, #$CreatingAFile and #$IBTCopying. In each instance of this collection a computer reads a file and creates a new file with the same contents. Immediately after the event, the original file and the new file will contain exactly the same information. The two files may be stored on the same or different storage media. Notable specializations of this collection include #$UploadingAFile and #$DownloadingAFile. See also #$MovingAComputerFile-CopyingAndDeleting.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aa9fc).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aa9fc,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
