x_comment(x_TimeTravel,"A specialization of #$GeneralizedTransfer.  Each instance of #$TimeTravel is an #$Event in which an agent \"travels through time\", i.e. somehow travels into the past or into the future (at a rate significantly faster than we ordinarily \"travel\" into the future).  There is no widespread agreement on whether time travel is possible; if it is impossible, then #$TimeTravel has no instances.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaa00).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aaa00,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
