x_comment(x_spacecraftDestinationType,"(#$spacecraftDestinationType CRAFT OBJ-TYPE) means that the destination of #$Spacecraft CRAFT is an instance of the subcollection of #$AstronomicalObject OBJ-TYPE. Typically, a successful mission using CRAFT involves CRAFT either landing, orbiting, or flying by OBJ-TYPE. For example, (#$spacecraftDestinationType #$NearEarthAsteroidRendezvous-Probe #$Asteroid) means that an instance of #$Asteroid is the destination of the space probe #$NearEarthAsteroidRendezvous-Probe. Use #$spacecraftDestination when the destination is an instance of #$AstronomicalObject.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaa04).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aaa04,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
