x_comment(x_SoftcoreFn,"A #$CollectionDenotingFunction which takes as an argument a subset of #$SexualEntertainmentThing and returns the collection of instances of that product which one might call softcore.  Any #$PornographicMaterial which is dubbed softcore usually does NOT involve explicit sexual acts, but is still considered pornographic because it does contain nudity and implied sexual messages.  For instance, (#$SoftcoreFn #$PornographicMagazineSeries) would return the collection of all pornographic magazines which contain nudity or partial nudity, but no explicit sex.  An instance of this collection is #$Playboy-TheMagazine.  See also #$HardcoreFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaa07).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aaa07,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
