x_comment(x_StorageOrganization,"A collection of organizations.  An element of #$StorageOrganization is an organization that has as a main function the storage of goods.  A storage organization may also be (but is not necessarily) a #$DistributionOrganization.  It may or may not be among the #$subOrganizations of a larger organization, either a #$Business or a government organization.  Example: a #$FederalSupplyDepot engaged in, e.g., moving and storage of goods.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaa1e).
