x_comment(x_mainIngredientsSet,"(#$mainIngredientsSet FOOD SET) means that the food or drink, FOOD, has among its main ingredients the types of #$EdibleStuff in SET.  'Main' ingredients need not be those that make up the bulk of FOOD, or even are larger than other ingredients in FOOD; rather, main ingredients include those that make the food distinctive.  For example, anchovies are among the main ingredients in an anchovy pizza, even though they are only a small part of it.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaa21).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aaa21,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
