x_comment(x_Percent,"A variable-arity #$MathematicalFunctionOnScalars (q.v.).  When applied to a number or other #$NumericInterval (pair of numeric-intervals), #$Percent returns the instance of #$IntervalOnNumberLine that is its argument (the interval between its two arguments) divided by 100.  For example (#$Percent 110) is 1.1, and (#$Percent 10 20) is (#$Unity 0.1 0.2): the interval between 0.1 and 0.2 inclusive.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaa31).
