x_comment(x_performsInstancesAsPartOfJob,"An instance of #$FirstOrderCollectionPredicate (q.v.) that  relates a given type of event to people who perform (see #$performedBy) events of that type as part of their job.  (#$performsInstancesAsPartOfJob EVENTTYPE PERSON) means that PERSON  performs instances of EVENTYPE as a significant part of his or her job. For example, #$KeithRichards performs instances of #$WritingAMusicalComposition as part of his work, and a #$SecurityGuard performs instances of  #$ProtectingSomething.  (The latter example is expressed by the  generalization '(#$relationInstanceAll #$performsInstancesAsPartOfJob #$ProtectingSomething #$SecurityGuard)'.)") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaa39).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aaa39,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
