x_comment('x_Stealing-Physical',"A specialization of #$Stealing.  In an instance of #$Stealing-Physical, the perpetrator is physically at the location with the stolen goods when committing the crime.  The perpetrator physically removes the goods.  The owner of the goods may or may not be present.  Thus, this collection includes all burglaries and stealing of cars from parking lots, as well as robberies and carjackings.  In contrast, instances of #$Stealing-Embezzlement need not be instances of #$Stealing-Physical.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaa3f).
