x_comment(x_PyrotechnicDevice,"A specialization of #$Device-OneTimeUse and #$ExplosiveDevice.  Each instance of #$PyrotechnicDevice is a manufactured item that contains a portion of #$PyrotechnicMaterial and whose purpose is to use combustion processes to propell objects, create visual displays, or create sonic effects. The term has been used more broadly so as to include military ordnance, but the present sense means to exclude weapons. Any sort of fireworks count as pyrotechnic devices in the present sense, as do stationary and airborne signal flares, including those intended for military use.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaa40).
