x_comment(x_CultureDefiningMicrotheory,"A specialization of #$CultureSpecificMicrotheory, each    instance of which contains assertions describing the beliefs,    practices, and artifacts that characterize some particular instance   of #$Culture-Practice.  See also #$mtDefinesCulture, #$CultureBeliefsMicrotheory, #$cultureBeliefs,    #$culturePractices, #$cultureSpecialPractices, and    #$cultureArtifacts.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaa51).
