x_comment(x_CultureSpecificMicrotheory,"A collection of microtheories, each instance of which   contains only assertions that reflect, and are considered true    from, the perspective of a particular #$Culture-Practice (and its subcultures,    if any).   Beyond this, the type of relevance or pertinence of   the microtheory to the culture will depend on other dimension    attributes for the microtheory, including modality.  See also    #$mtOfCulture.  For a specialization of this collection whose    instances are microtheories in which the characteristic beliefs,    practices, and artifacts of particular cultures are precisely specified,    see #$CultureDefiningMicrotheory.  See also #$CultureBeliefsMicrotheory.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaa52).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aaa52,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
