x_comment('x_Goodness-Moral',"A linear-ordered specialization of #$EvaluativeQuantity  whose instances reflect assessments of the relative moral worth of a particular thing.  Such assessments are usually made in relation to some (often implicit) standard held by the assessor.  Particular instances of this collection can be obtained via the various #$GenericValueFunctions.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaa53).
