x_comment(x_PhysicalAmountSlot,"A specialization of both #$MeasurableQuantitySlot and #$PhysicalFeatureBinaryPredicate (qq.v.).  Each instance of #$PhysicalAmountSlot is a binary predicate used to relate a spatial thing (of some kind or other) to one of its numerically-quantifiable physical attributes (such as its length, mass, or volume).  Examples include #$lengthOfObject, #$massOfObject, and #$bodyTemperature.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaad3).
