x_comment(x_distributionMedium,"(#$distributionMedium CW MEDIUM) means that copies (instantiations) of the conceptual work CW are (legally) available in format MEDIUM. For example, (#$distributionMedium (#$SoftwareVersionFn #$MSWindows9x \"98\") #$CD-ROM) means that copies of the Windows 98 software are available on CD-ROM.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaad4).
