x_comment(x_evokes,"(#$evokes OBJ QUANT) means that as a consequence of perceiving OBJ, a typical sane intelligent perceiving agent would experience a quantity of #$SensoryQuantity QUANT.  E.g., in some contexts, (#$evokes #$StatueOfLiberty (#$HighAmountFn #$Pride)).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaad7).
