x_comment('x_Landmark-Underspecified',"The collection of regions/areas, tangible or otherwise, which are typically conceptualized by human beings for purposes of common-sense reasoning as spatial landmarks. This collection thus includes tangible #$GeographicalRegions such as #$CityOfDublinIreland, as well as temporal landmarks such as dates and times (e.g., 9 o'clock) and metaphoric landmarks such as ages and scalar values (e.g., 'at 43, Bill Gates is the richest man in the world'). In lexico-semantic terms, #$Landmark-Underspecified is the semantic category specified for by prepositions such as 'at' : while one can say 'on my mind' and 'in my mind', one cannot say 'at my mind'. The #$Mind can be conceptualized as a #$Container-Underspecified and as a #$SurfaceRegion-Underspecified (on which events and things can 'make impressions') but not as a #$Landmark-Underspecified.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaadf).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aaadf,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
