x_comment(x_insMarketedAs,"The predicate #$insMarketedAs relates a type of product to a category in which it is marketed.  (#$insMarketedAs PRODTYPE MKTCAT) means that (at least some) elements of the #$ProductType PRODTYPE are typically marketed to potential consumers as belonging to the #$ProductTypeByMarketCategory MKTCAT.  For example, instances of #$FishingPole are marketed in the #$SportingGoodsMarketCategory; instances of #$SparkPlug are marketed in the #$StandardAutoMarketCategory; and instances of installing a computer network are marketed in the #$ComputerHardwareServiceMC.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaae2).
