x_comment(x_agentPosesThreat,"(#$agentPosesThreat THREAT-AGT AGT) means that THREAT-AGT is disposed to and is capable of acting in a way which threatens a vital interest of AGT.  The class of 'vital' interests in this sense includes (for instances of #$Person) physical and financial well-being, (for instances of #$Country) goals which fall under #$VitalNationalInterest, (for other instances of #$Organization) the ability to fulfill AGT's main function.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaaea).
