x_comment('x_equipmentOfUnit-TypeCount',"(#$equipmentOfUnit-TypeCount UNIT EQUIP-TYPE NUM) means that the agent UNIT possesses NUM instances of the equipment type EQUIP-TYPE.  Nothing is implied regarding the condition of that equipment.  See also the more specific #$equipmentOfUnit-Operational, #$equipmentOfUnit-Damaged, and #$equipmentOfUnit-Destroyed.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaaef).
