x_comment(x_StabbingSomeone,"The collection of all instances of #$StabbingSomething where the #$objectActedOn (and by extension the #$maleficiary -- see #$genlPredsWRTTypes) is a #$Person.  This is currently specified in terms of semantic constraints via #$interArgIsa. I.e., the #$objectActedOn or #$maleficiary of a #$StabbingSomeone *must* be known to be an instance of #$Person.  We don't presuppose that the agent doing the stabbing will always be a #$Person -- sometimes a group can be said to be the perpetrator of a stabbing event.  The stabbing itself is a #$PurposefulAction.  We assume the #$deviceUsed will be a #$Knife.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaaf0).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aaaf0,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
