x_comment(x_UniversalVocabularyMt,"This is the microtheory which contains the 'definitional' assertions about everything in Cyc's universe of discourse.  Definitional assertions about a concept are those which are intrinsic to the concept's nature and cannot be violated in any context.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaaf3).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aaaf3,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
