x_comment(x_CollectionTypeType,"A higher-order collection and an instance of #$VariedOrderCollection. Instances of #$CollectionTypeType are types of collection types, that is, collections whose instances are collections of (not necessarily first-order) collections. Thus any instance of #$FixedOrderCollection (q.v.) of order greater than or equal to 3 is a specialization of #$CollectionTypeType.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaaf6).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aaaf6,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
