x_comment(x_RatifyingAnInternationalAgreement,"A specialization of both #$RatifyingSomething and #$DiplomaticAction (qq.v.).  This is the collection of all acts of ratifying an #$InternationalAgreement.  Instances of #$RatifyingAnInternationalAgreement are typically performed by a   #$RegionalGovernment or by the #$governingBody of a #$PoliticalOrganization.  A #$GeopoliticalEntity's being one of the #$signatories with respect to an   international agreement is normally a necessary condition for ratification by the entity's government, while ratification by its government is itself normally both necessary and sufficient for a geopolitical entity's being one of the #$agreeingAgents to the agreement.  (Similar relationships hold with respect to political organizations whose governing bodies ratify international agreements.)") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaafb).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aaafb,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
