x_comment(x_executionOfPlan,"A #$MicrotheoryPredicate that relates a given instance of  #$PlanSpecificationMicrotheory to any #$PurposefulAction that  is a carrying-out of the plan in question.   (#$executionOfPlan PLANSPEC ACTION) means that ACTION is a complex event that figures as (a complete) execution of the #$Plan (q.v.)  represented by PLANSPEC.  ACTION might be reified in the PLANSPEC  microtheory itself or in some more general microtheory to which  PLANSPEC has access (via #$genlMt).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aab0a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aab0a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
