x_comment(x_GivingSomething,"A specialization of #$TransferringPossession and #$AnimalActivity.  In each instance of #$GivingSomething, one #$Agent-PartiallyTangible gives a tangible thing to another #$Agent-PartiallyTangible.  Every event that is an instance of #$GivingSomething  can also be thought of as a receiving event.  Note: The common case in which one #$Agent-PartiallyTangible gives ownership of an object to another #$Agent-PartiallyTangible is represented by the specialization #$GiftGiving.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aab0c).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aab0c,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
