x_comment(x_agentObligationInSituation,"(#$agentObligationInSituation AGENT REQUIREMENT SITUATION) means that AGENT is required to fulfill REQUIREMENT due to its involvement in SITUATION.  Note that REQUIREMENT is an element of #$Obligation. If it can not be proven that agent fulfills REQUIREMENT (see #$agentFulfillsObligation) then (#$agentViolatesObligation AGENT REQUIREMENT) is concluded.  In order to see the content of REQUIREMENT, one should look at assertions on #$ist-Obligation for the microtheory REQUIREMENT.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aab0d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aab0d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
