xc_mapping_rows(a65b16526aab0d,[]).
x_comment(x_MissionSpecificationMicrotheory,"A specialization of #$PlanSpecificationMicrotheory such that the means and ends detailed constitute the mission of a #$ModernMilitaryOrganization.  'Mission' is used here in a loose sense that accomodates both the long-term and near-term missions of a unit, and also short-term courses-of-action that might be prepared in a combat theater environment (see #$COASpecificationMicrotheory).  The collection is a specialization of both #$Plan and #$Obligation, since it is believed that a 'mission' presupposes an obligation on the part of someone to carry it out.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aab0e).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aab0e,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
