x_comment(x_EquipmentTypeForTreatmentOfAilmentTypeFn,"This #$SubTopicFunction was created to generate intelligent subtopic followups for specs of #$AilmentCondition, replacing the awkward and misleading-sounding followups that had been generated by #$EquipmentTypeForEventTypeFn. (#$EquipmentTypeForTreatmentOfAilmentTypeFn AILMENTTYPE) is the collection of all specializations of #$PhysicalDevice whose instances are used in the treatment of AILMENTTYPE. As such, the collection is #$coExtensional with (#$EquipmentTypeForEventTypeFn (#$TreatmentFn AILMENTTYPE)).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aab16).
