xc_mapping_rows(a65b16526aab17,[]).
x_comment('x_toEnsureInPlan-SitType',"(#$toEnsureInPlan-SitType PLAN SITTYPE) means that the success of the plan represented by the #$SupposedToBeMicrotheory PLAN is contingent upon a situation of type SITTYPE 'happening' or becoming true.  More colloquially, a situation of type SITTYPE is 'supposed to happen' in the course of PLAN.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aab18).
