x_comment(x_TransportationOfWeaponToTarget,"#$TransportationOfWeaponToTarget is the collection of events in which a weapon is transported to a location prior to use by some #$transporter.  For example, the delivery of an #$AerialBomb involves being flown to a place above the target and then dropping.  It is a subcollection of #$DeliveryOfWeaponToTarget.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aab1d).
