x_comment(x_visuallyAcquaintedWith,"The predicate which specifies that person X can recognize person Y's physical appearance.  (#$visuallyAcquaintedWith X Y) does not imply (#$visuallyAcquaintedWith Y X ); that is, the fact that X can recognize Y does not allow us to conclude that Y can recognize X.  X may simply have seen Y on TV, etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aab1e).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aab1e,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
