x_comment(x_friends,"(#$friends X Y) means X and Y are friends; typically they have a close relationship of reciprocal care, concern, respect, enjoyment, and mutual regard based on emotional (and/or ideological and intellectual) compatibility, shared interests, etc. Note:  In the cases of assertions of two non-human animals being friends, there may be some anthropomorphism going on.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aab1f).
