x_comment(x_DeregulatingASectorOrIndustry,"A specialization of both #$LegalProceeding and #$EconomicAction.  Each instance of #$DeregulatingASectorOrIndustry is an event in which a government removes some of the regulations governing a certain industry or economic sector.  The government's purpose in deregulating an industry or sector is usually to make that industry or sector more efficient.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aab25).
