x_comment('x_Library-Organization',"A specialization of #$ServiceOrganization.  Each instance of this collection is an organization which purchases, collects, maintains, and often lends out a collection of #$InformationBearingThings such as books, magazines, videos, audio cassettes, CDs, CD-ROMs, DVDs, etc. (see #$LibraryHoldings) for perusal by its members, or by the general public.  Instances of this collection may be organizations in their own right, or #$subOrganizations of some larger entity (such as a University). For the latter case, see the more specialized collection #$Library-Department.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aab29).
