x_comment(x_ElectricalCurrentLevel,"A specialization of #$Rate and #$PhysicalQuantity (qq.v.).  Each instance of #$ElectricalCurrentLevel is a rate of electrical flow, given in terms of the amount of charge (see the collection #$ElectricalCharge) per unit time.  The standard unit of measure (see the collection #$UnitOfMeasure) for #$ElectricalCurrentLevel is the ampere (see #$Ampere).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aab2a).
