x_comment(x_accused,"A #$BinaryRolePredicate and a specialization of #$claimsResponsible.  #$accused relates an instance of #$Accusing to an instance of #$Agent-Generic.  <code>(#$accused ACCUSING AGT)</code> means that <code>AGT</code> is the agent being accused of something in <code>ACCUSING</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aabb9).
