x_comment(x_Extortion,"A specialization of #$CoercingAnAgent, #$CriminalAct, and #$HostileSocialAction (qq.v.).  In each instance of #$Extortion, an agent extracts some kind of payment from another by threatening harm to the latter.  The payment extracted is usually a sum of money, though it might be some other kind of object (see #$objectExtorted), or it might be in the form of an action performed by the victim.\n<p>\nSpecializations of #$Extortion include #$Blackmail and #$ProtectionRacketeering.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aabd0).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aabd0,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16526aabd0,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part05.krf').
