x_comment('x_purposeOfEvent-GoalType',"This predicate relates actions to their purposes. <code>(#$purposeOfEvent-GoalType ACTION GOALTYPE)</code> means that the purpose of <code>ACTION</code> is <code>GOALTYPE</code>.  Typically, actions will inherit purposes from the purpose that the performer has in carrying out the action, see #$purposeInEvent-GoalType and #$purposeInEvent.  See documentation on these preds for discussion of these issues.  Also see #$purposeOfEvent which relates a formula, i.e. the goal statement, to an event.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aabf3).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aabf3,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
