x_comment(x_products,"<code>(#$products EV OBJ)</code> means that <code>OBJ</code> is one of the intended outputs of event <code>EV</code>.  For unintended outputs, see #$byProducts.  For a particular <code>EV</code> and <code>OBJ</code>, it will not be true that both <code>(#$products EV OBJ)</code> and <code>(#$byProducts EV OBJ)</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aac3e).
