x_comment(x_nonDeliberateCausalActors,"<code>(#$nonDeliberateCausalActors EVENT ACTOR)</code> means that <code>ACTOR</code> is the cause or the most important causal factor in bringing about <code>EVENT</code>, but that <code>ACTOR</code> does not act deliberately in so doing.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aac40).
