x_comment(x_properSubSituationTypes,"A #$FirstOrderCollectionPredicate that is a specialization of #$subSituationTypes (q.v.) and a type-level correlate of #$properSubSituations (q.v.). This predicate is used to state that situations of one given type always have situations of another given type as proper subsituations. <code>(#$properSubSituationTypes SITTYPE SUBSITTYPE)</code> means that <code>SITTYPE</code> (a specialization of #$Situation) has the specialization of #$Situation <code>SUBSITTYPE</code> as a proper subsituation type.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aac41).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aac41,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
