x_comment(x_physicalDecompositions,"<code>(#$physicalDecompositions WHOLE PART)</code> means that <code>PART</code> is a spatial part or component of <code>WHOLE</code>, in a very broad sense of 'part' whereby <code>PART</code> might or might not be spatially continuous or discrete.  Thus <code>PART</code> might be discontinuous, or even diffused throughout <code>WHOLE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aac4c).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aac4c,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
