x_comment(x_buyingPerformer,"<code>(#$buyingPerformer COM AGENT)</code> means that <code>AGENT</code> is the agent actually attempting to obtain goods or services in a purchase, by performing an active role in the #$CommercialActivity <code>COM</code>.  Generally, the agent who is the #$buyingPerformer is identical with the #$buyer, but in some cases the #$buyingPerformer is instead a #$buyingAgent representing the #$buyer.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aace4).
