x_comment(x_DeployingAChemicalOrBiologicalAgent,"The collection of all purposeful #$DistributionEvents in which an #$IntelligentAgent deploys a #$BiochemicallyHarmfulSubstance via dispersal into the air, into water, our into a food supply.  Under ordinary circumstances we can reasonably infer that this will be done as part of a #$WeaponOfMassDestructionAttack on some group of opponents, either civilian or military.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aacf2).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aacf2,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
