x_comment(x_ControllingFn,"A unary #$ReifiableFunction used to denote the collection of events in which an agent controls some specific type of object. <code>(#$ControllingFn OBJ-TYPE)</code> denotes the specialization of #$ControllingSomething in which some instance(s) of <code>OBJ-TYPE</code> is controlled (where <code>OBJ-TYPE</code> is an instance of #$ExistingObjectType and a specialization of #$PartiallyTangible). Examples include the use of a spoon, the driving of a car and the disciplining of a child.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aad16).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aad16,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
