x_comment(x_objectControlled,"This predicate is used to indicate that a particular object is being controlled in a particular event.  <code>(#$objectControlled EVENT OBJ)</code> means that the object <code>OBJ</code> is being controlled in the #$Event <code>EVENT</code>.\nNote: #$objectControlled does not assume or require physical contact between controller and object controlled.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aad19).
