x_comment(x_MoneyRatio,"A specialization of #$RatioQuantity (q.v.).  Each instance of #$MoneyRatio is an amount of #$MonetaryValue (q.v.) taken with respect to an amount of some other quantity: e.g. $1.14 per gallon, $10,000 per acre, $250 per week, and $0.89 per pound.  Notable specializations of #$MoneyRatio include  #$MoneyPerVolumeRatio, #$MoneyPerAreaRatio, #$MoneyPerMassRatio, and #$MonetaryRate.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aad1a).
