x_comment(x_OutdoorLocation,"A specialization of #$GeographicalRegion (q.v.).  Each instance of #$OutdoorLocation is a region of outdoor space; i.e. a region that is directly subject to atmospheric weather.  Thus, the collection #$OutdoorLocation does <i>not</i> include as instances any instances of #$UnderwaterLocation (q.v.) or any places that are underground (see #$Underground).  Specializations of #$OutdoorLocation include #$MountainRange, #$Stream, and #$Highway.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aad24).
