x_comment(x_hasVulnerability,"<code>(#$hasVulnerability OBJECT VULNERABILITY)</code> means that the #$Individual <code>OBJECT</code> has a weakness (i.e. #$VulnerableObjectType) <code>VULNERABILITY</code>, which if exploited would result in adverse effects for <code>OBJECT</code>. This predicate expresses the notion that something simply has a vulnerability, where the kind of exploit and the kind of adverse effects are left open. It is a specialization of #$hasPassiveCapability.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aad35).
