x_comment('x_Password-Computer',"A collection of #$CharacterStrings. Each #$Password-Computer is a #$CharacterString that a user inputs to a #$Computer (usually in conjunction with a #$Username (q.v.)) that verifies to a program running on the computer that the user is who he claims to be. Note that an instance of #$Password-Computer is an abstract #$CharacterString, and not something with temporal extent like a sequence of keystrokes or the representation of those keystrokes inside the computer. The process of entering a valid #$Username and #$Password-Computer constitutes #$LoggingInOnAComputer or #$LoggingInToAComputerProgram (qq.v.). A #$Password-Computer is typically between 4 and 10 characters long.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aad36).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aad36,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
