x_comment(x_PersonTypeByNationality,"A collection of collections. Each instance of #$PersonTypeByNationality is the collection of all people who are citizens of some country, or who are participants in its #$NationalCulture to some significant degree -- or else are instances of #$StatelessPerson. Instances include #$UnitedStatesPerson, #$FrenchPerson, and #$AustralianCitizenOrSubject.  See also the first-order collection #$PersonWithNationality.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aad45).
