x_comment(x_Sightseeing,"A specialization of #$VisitingASite.  Instances of #$Sightseeing are events in which people travel around a geographic location (e.g., a city), visiting the notable sites (e.g., landmarks, museums, zoo, ...) there.  This collection does not include more participatory activities, such as going to the beach to swim or tan, running with the bulls in Spain, attending a play, opera, movie, ... unless those activities are strictly aimed at tourists, e.g., riding a camel in front of the pyramids.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aad46).
