x_comment(x_FrequentPerformerFn,"A unary #$ReifiableFunction that takes a specialization of #$Action and returns the collection of #$Persons who play #$performedBy roles in instances of that type of action with significant #$Frequency.  (What counts as \"significant frequency\" depends on the context.)  For example, <code>(#$FrequentPerformerFn #$Running)</code> denotes the collection of people who perform instances of #$Running with significant frequency -- i.e., the collection  #$Runner.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aad4a).
