x_comment(x_NaturalGas,"An instance of #$ChemicalSubstanceType and a specialization of #$FossilFuel and #$NaturalTangibleStuff.  Each instance of this collection is some amount of natural gas (including the gaseous form and Liquefied Natural Gas or LNG), the gas used in home appliances, etc.  This collection includes as specializations unrefined natural gas and refined natural gas.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aad8b).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aad8b,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
