x_comment(x_ventureCapital,"This is the predicate used to relate a #$CommercialOrganization or other #$IntelligentAgent to the amount of venture capital (some #$MonetaryValue) that has been invested by outside investors to start the company. (#$ventureCapital AGENT AMOUNT) means the AMOUNT of venture capital that has been invested in the AGENT.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aad97).
