x_comment(x_SchemaObjectFn,"If ODS is an instance of #$ObjectDefiningSchema and INDEXICAL is an instance of #$PhysicalFieldIndexical, then (#$SchemaObjectFn ODS INDEXICAL) is equal to *the* object defined by ODS which is indexed by INDEXICAL.  This function is often used in #$fieldDecoding sentences in which the physical field value is itself an object defined by ODS or another schema.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aad9a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aad9a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
