x_comment(x_doOutputCommentString,"(#$doOutputCommentString HACKER FILE STRING) means that the HACKER adds the comment \nstring STRING to the end of FILE. This method should be decomposed differently in\nspecific programming domains depending on that language's style of comment. For\ninstance, in the C language comments are bracketed by \"/*\" and \"*/\", and in\nlisp programs comments are preceded by a \";\" on each line.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aadcc).
