x_comment(x_TypedVariableFn,"(#$TypedVariableFn DATATYPE NAME) denotes a variable called NAME, that\nis of type TYPE. This function allows the variable to wear its type on\nits sleeve. This notion of type need not be represented in the language\nof the program in which the denoted variable is used.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aadf8).
