x_comment('x_syndromePartTypes-Disjunctive',"(#$syndromePartTypes-Disjunctive SYN-TYPE COND-TYPE) means that instances of the #$SurveillanceSyndrome SYN-TYPE are sometimes partly constituted by instances of the #$PhysiologicalCondition COND-TYPE. For example, some, but not all instances of #$BIOS-URISurveillanceSyndrome have (#$PainInFn #$NasalSinus) as a #$subSituations. If every instance of SYN-TYPE has some instance of COND-TYPE as a #$subSituations, then the relation between should be stated using #$syndromePartTypes. See #$SharedNoteAboutDefiningSurveillanceSyndromes.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aae11).
