x_comment('x_Catnip-Plant',"The collection of all instances of the plant catnip. It is\nmost frequently taken by humans in the form of a hot infusion to\nrelieve a variety of physical discomforts. It is soothing to the\nnervous system and calming to the stomache. The leaves of this plant\nare dried to protect the essential oils. About 80% of cats are highly\nattracted to the odor of catnip, and will chew it, roll in it, and rub\nagainst it to release the oils.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aae24).
