x_comment(x_pathogenMobExposedTo,"(#$pathogenMobExposedTo EXPOSURE MOB) means that during #$ExposureToPathogen EXPOSURE, at least one instance of #$Organism-Whole, (which plays the role #$organismExposed during EXPOSURE) was exposed to a #$MicroorganismMob MOB in such a manner that effective transmission of MOB to the #$organismExposed is possible.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aae3e).
