x_comment(x_epidemicExposureOccursAt,"(#$epidemicExposureOccursAt EPI LOC) means that the #$Epidemic EPI is the result of an #$ExposureToHarmfulSubstance whose spatial extent is #$EnduringThing-Localized LOC. Epidemiologists investigating an #$InfectiousDiseaseEpidemic try to determine if there is a single source of the pathogen responsible for the outbreak. If there is, they try to determine where and under what circumstances animals/people were exposed to the source of the pathogen. Gafs using #$epidemicExposureOccursAt represent the location of the exposure event responsible for a given #$Epidemic.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aae42).
