x_comment('x_ComplexQuestion-IBT',"The collection of all instances of #$InformationRequest-IBT which take the grammatical form of yes/no questions, but which are actually two or more yes/no questions lumped together.  Such questions are usually posed in error, or in an attempt to trick the listener into providing conflicting or damning information.  An example, \"Have you stopped beating your wife?\"") :- x_cid(a65b16526aae74).
