x_comment(x_jobHolder,"(#$jobHolder JOB AGENT) means that AGENT holds the particular job, JOB.  This distinguishes different instances of #$JobPosition, hence two different electricians working at the same time hold two different instances of the subtype of  #$JobPosition, (#$OccupationTypeFn #$Electrician).  Note that we want to be able to specify, using binary predicates where a person holds a job, whether the job is filled or open, the number of jobs of a given type that are open at a company, etc.  Hence, it becomes easier to use #$JobPosition.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaeab).
