x_comment(x_transitiveViaArgExceptions,"A #$QuintaryPredicate used to state exceptions to the applicability of #$transitiveViaArg assertions.   (#$transitiveViaArgInverse THING FORMULA PRED BINPRED N)) means that the Nth argument position of PRED is \"transitive\" with respect to BINPRED except when THING (or a constant that stands in the relation BINPRED to THING) occurs as the Nth argument to PRED in a GAF whose arguments are otherwise identical to those of FORMULA.  See also #$transitiveViaArgInverseExceptions.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaefd).
