x_comment(x_dressState,"The predicate #$dressState is used to describe the state of dress or undress that a particular animal (usually a person) is in.  (#$dressState PERSON DRESS) means that PERSON is a member of the \n\ninstance of #$PersonTypeByClothingState DRESS.  DRESS indicates what portion of PERSON's body is clothed.  For example, (#$dressState John \n\n#$FullyClothed) means that John is fully clothed (during the \n\napplicable period of time).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaf41).
