x_comment(x_coDecompositions,"This predicate relates tangibles that are \n\ncontinuous or discontinuous physical parts (see \n\n#$physicalDecompositions) of the same whole.\n\n(#$coDecompositions PART1 PART2) means that there\n\nis some tangible WHOLE such that \n\n(#$physicalDecompositions WHOLE PART1) and \n\n(#$physicalDecompositions WHOLE PART2) both hold.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaf59).
