x_comment(x_AnimalTypeByVaccinationStatus,"A collection of collections that describe an individual as\nbeing either vaccinated or unvaccinated against some particular\ndisease or virus.  This is a strange collection, as one cannot simply\nbe vaccinated or unvaccinated.  Rather, one must be vaccinated or\nunvaccinated against some particular #$AilmentCondition.  Unless the ailment in question is clear from the context one should not use the binary #$hasPhysiologicalFeature to ascribe vaccination status.  Rather, one should use a ternary predicate that relates an organism an ailment condition and a vaccination status such that the relation holds just in case the organism has that status with respect to the ailment condition.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aaf8a).
