x_comment(x_TransportationAccommodationType,"A collection of collections, each instance of which represents some degree of luxury which is experienced by the passengers who are recieving such accommodations during their travels.  For instance, #$FirstClass-TravelClass is the collection of first class travel accommodations.  This is not based in how they experience their journey, but rather, it is based on the classification given the accommodation by the company providing it.  A concrete example of a use of one of the members of this collection is (#$TravelingByClassFn (#$TravelingByMeansOfPathMediumFn #$Railway) #$FirstClass-TravelClass), which denotes the collection of all railway traveling events that with first-class seating.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aafb5).
