x_comment(x_GovernmentAffiliatedInformationDesignation,"A subcollection of #$InformationDesignation.  Instances of\nthis collection are attributes of information.  Specifically, they are designations of information\nthat are, or could be, used by governments, coalitions that are formed between governments, or \nbetween a government and other political groups to specify the conditions under which information of interest \nor use to them can be accessed.  For instance, if a government contracted with the political group\nAmnesty International for a foreign (or domestic) operation that required access to protected information,\nthey might designate such information in order to manage and enforce its application, accessibility, and use.\nIn this case, the designations of the information would be instances of #$GovernmentAffilitatedInformationDesignation. \nNote that the designation scheme might borrow from preexisting schemes that the government might already use, although it\ncould also include novel naming conventions to prevent mis-application and confusion about the scope of the\ndesignations: 'Classified-AmnestySecret', \nfor instance.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aafc2).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526aafc2,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
