x_comment(x_MunsellHue,"A collection of attributes of colors used in the Munsell system of color classification. #$MunsellHue, together with #$MunsellChroma and #$MunsellBrightness, comprise three dimensions which are adequate for the classification of colors. In Cyc, #$MunsellHue is partitioned into ten groups, each of which is associated with a family of colors (see, for example, #$MunsellRedHue). #$MunsellHues within a particular group are denoted by means of a functional expression that corresponds to that group (e.g. for #$MunsellRedHue there is #$MunsellRedFn).") :- x_cid(a65b16526aafd5).
