x_comment(x_successor,"A binary functional predicate that corresponds to the function #$SuccessorFn (q.v.). (#$successor N M) means that #$Integer M is #$Integer N's successor.  In other words, (#$successor N M) means that M is the least integer greater than N.  Thus, (#$successor 42 43) holds, as does (#$successor -42 -41). ") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab2e2).
