x_comment(x_doProgramStep,"A ternary complex action predicate. (#$doProgramStep PROGRAMMER FILE STEP) means that PROGRAMMER appends code to the end of FILE that\nimplements STEP, in the programming language determined by the current context.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab2e7).
