x_comment('x_Currency-SocialPracticeFn',"A unary function, which takes as its argument a function which is an instance of #$UnitOfMoney, and returns an instance of #$DevisedPracticeOrWork (more specifically, it returns an instance of #$Money-DevisedPractice), which is the currency concerned qua social institution -- the many and varied practices which underpin the use of that particular currency in particular contexts, and which came into being at a particular time and place. (Contrast this with instances of #$MonetaryValue which, as #$ScalarIntervals, are timeless, abstract entities.) Thus (#$Currency-SocialPracticeFn #$Dollar-Australia) is the Australian dollar as a devised social institution: created by Australians, sustained by them (as well as, increasingly, by international investors) insofar as they use it in a variety of particular contexts, and whose future is unknown.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab2ec).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526ab2ec,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
