x_comment(x_hasMentalFeatures,"The predicate #$hasMentalFeatures is used to indicate some mental state or capacity of a particular person.  (#$hasMentalFeatures PERSON FEAT) means that the sentient-animal person PERSON is characterized by (i.e. is an instance of) the #$PersonTypeByMentalFeature FEAT.  For example, #$BobbyFischer #$hasMentalFeatures #$HighIntelligence.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab342).
