x_comment(x_IneffectiveForPurpose,"An instance of #$COAEvaluationEffectivenessPredicate. In its intended use, it\ncharacterizes a type of action, event or state of affairs that is seen as impeding\nan agent's goals: this sort of relation can be expressed by a clause of the\nform (#$ineffectiveForPurpose ACT-TYPE PURPOSE-SENT). Clearly, in a planning context we would expect\nparts of plan not to be #$ineffectiveForPurpose, except perhaps if balanced\nby other #$effectiveForPurpose parts of the same plan.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab36a).
