x_comment('x_protector-Generic',"(#$protector-Generic PROTECT-SIT THING) says that THING is, intentionally or not, protecting, or keeping something safe during PROTECT-ACT. Depending on the nature of PROTECT-SIT, THING could be a bomb-shelter keeping its occupants safe, a turtle's shell keeping a turtle safe, or a person taking steps to keep someone out of harm's way.  If THING is an agent acting intentionally, then (#$protector-Agentive PROTECT-SIT THING).") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab36c).
