x_comment(x_memberOfList,"A binary predicate that relates each one of the things in a given #$List to the list itself.  #$memberOfList is thus analogous to #$elementOf: whereas the latter relates a set to its members, this predicate relates a list to its members.  (#$memberOfList MEMBER LIST) means that MEMBER appears at least once (perhaps multiple times) in LIST.   For example, (#$TheList A B C B) is related by #$memberOfList to each of its three members: A, B, and C.  See also #$SetOfListMembersFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab42d).
