x_comment(x_MalformedInputFn,"(#$MalformedInputFn PROGRAM) denotes the collection of all instances of #$CharacterString which would count as malformed input to the computer program PROGRAM in some context (i.e. causing the program to break down or to behave in a way it was not designed to).  A common source of malformed input is the so-called \"shell metacharacters\" (e.g. ']', '{', '$', '\\n'). Sending carefully crafted malformed input to selected programs is a common  hacker strategy.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab45f).
