x_comment('x_rowCount-SKS',"(#$rowCount-SKS SOURCE COUNT) means that the\nstructured knowledge source SOURCE has COUNT number of raw tuples\n(e.g. rows in a database or entries in a hash table). At the\nprocedural  level, the row count of a knowledge source determines the\ncost of querying  that knowledge source with a fully unbound query.\nSee also #$resultSetCardinality, which is a more expressive relation\nused in cost estimates.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab49e).
