x_comment('x_temporallySubsumes-InsType',"A binary #$TemporalPredicate that relates a #$TemporalThing to a type of #$TimeInterval or #$QualitativeTimeOfDay (q.v.) an instance of which the thing temporally subsumes.  (#$temporallySubsumes-InsType TEMP INTERVAL-TYPE) means that TEMP #$temporallySubsumes (q.v.) some instance of INTERVAL-TYPE.\n<p>\nFor example, '(#$temporallySubsumes-InsType FredsBoyhood #$CalendarDecade)' means that Fred's boyhood subsumed a decade.\n<p>\nSee also #$temporallySubsumedBy-InsType and #$temporallySubsumedBy-TypeType.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab4ab).
