x_comment(x_evaluatableAlongSubDimensions,"A binary predicate used to assert dependency relationships among instances of #$EvaluationDimension. (#$evaluatableAlongSubDimensions DEP IND) says that the value of ?DEPVAL in (DEP ARG1 ?DEPVAL) is dependent to some degree on (IND ARG1 INDVAL).  So, if (evaluatableAlongSubDimension DEP SUB1) and (evaluatableAlongSubDimension DEP SUB2), where SUB1 and SUB2 are the only known subdimensions for DEP, then if (SUB1 PLAN VAL) and (SUB2 PLAN VAL), where VAL is the #$EvaluativeAttribute for the plan PLAN along SUB1 and SUB2 it will follow that (DEP PLAN VAL).") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab4c5).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526ab4c5,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
