x_comment(x_functionPreservesConstraints,"A predicate that denotes a relation which may hold between predicate denoting functions and the constraints on the predicates they take as arguments.  (#$functionPreservesConstraints FUNC PRED) means that the constraints placed by PRED on any predicate REL given to FUNC as an argument are also placed on the denotatum of (FUNC REL).  For example, (#$functionPreservesConstraints #$ComplexActionFn #$argIsa) means that if (#$and (#$natFunction ?NAT #$ComplexActionFn) (#$natArgument ?NAT 1 ?PRED) (#$argIsa ?PRED ?NUM ?THING)), then (#$argIsa ?NAT ?NUM ?THING).") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab518).
