x_comment(x_SituationTypeTernaryRolePlayedInFn,"#$SituationTypeTernaryRolePlayedInFn is a ternary function that returns a collection of events when given two temporal things and a ternary role as arguments.  (#$SituationTypeTernaryRolePlayedInFn ACTOR1 ACTOR2 ROLE) denotes the specialization of #$Situation which consists of all and only the events in which ACTOR1 plays ROLE with ACTOR1.  For example, (#$SituationTypeTernaryRolePlayedInFn #$GeorgeWBush #$GeorgeHWBush #$objectsInContact) denotes the collection of situations in which George W. Bush is in physical contact with George H. W. Bush.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab52c).
