x_comment(x_visibleFeatureOfObject,"A specialized form of the predicate #$isa. (visibleFeatureOfObject OBJECT FEATURE) means that OBJECT shares the visible feature that all instances of FEATURE share. For example, all instances of #$Red are red in color, so (visibleFeatureOfObject #$JohnsCar #$Red) means that John's car is mainly or entirely red. This is the most general of the visible feature predicates; for more specialized predicates see e.g. #$mainColorOfObject and #$uniformColorOfObject.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab534).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526ab534,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
