x_comment(x_ExploitableFromSystemFn,"(#$hasVulnerability COMPUTER (#$ExploitableFromSystemFn VULNERABILITY SYSTEM)) means that COMPUTER has the #$ComputerVulnerabilityAttribute VULNERABILITY and, furthermore, this vulnerability may be exploited by anyone logged in to the #$AccountSystem SYSTEM.   For example, (#$hasVulnerability #$Crystal-Cyc-Com (#$ExploitableFromSystemFn #$VulnerableBecauseOfReadableMail #$CycorpLANAccountSystem-Windows)) means that email stored on #$Crystal-Cyc-Com may be subject to unauthorized access from anywhere in the Cycorp Windows #$AccountSystem.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab53d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526ab53d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
