x_comment('x_keIrrelevantPrecisionSuggestion-TermGenl',"(#$keIrrelevantPrecisionSuggestion-TermGenl TERM) says\nthe precision suggestor should never offer to generalize over TERM.  So for example, if a SME asserts, (#$genls TERM COLL) for some #$Collection COLL, the precision suggestor should not offer to replace TERM with any of its specs.\n Likewise, if (#$keIrrelevantPrecisionSuggestion-TermGenl PRED), and a SME asserts (#$relationAllExists PRED COL1 COL2), the precision suggestor should not\n offer to replace PRED with any of its #$genlPreds.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab564).
