x_comment(x_TelephoneSubscriberLine,"The collection of all telephone lines rented, purchased, or otherwise subscribed to by organizations or people.  The only communications along an instance of #$TelephoneSubscriberLine are to or from a telephone with a telephone number associated with that line.  Often, the line is a physical #$TelephoneWire between the residence or place of business (see #$TelephoneLandLine).  However, a physical wire might be multiplexed (or used in some other way) to carry several different #$TelephoneSubscriberLines.  A fiber-optic cable might carry a #$TelephoneSubscriberLine for your house as well as television signals.  This collection also includes subscriber lines for cell phones.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab566).
