x_comment(x_TransformerSubstation,"A specialization of #$ConstructionArtifact.  Each instance of #$TransformerSubstation is a complex in which large transformers convert high voltage to low voltage, or vice versa.  Transformer substations between instances of #$PowerGenerationComplex and #$ElectricPowerGrid (qq.v.) convert voltage to extremely high voltages for long-distance transmission. Transformer substations farther from generation facilities step voltage down for safe distribution to consumers.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab5a5).
