x_comment(x_pathFollowsPath,"(#$pathFollowsPath P1 P2) means that the path P1 follows essentially the same course as the path P2 over some apprecialble extent of its length. This predicate may be used to describe situations in which P1 and P2 are partially overlapping (cf. #$overlappingPaths, #$subPaths-Spatial), as well as cases in which one path merely parallels the other for some distance (cf. #$alignedAlongLength).") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab5a9).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526ab5a9,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
