x_comment(x_sourceAssumptions,"This predicate relates a #$StructuredKnowledgeSource to the\n#$Microtheorys that contain the concepts needed to interpret the\nsource.  That is, (#$sourceAssumptions SOURCE MT) means that MT\ncontains meta information that is required to interpret the contents\nof SOURCE in CycL.  If CONTENT is the #$contentMt of SOURCE, then it\nshould always be provable that (#$genlMt CONTENT MT).") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab5b3).
