x_comment(x_accountName,"A predicate that relates computer accounts to their name-strings (as listed in the 'etc/passwd' file). (#$accountName ACCOUNT NAME) means that the #$ComputerAccount ACCOUNT's name-string is NAME. Note that very occasionally it can be sensible to have more than one name-string for a given account (i.e. an account with a given UID). For instance, in cases such as UUCP, the superuser account, one sometimes wants to give multiple people access to the same account, but to track their activities via the audit trail. See also #$groupName, #$accountFullName.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab5c5).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526ab5c5,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
