x_comment(x_CreationTypeByMethod,"Each instance of #$CreationTypeByMethod is a spec of PhysicalCreationEvent which is characterized by a particular method for the creation of the output.  Examples include #$Assembling, #$Mixing and #$Extruding.  Instances of CreationTypeByMethod are generally agnostic as to the type of thing created and the materials used, as much as they can be within the constraints of the creation method -- e.g., you can't really assemble liquids or extrude powder.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab607).
