x_comment(x_AggregateSituationTypeFn,"(#$AggregateSituationTypeFn SIT-TYPE) denotes the collection of situations whose instances are composed (a la #$subSituations) of multiple instances of SIT-TYPE.  The denoted collection is agnostic as to whether its instances are composed of serially-occurring instances of SIT-TYPE, instances which occur in parallel, or some mix thereof.  The genls of the denoted collection is determined by the value for AG-TYPE in (#$typeAggregatesIntoType SIT-TYPE AG-SIT-TYPE).") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab613).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526ab613,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
