x_comment(x_aggregateSituationTypeByRole,"(#$aggregateSituationTypeByRole SIT-TYPE ROLE AG-TYPE) means that AG-TYPE is a collection of situations, each instance of which is an aggregate of 2 or more instances of SIT-TYPE in which different objects play ROLE.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab617).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526ab617,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
