x_comment('x_QuadraticSolution-PositiveFn',"(#$QuadraticSolution-PositiveFn a b c) returns the positive-form solution of the quadratic equation the coefficients of which are, respectively, a b and c: thus the value returned is the quotient of (-b + (SqrtFn (b^2 - 4ac))) and 2a. Because of limitations in handling of #$ComplexNumber, this function is restricted to #$RealNumber solutions, i.e. it returns a value only if (b^2 - 4ac) is greater than or equal to 0.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab87c).
