xc_mapping_rows(a65b16526ab8ce,[]).
x_comment(x_equilibriumConstantOfReaction,"(#$equilibriumConstantOfReaction R-TYPE VALUE) means that VALUE is the equilibrium constant for R-TYPE, a specialization of #$ChemicalReaction individuated by a particular reaction equation. When reactants and products are all in solution, this constant is the result of dividing the product of the concentrations of the compounds produced in R-TYPE by the product of the concentrations of the compounds reacting in R-TYPE, where each of these concentrations is raised to a power equal to the respective coefficient in the balanced equation.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab8cf).
xc_microtheory(a65b16526ab8cf,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
