x_comment(x_mathematicalStructureOfCW,"#$mathematicalStructureOfCW relates a #$StructurallySpecificWork to the unique #$StructuredInformationSource that is its mathematical structure.  This is a different notion from the information structure (c.f. #$infoStructureOfCW) of a work; a particular #$List-CW, for example, might have an info-structure that consists of the complete sequence of characters that were used in composing it.  That list's *mathematical* structure, on the other hand, is a mathematical #$Tuple (indeed, a #$List) that consists in the ordering of items referred to by the string-sequences that make up the info-structure of that list.  Though a given work might undergo change, and so have different a different mathematical structure at different times, it cannot have more than one structure at any given point.") :- x_cid(a65b16526ab8e6).
