x_comment(x_uniqueFieldList,"(#$uniqueFieldList PS LIST) means that (i) every member of LIST is a physical \nfield of PS, (ii) no two tuples from a knowledge source associated with PS via \n#$physicalSchemaSourceMap can have the same values for all physical fields in \nLIST. (Note that null values may not be considered  equal in this consideration. \nThat means, even in the presence of a unique constraint, it may be possible to \nstore an unlimited number of rows that contain a null value in at least one of the \nconstrained columns. This behavior conforms to the SQL standard, but some SQL \ndatabases may not follow this rule.)") :- x_cid(a65b16526aba5f).
