x_comment('x_TimeInPosition-Obligation',"The collection of #$Obligations which specify the time interval during which someone who becomes a #$PersonTypeByPositionInOrg is expected/allowed to retain that position. While the length of the #$Obligation is determined by some #$Agreement, there are many contexts in which the #$Person is not an #$agreeingAgents; for example, the US president's term is goverend by the #$USConstitution, but that's an #$Agreement between the US government and #$ThePublic (or something), not with (say) #$BillClinton. Hence, (#$genls #$TimeInPosition-Obligation #$Agreement) is often false. If someone agrees to accept an #$AppointedOffice, that obligation might or might not genls to #$Agreement, depending on how the term of office is determined.") :- x_cid(a65b16526aba68).
